('page', 0, 74, 1458, 'en', 0, '<!-- ========================================\r\n     STATES AND UNION TERRITORIES PAGE\r\n     Updated with latest data as of 23rd Jan 2026\r\n     Theme Colors Only: Orange (#FF9800) and Blue (#0063ae)\r\n     ======================================== --><section class=\"container py-5\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\"><div class=\"content-section\"><h2 class=\"mb-5\" style=\"background-color:#ff9e0f;border-radius:8px;color:white;margin-bottom:30px;padding:15px 20px;text-align:center;\"><a style=\"color:#ffffff;\" href=\"/accreditation-qips\"><strong>For Accreditation &amp; QIP Click Here&nbsp;</strong></a></h2><!-- Overview Section --><div class=\"mb-5\" style=\"background-color:#003b73;border-radius:8px;color:white;padding:30px;\"><h2 style=\"color:white;margin-bottom:15px;\"><strong>Engagement with States/UTs</strong></h2><p style=\"color:white;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.6;margin:0;\"><strong>Overview:</strong> The Capacity Building Commission engages closely with States and Union Territories to support implementation of capacity-building initiatives. Dedicated team under Mission Karmayogi have been assigned to facilitate coordination and implementation at the State/UT level.</p></div><!-- At-a-Glance Summary --><div class=\"mb-5\"><h2 style=\"background-color:#FF9800;border-radius:8px;color:white;margin-bottom:20px;padding:15px 20px;text-align:center;\"><strong>At-a-Glance Summary</strong></h2><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table\" style=\"border:2px solid #FF9800;\"><thead style=\"background-color:#ffe3ab;\"><tr><th style=\"border-color:#ddd;padding:15px;text-align:center;\">Total States/UTs engaged</th><th style=\"border-color:#ddd;padding:15px;text-align:center;\">Number of MoUs signed</th><th style=\"border-color:#ddd;padding:15px;text-align:center;\">No. of Workshops conducted in States/UTs (Online + Offline)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"background-color:#fff9f0;\"><td style=\"border-co