><div class=\"mission-content\"><h4 class=\"fw-bold text-center mb-0\">Enable Creating optimal learning opportunities for each civil servant with the objective to build an agile and future ready public service learning for all</h4></div></div></div></div></div><!-- Mandate Section --><div class=\"mandate-section mb-5\"><div class=\"text-center mb-5\"><h2 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Mandate of the Commission</h2><div class=\"title-underline mx-auto mb-4\">&nbsp;</div><p class=\"text-muted\">The key responsibilities that drive our mission</p></div><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-list fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h5 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Capacity Building Plans</h5><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Facilitate preparation of Capacity Building Plans of ministries, departments, organizations and states/UTs</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-university fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h5 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Training Institutions</h5><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Functional supervision over all training Institutions involved in capacity building of civil servants</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-alt fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h5 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Annual Report</h5><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Prepare and present CBC\'s Annual Report to the Prime Minister\'s HR Council</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h5 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Policy Recommendations</h5><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Make Policy recommendations to DoPT on personnel/ HR and Capacity Building</p></div></d