e-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Policy Recommendations</h3><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Make Policy recommendations to DoPT on personnel/ HR and Capacity Building</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-bar fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">HR Audit</h3><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Audit of Human Resources in Government and outcomes of the Capacity Building efforts</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-users fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Knowledge Partners</h3><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Approve Knowledge Partners and Content Validation mechanism for training of civil servants</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html'),
