('page', 0, 76, 122, 'en', 0, '<!-- Strategic Objectives Section --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-vision-section\" style=\"padding:50px 0;\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:30px;text-align:left;\"><i class=\"bi bi-bullseye me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;\"></i>Strategic Objectives of Amrit Gyaan Kosh</h2><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-left:4px solid #28a745;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);height:100%;padding:25px;\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;display:flex;margin-bottom:15px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.3rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">Establish a structured, digital knowledge hub for case studies and best practices.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-left:4px solid #28a745;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);height:100%;padding:25px;\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;display:flex;margin-bottom:15px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.3rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">Promote adoption of case-based learning within India\'s public administration training ecosystem.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-left:4px solid #28a745;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);height:100%;padding:25px;\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;display:flex;margin-bottom:15px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.3rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">Enhance civil services training programs with engaging, real-world learning materials.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-left:4px solid #28a745;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);height:100%;padding:25px;\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;display:flex;margin-bottom:15px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.3rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">Strengthen case writing and teaching capabilities among faculty at CTIs and ATIs.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-left:4px solid #28a745;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);height:100%;padding:25px;\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;display:flex;margin-bottom:15px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.3rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">Facilitate the use of India-centric case studies on national and international platforms.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-left:4px solid #28a745;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);height:100%;padding:25px;\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;display:flex;margin-bottom:15px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.3rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">Encourage government officials to document and share innovations, fostering peer learning.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Core Principles Section --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth\" style=\"background-color:#f8f9fa;padding:50px 0;\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:30px;text-align:left;\"><i class=\"bi bi-shield-check me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;\"></i>Core Principles of the Case Studies</h2><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large mb-4\" style=\"text-align:left;\">Each case study is developed based on the following key principles:</p><div class=\"row g-4 mt-2\"><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-icon\" style=\"background-color:#0099ff;\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-check\"></i></div><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-title\">Relevant</div><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-label\">Current and contemporary, ideally not older than three years</div></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-icon\" style=\"background-color:#20c997;\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i></div><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-title\">Relatable</div><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-label\">The learnings should connect to the learner\'s daily life and experiences</div></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-icon\" style=\"background-color:#ffc107;\"><i class=\"bi bi-tools\"></i></div><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-title\">Applicable</div><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-label\">The insights gained should be practical and actionable for the learner</div></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-icon\" style=\"background-color:#e74c3c;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-repeat\"></i></div><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-title\">Scalable</div><div class=\"karmayogi-milestone-label\">The solution presented should be a replicable model</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Process of Case Study Creation Section --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-vision-section\" style=\"padding:50px 0;\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:25px;text-align:left;\"><i class=\"bi bi-diagram-3 me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;\"></i>Process of Case Study Creation</h2><div style=\"background-color:#f8f9fa;border-left:4px solid #0063ae;border-radius:10px;padding:25px;\"><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.8;margin:0;\">The process of creating case studies for Amrit Gyaan Kosh follows a structured methodology:</p></div></div></div></section><!-- Key Milestones and Activities Section --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth\" style=\"background-color:#f8f9fa;padding:50px 0;\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:35px;text-align:left;\"><i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;\"></i>Key Milestones and Activities</h2><div class=\"mt-4\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);margin-bottom:30px;padding:30px;\"><h3 style=\"align-items:center;color:#002b5b;display:flex;font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard-fill me-2\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:1.2rem;\"></i>1. Capacity Building through Workshops</strong></h3><ul class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"list-style:none;margin:0;padding-left:0;\"><li class=\"mb-3\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:15px;\"><p><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-event me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i></p><div><strong style=\"color:#0063ae;\">April 2024:</strong> Organised a 3-day Case Teaching Workshop in collaboration with Harvard Business School for 30 faculty members from Central Training Institutes (CTIs) and Administrative Training Institutes (ATIs).</div></li><li class=\"mb-3\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:15px;\"><p><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-event me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i></p><div><strong style=\"color:#0063ae;\">December 2024:</strong> Conducted a 5-day Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshop in partnership with Stanford LAD, Asian Development Bank (ADB), and ADBI for 60 faculty members from CTIs/ATIs. Over 50 case studies were developed by participants and 7 faculty mentors from top institutions like IITs guided participants through the writing process.</div></li><li class=\"mb-3\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:15px;\"><p><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-event me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i></p><div><strong style=\"color:#0063ae;\">September 2025:</strong> In September 2025, the Second Edition of the Advanced Case Writing Workshop was conducted for 75 new faculty members from CTIs and ATIs, organised across three cohorts in different cities of India. The programme was led by instructors from Stanford LAD and IIT Delhi with support from ADB and ADBI, while 10 mentors from the December 2024 batch returned as Faculty Mentors to guide and support participants in their case writing journey.</div></li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-4\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);margin-bottom:30px;padding:30px;\"><h3 style=\"align-items:center;color:#002b5b;display:flex;font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-file-earmark-text-fill me-2\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:1.2rem;\"></i>2. Case Publication and Reach</strong></h3><div class=\"row g-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">55 cases are currently live on IGOT.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">~100 cases targeted for December 2025.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">~200 cases projected by 2026.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">10 cases are being co-published with Asian Development Bank—marking international recognition and adoption. (</span><a style=\"color:#0063ae;text-decoration:underline;\" href=\"https://www.adb.org/publications/series/adbi-case-studies\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">View</span></a><span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">)</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Cases published cover 20 states and represent diverse themes and administrative contexts.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">AGK will soon feature case studies aligned with all 17 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs).</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-12\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#28a745;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Dissemination of AGK cases to 15 policy schools across India has been initiated to encourage review, adoption, and integration into academic and training curricula.</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);padding:30px;\"><h3 style=\"align-items:center;color:#002b5b;display:flex;font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-person-badge-fill me-2\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:1.2rem;\"></i>3. Faculty Development and Institutionalisation</strong></h3><div class=\"row g-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">75+ faculty from training institutions across India have already been trained in case writing.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">The September 2025 workshop is building capacity for 75 more faculty members, leading to 150+ case writers in the government training ecosystem.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">The Faculty Development Programme (FDP) in collaboration with Indian School of Business (ISB) is being conducted separately, through which CBC aims to train 300 faculty in case-based teaching.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">These trained faculty will eventually lead similar workshops, strengthening the internal capability of training institutions.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Future Goals Section --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-vision-section\" style=\"padding:50px 0;\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:35px;text-align:left;\"><i class=\"bi bi-graph-up-arrow me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;\"></i>Future Goals (by 2026)</h2><div class=\"mt-4\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);margin-bottom:25px;padding:30px;\"><h3 style=\"align-items:center;color:#002b5b;display:flex;font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-1-circle-fill me-2\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:1.2rem;\"></i>Capacity Building and Case Writer Pool</strong></h3><div class=\"row g-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Build a pool of 125–150 trained case writers from CTIs/ATIs who can develop high-quality, ministry and department specific cases.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Enable these writers to serve as multipliers by training others in case writing, thereby expanding the pipeline of contributors.</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);margin-bottom:25px;padding:30px;\"><h3 style=\"align-items:center;color:#002b5b;display:flex;font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-2-circle-fill me-2\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:1.2rem;\"></i>Mainstreaming Case-Based Learning in Government Training</strong></h3><div class=\"row g-3\"><div class=\"col-md-4\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Create a national network of trained faculty in case writing and case teaching.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Integrate AGK cases into regular training programmes across CTIs and ATIs.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Introduce dedicated case teaching modules under Faculty Development Programmes (FDPs).</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);margin-bottom:25px;padding:30px;\"><h3 style=\"align-items:center;color:#002b5b;display:flex;font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-3-circle-fill me-2\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:1.2rem;\"></i>Enhancing Accessibility and Inclusivity</strong></h3><div class=\"row g-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Translate and publish cases in multiple Indian languages including Hindi, Marathi, Kannada, Gujarati, Odia, and Assamese.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Prepare audio-visual cases for diverse learner preferences.</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);margin-bottom:25px;padding:30px;\"><h3 style=\"align-items:center;color:#002b5b;display:flex;font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-4-circle-fill me-2\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:1.2rem;\"></i>National and Global Integration</strong></h3><div class=\"row g-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Open the AGK section on iGOT to national and global institutions, enabling academic and policy organisations worldwide to adopt India-centric case studies for teaching and training.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Position AGK as a hub for global South–South knowledge exchange on governance.</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);padding:30px;\"><h3 style=\"align-items:center;color:#002b5b;display:flex;font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-5-circle-fill me-2\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:1.2rem;\"></i>Institutional Anchoring and Sustainability</strong></h3><div class=\"row g-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Identify one CTI to serve as the custodian and lead institution for AGK, with responsibility for overall management, curation, and long-term sustainability of the repository.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Develop a comprehensive operations manual for the custodian institution, detailing processes for case collection, review, publication, translation, and dissemination, along with mechanisms for capacity building and outreach.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Establish a robust governance framework to ensure peer review, quality assurance, and periodic updating of cases, supported by an advisory group comprising experts from government, academia, and policy institutions.</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div style=\"align-items:flex-start;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:flex;padding:12px;\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:2px;\"></i> <span class=\"karmayogi-text-large\" style=\"line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Introduce performance benchmarks and monitoring systems for the custodian to track usage, adoption, and impact of AGK cases across training ecosystems.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html');
INSERT INTO `node_revision__body` (`bundle`, `deleted`, `entity_id`, `revision_id`, `langcode`, `delta`, `body_value`, `body_summary`, `body_format`) VALUES
('page', 0, 76, 1343, 'en', 0, '<!-- Section 1: What is Amrit Gyaan Kosh? (Orange Gradient) --><!-- ========================================\r\n     AMRIT GYAAN KOSH (AGK) SECTIONS\r\n     Ready to paste into Drupal views\r\n     With alternating orange/white backgrounds\r\n     ======================================== --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-vision-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-book-fill me-3\"></i> What is Amrit Gyaan Kosh?</h2><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Amrit Gyaan Kosh is a dynamic repository of knowledge resources that captures and curates best practices in governance in form of case studies. This initiative is designed to reinforce the principles of Atmanirbharta, support the objectives of Mission Karmayogi, and contribute to the Hon\'ble Prime Minister\'s vision of a citizen-centric, transparent, and accountable governance framework. Focusing on India-centric ideas, exemplary best practices, and scalable governance models, these resources serve as a guide for Group A, B, and C officials across Central and State Governments, Municipalities, and Panchayats.</p><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Each case study is designed with precise learning objectives to enhance problem-solving capabilities and encourage evidence-based decision-making. Beyond government training institutes, this repository extends its reach to global academic institutions, enabling the exchange of India\'s governance experiences with the world.</p></div></section><!-- Section 2: Strategic Objectives of Amrit Gyaan Kosh (White) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-ideation-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-bullseye me-3\"></i> Strategic Objectives of Amrit Gyaan Kosh</h2><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-database-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Digital Knowledge Hub</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Establish a structured, digital knowledge hub for case studies and best practices.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Case-Based Learning</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Promote adoption of case-based learning within India\'s public administration training ecosystem.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-award-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Enhanced Training Programs</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Enhance civil services training programs with engaging, real-world learning materials.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Faculty Capability Building</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Strengthen case writing and teaching capabilities among faculty at CTIs and ATIs.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe-asia-australia\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Global Platform</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Facilitate the use of India-centric case studies on national and international platforms.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-share-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Peer Learning</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Encourage government officials to document and share innovations, fostering peer learning.</p></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Section 3: Core Principles of the Case Studies (Orange Gradient) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-intervention-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-gear-fill me-3\"></i> Core Principles of the Case Studies</h2><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large text-center mb-4\">Each case study is developed based on the following key principles:</p><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-primary\"><div class=\"text-center mb-3\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-check-fill\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:3rem;\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">Relevant</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The case should be current and contemporary, ideally not older than three years.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-success\"><div class=\"text-center mb-3\"><i class=\"bi bi-person-check-fill\" style=\"color:#28a745;font-size:3rem;\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">Relatable</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The learnings should connect to the learner\'s daily life and experiences.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-primary\"><div class=\"text-center mb-3\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:3rem;\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">Applicable</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The insights gained should be practical and actionable for the learner.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-success\"><div class=\"text-center mb-3\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-repeat\" style=\"color:#28a745;font-size:3rem;\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">Scalable</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The solution presented should be a replicable model.</p></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Section 4: Access to Amrit Gyaan Kosh Case Studies (White) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-learnings-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-link-45deg me-3\"></i> Access to Amrit Gyaan Kosh Case Studies</h2><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large text-center\">All published case studies under Amrit Gyaan Kosh are available on the iGOT platform in the Amrit Gyaan section. Registered and even non-registered users of IGOT can access these case studies directly from the iGOT homepage using the link below:</p><div class=\"text-center mt-4\"><a class=\"lsi-report-btn-orange\" style=\"border-radius:8px;display:inline-block;font-size:1.1rem;padding:15px 40px;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://www.igotkarmayogi.gov.in/#/show-all?type=case-studies\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-2\"></i> Access Case Studies on iGOT&nbsp;</strong></a></div></div></section><!-- Section 5: Capacity Building through Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshops (Orange Gradient) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-elements-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-event-fill me-3\"></i> Capacity Building through Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshops</h2><div class=\"karmayogi-feature-block mt-4\" style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 99, 174, 0.05);border-left:5px solid #0063ae;\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-feature-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3 me-2\"></i> April 2023</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Organised a 3-day <strong>Case Teaching Workshop</strong> in collaboration with <strong>Harvard Business School</strong> for 30 faculty members from Central Training Institutes (CTIs) and Administrative Training Institutes (ATIs).</p></div><div class=\"karmayogi-feature-block mt-4\" style=\"background-color:rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.05);border-left:5px solid #28a745;\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-feature-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3 me-2\"></i> December 2024</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Conducted a 5-day <strong>Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshop</strong> in partnership with <strong>Stanford LAD, Asian Development Bank (ADB), and Asian Development Bank Institute (ADBI)</strong> for 60 faculty members from CTIs/ATIs. Over 50 case studies were developed by participants and 7 faculty mentors from top institutions like IITs guided participants through the writing process.</p></div><div class=\"karmayogi-feature-block mt-4\" style=\"background-color:rgba(255, 153, 51, 0.05);border-left:5px solid #ff9933;\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-feature-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3 me-2\"></i> September 2025</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">In September 2025, the <strong>Second Edition of the Advanced Case Writing Workshop</strong> was conducted for 75 new faculty members from CTIs and ATIs, organised across three cohorts in different cities of India. The programme was led by instructors from <strong>Stanford LAD and IIT Delhi</strong> with support from ADB and ADBI, while 10 mentors from the December 2024 batch returned as Faculty Mentors to guide and support participants in their case writing journey.</p></div><div class=\"karmayogi-requirements-card mt-4\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-requirements-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill me-2\"></i> Building a Cadre of Master Trainers</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-requirements-text\">One of the central achievements of the programme has been the development of an emerging pool of Master Trainers in the Government training ecosystem drawn from workshop alumni. 10 participants were selected from December 2024 workshop to mentor participants from September 2025 workshop. These trainers:</p><ul class=\"karmayogi-feature-list mt-3\"><li><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill\"></i> <span>Mentor new participants across India</span></li><li><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill\"></i> <span>Co-facilitated the September 2025 cohorts</span></li><li><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill\"></i> <span>Support institutes in embedding case-based teaching into curricula</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"karmayogi-topics-card mt-4\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-topics-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-star-fill me-2\"></i> Participants\' Experience and Feedback</h3><div class=\"row g-3 mt-2\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-topic-item\" style=\"border-left-color:#28a745;\"><i class=\"bi bi-hand-thumbs-up-fill\" style=\"color:#28a745;\"></i> <span><strong>100%</strong> of respondents said they would recommend the workshop to colleagues</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-topic-item\" style=\"border-left-color:#ffc107;\"><i class=\"bi bi-star-fill\" style=\"color:#ffc107;\"></i> <span><strong>4.8/5</strong> overall rating - The programme received excellent ratings from participants</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Section 6: Statistics to be Highlighted (White) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-learnings-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-graph-up-arrow me-3\"></i> Key Statistics &amp; Achievements</h2><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\" style=\"background-color:#20c997;\"><i class=\"bi bi-file-earmark-check-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\" style=\"color:#28a745;font-size:2.5rem;\">70</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases currently live on IGOT</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\" style=\"background-color:#ffc107;\"><i class=\"bi bi-hourglass-split\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\" style=\"color:#ff9933;font-size:2.5rem;\">70</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases in the pipeline</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\" style=\"background-color:#00a8e8;\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\" style=\"color:#0063ae;font-size:2.5rem;\">150+</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Faculty from CTIs and ATIs trained in Case Writing</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\" style=\"background-color:#e83e8c;\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe2\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\" style=\"color:#dc3545;font-size:2.5rem;\">10</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases co-published with ADBI, Tokyo</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\" style=\"background-color:#20c997;\"><i class=\"bi bi-flag-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\" style=\"color:#17a2b8;font-size:2.5rem;\">17</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Features case studies aligned with all 17 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs)</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon\" style=\"background-color:#e83e8c;\"><i class=\"bi bi-map-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\" style=\"color:#6f42c1;font-size:2.5rem;\">20+</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases published cover more than 20 states and represent diverse themes</p></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-5\"><a class=\"lsi-report-btn-orange\" style=\"border-radius:8px;display:inline-block;font-size:1.1rem;padding:15px 40px;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://www.adb.org/adbi/publications/case-studies\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-2\"></i> View ADBI Published Cases&nbsp;</strong></a></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html'),
