div></div></div></section><!-- Section 3: Core Principles of the Case Studies (Orange Gradient) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-intervention-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-gear-fill me-3\"></i> Core Principles of the Case Studies</h2><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large text-center mb-4\">Each case study is developed based on the following key principles:</p><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-primary\"><div class=\"text-center\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-check-fill text-primary phase-card-icon-lg\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title text-center\">Relevant</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The case should be current and contemporary, ideally not older than three years.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-success\"><div class=\"text-center\"><i class=\"bi bi-person-check-fill text-success phase-card-icon-lg\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title text-center\">Relatable</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The learnings should connect to the learner\'s daily life and experiences.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-primary\"><div class=\"text-center\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill text-primary phase-card-icon-lg\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title text-center\">Applicable</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The insights gained should be practical and actionable for the learner.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-success\"><div class=\"text-center\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-repeat text-success phase-card-icon-lg\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title text-center\">Scalable</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The solution presented should be a replicable model.</p></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Section 4: Access to Amrit Gyaan Kosh Case Studies (White) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-learnings-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-link-45deg me-3\"></i> Access to Amrit Gyaan Kosh Case Studies</h2><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large text-center\">All published case studies under Amrit Gyaan Kosh are available on the iGOT platform in the Amrit Gyaan section. Registered and even non-registered users of IGOT can access these case studies directly from the iGOT homepage using the link below:</p><div class=\"text-center mt-4\"><a class=\"btn-karmayogi-orange\" href=\"https://www.igotkarmayogi.gov.in/#/show-all?type=case-studies\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-2\"></i> Access Case Studies on iGOT&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</a></div></div></section><!-- Section 5: Capacity Building through Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshops (Orange Gradient) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-elements-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-event-fill me-3\"></i> Capacity Building through Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshops</h2><div class=\"karmayogi-feature-block mt-4 bg-alice-blue border-left-blue\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-feature-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3 me-2\"></i> April 2023</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Organised a 3-day <strong>Case Teaching Workshop</strong> in collaboration with <strong>Harvard Business School</strong> for 30 faculty members from Central Training Institutes (CTIs) and Administrative Training Institutes (ATIs).</p></div><div class=\"karmayogi-feature-block mt-4 bg-light-green border-left-green\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-feature-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3 me-2\"></i> December 2024</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Conducted a 5-day <strong>Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshop</strong> in partnership with <strong>Stanford LAD, Asian Development Bank (ADB), and Asian Development Bank Institute (ADBI)</strong> for 60 faculty members from CTIs/ATIs. Over 50 case studies were developed by participants and 7 faculty mentors from top institutions like IITs guided participants through the writing process.</p></div><div class=\"karmayogi-feature-block mt-4 bg-light-orange border-left-orange\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-feature-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3 me-2\"></i> September 2025</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">In September 2025, the <strong>Second Edition of the Advanced Case Writing Workshop</strong> was conducted for 75 new faculty members from CTIs and ATIs, organised across three cohorts in different cities of India. The program was led by instructors from <strong>Stanford LAD and IIT Delhi</strong> with support from ADB and ADBI, while 10 mentors from the December 2024 batch returned as Faculty Mentors to guide and support participants in their case writing journey.</p></div><div class=\"karmayogi-requirements-card mt-4\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-requirements-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill me-2\"></i> Building a Cadre of Master Trainers</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-requirements-text\">One of the central achievements of the program has been the development of an emerging pool of Master Trainers in the Government training ecosystem drawn from workshop alumni. 10 participants were selected from December 2024 workshop to mentor participants from September 2025 workshop. These trainers:</p><ul class=\"karmayogi-feature-list mt-3\"><li><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill\"></i> <span>Mentor new participants across India</span></li><li><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill\"></i> <span>Co-facilitated the September 2025 cohorts</span></li><li><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill\"></i> <span>Support institutes in embedding case-based teaching into curricula</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"karmayogi-topics-card mt-4\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-topics-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-star-fill me-2\"></i> Participants\' Experience and Feedback</h3><div class=\"row g-3 mt-2\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-topic-item karmayogi-list-green\"><i class=\"bi bi-hand-thumbs-up-fill text-green\"></i> <span><strong>100%</strong> of respondents said they would recommend the workshop to colleagues</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-topic-item karmayogi-list-orange\"><i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-orange\"></i> <span><strong>4.8/5</strong> overall rating - The program received excellent ratings from participants</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Section 6: Statistics to be Highlighted (White) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-learnings-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-graph-up-arrow me-3\"></i> Key Statistics &amp; Achievements</h2><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-teal\"><i class=\"bi bi-file-earmark-check-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-green agk-stat-number\">70</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases currently live on IGOT</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-yellow\"><i class=\"bi bi-hourglass-split\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-orange agk-stat-number\">70</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases in the pipeline</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-cyan\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-primary agk-stat-number\">150+</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Faculty from CTIs and ATIs trained in Case Writing</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-pink\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe2\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-red agk-stat-number\">10</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases co-published with ADBI, Tokyo</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-teal\"><i class=\"bi bi-flag-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-info agk-stat-number\">17</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Features case studies aligned with all 17 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs)</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-pink\"><i class=\"bi bi-map-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-purple agk-stat-number\">20+</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases published cover more than 20 states and represent diverse themes</p></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-5\"><a class=\"btn-karmayogi-orange\" href=\"https://www.adb.org/adbi/publications/case-studies\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-2\"></i> View ADBI Published Cases&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</a></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 81, 128, 'en', 0, '<section class=\"join-mission-section\"><div class=\"container\"><!-- Introduction Section --><div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\"><div class=\"mission-karmayogi-header mb-2 py-4 px-3 rounded text-center\"><h2 class=\"mb-0 fw-bold\">We welcome passionate individuals and organizations to join us in this transformative journey...</h2></div></div></div><!-- Opportunity Cards Section --><div class=\"row justify-content-center g-4 mb-5 join-opportunity-cards-row\"><!-- For Organisations / SMEs Card --><div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\"><div class=\"join-opportunity-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"opportunity-card-header\"><div class=\"opportunity-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i></div><h3 class=\"opportunity-title\">For Organisations</h3></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-body\"><p class=\"opportunity-description\">Collaborate with us to strengthen capacity building eco-system and support our initiatives. We welcome partnerships with organizations and subject matter experts who can contribute to our mission.</p><div class=\"opportunity-features\"><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Knowledge Partnerships</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Technology Solutions</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Training Support</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Resource Sharing</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Expert Support</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Content Development</span></div></div></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-footer\"><a class=\"opportunity-btn\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"openOrganizationModal(); return false;\">Submit Here <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i>&nbsp;</a></div></div></div><!-- Career Opportunities Card --><div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\"><div class=\"join-opportunity-card career-opportunity-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"opportunity-card-header\"><div class=\"opportunity-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-briefcase\"></i></div><h3 class=\"opportunity-title\">For Individuals</h3></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-body\"><p class=\"opportunity-description\">Join our team and work on meaningful projects that impact governance and public service delivery. Be part of a dynamic organization committed to transforming civil service capacity building.</p><div class=\"opportunity-features\"><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Subject Matter Expert</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Advisor Role</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Consultant Role</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Internship Program</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Karmayogi Saarthis</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Research&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-footer\"><a class=\"opportunity-btn\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"openIndividualModal(); return false;\">Submit Here <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i>&nbsp;</a></div></div></div></div><!-- Call to Action Section --><div class=\"row justify-content-center\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"join-cta-section\"><h3 class=\"cta-title\">Ready to Make a Difference?</h3><p class=\"cta-text\">Join us in building a competent civil service rooted in Indian ethos. Together, we can transform public service delivery across India.</p><div class=\"cta-buttons\"><a class=\"cta-btn-primary\" href=\"#/contact\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i> Contact Us </a><a class=\"cta-btn-secondary\" href=\"#/about/about-cbc\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\"></i> Learn More&nbsp;</a></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Organization Form Modal --><div class=\"join-form-modal\" id=\"organizationModal\"><div class=\"modal-backdrop\" onclick=\"closeOrganizationModal()\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"modal-dialog\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><h2 class=\"modal-title\">Organization Collaboration Form</h2><p><button class=\"modal-close-btn\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeOrganizationModal()\" aria-label=\"Close\">\r\n          <i class=\"fas fa-times\"></i>\r\n        </button></p></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"organizationForm\"><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-name\">Name of Organization <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"org-name\" name=\"org-name\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-area-collaboration\">Area of Collaboration <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"org-area-collaboration\" name=\"org-area-collaboration\" placeholder=\"e.g., Knowledge Partnerships, Technology Solutions, Training Support\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-description\">Brief Description <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"org-description\" name=\"org-description\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Please provide a brief description of your organization and how you would like to collaborate\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-contact\">Contact Details <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"org-contact\" name=\"org-contact\" placeholder=\"Phone number, Email, or other contact information\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-address\">Address <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"org-address\" name=\"org-address\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Complete address of your organization\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-website\">Website Link</label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"url\" id=\"org-website\" name=\"org-website\" placeholder=\"https://www.example.com\"></div><div class=\"text-center\"><button class=\"btn-submit-enhanced\" type=\"submit\">\r\n              <span>Submit</span>\r\n              <i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane\"></i>\r\n            </button></div></form></div></div></div></div><!-- Individual Form Modal --><div class=\"join-form-modal\" id=\"individualModal\"><div class=\"modal-backdrop\" onclick=\"closeIndividualModal()\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"modal-dialog\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><h2 class=\"modal-title\">Individual Application Form</h2><p><button class=\"modal-close-btn\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeIndividualModal()\" aria-label=\"Close\">\r\n          <i class=\"fas fa-times\"></i>\r\n        </button></p></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"individualForm\"><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-name\">Name <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"ind-name\" name=\"ind-name\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-area-expertise\">Area of Expertise/Interest <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"ind-area-expertise\" name=\"ind-area-expertise\" placeholder=\"e.g., Public Policy, Digital Governance, Training &amp; Development\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-description\">Brief Description <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"ind-description\" name=\"ind-description\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Please provide a brief description about yourself and your interest in joining the mission\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-cv\">CV <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"file\" id=\"ind-cv\" name=\"ind-cv\" accept=\".pdf,.doc,.docx\" required=\"\"> <small class=\"form-text text-muted\">Please upload your CV (PDF, DOC, or DOCX format, max 5MB)</small></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-contact\">Contact Details <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"ind-contact\" name=\"ind-contact\" placeholder=\"Phone number, Email, or other contact information\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-address\">Address <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"ind-address\" name=\"ind-address\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Your complete address\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-linkedin\">LinkedIn URL</label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"url\" id=\"ind-linkedin\" name=\"ind-linkedin\" placeholder=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/yourprofile\"></div><div class=\"text-center\"><button class=\"btn-submit-enhanced\" type=\"submit\">\r\n              <span>Submit</span>\r\n              <i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane\"></i>\r\n            </button></div></form></div></div></div></div><script>\r\n// Ensure modals are hidden on page load\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function() {\r\n  // Initialize modals as hidden\r\n  const orgModal = document.getElementById(\'organizationModal\');\r\n  const indModal = document.getElementById(\'individualModal\');\r\n  \r\n  if (orgModal) {\r\n    orgModal.style.display = \'none\';\r\n  }\r\n  if (indModal) {\r\n    indModal.style.display = \'none\';\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  // Form submission handlers\r\n  const orgForm = document.getElementById(\'organizationForm\');\r\n  const indForm = document.getElementById(\'individualForm\');\r\n  \r\n  if (orgForm) {\r\n    orgForm.addEventListener(\'submit\', function(e) {\r\n      e.preventDefault();\r\n      // Add your form submission logic here\r\n      alert(\'Organization form submitted successfully!\');\r\n      closeOrganizationModal();\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  if (indForm) {\r\n    indForm.addEventListener(\'submit\', function(e) {\r\n      e.preventDefault();\r\n      // Add your form submission logic here\r\n      alert(\'Individual form submitted successfully!\');\r\n      closeIndividualModal();\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Modal functions\r\nfunction openOrganizationModal() {\r\n  const modal = document.getElementById(\'organizationModal\');\r\n  if (modal) {\r\n    modal.style.display = \'flex\';\r\n    document.body.classList.add(\'modal-open\');\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction closeOrganizationModal() {\r\n  const modal = document.getElementById(\'organizationModal\');\r\n  if (modal) {\r\n    modal.style.display = \'none\';\r\n    document.body.classList.remove(\'modal-open\');\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction openIndividualModal() {\r\n  const modal = document.getElementById(\'individualModal\');\r\n  if (modal) {\r\n    modal.style.display = \'flex\';\r\n    document.body.classList.add(\'modal-open\');\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction closeIndividualModal() {\r\n  const modal = document.getElementById(\'individualModal\');\r\n  if (modal) {\r\n    modal.style.display = \'none\';\r\n    document.body.classList.remove(\'modal-open\');\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Close modal on Escape key\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\'keydown\', function(event) {\r\n  if (event.key === \'Escape\') {\r\n    closeOrganizationModal();\r\n    closeIndividualModal();\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n</script>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 81, 148, 'en', 0, '<section class=\"join-mission-section\"><div class=\"container\"><!-- Introduction Section --><div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\"><div class=\"mission-karmayogi-header mb-2 py-4 px-3 rounded text-center\"><h2 class=\"mb-0 fw-bold\">We welcome passionate individuals and organizations to join us in this transformative journey...</h2></div></div></div><!-- Opportunity Cards Section --><div class=\"row justify-content-center g-4 mb-5 join-opportunity-cards-row\"><!-- For Organisations / SMEs Card --><div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\"><div class=\"join-opportunity-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"opportunity-card-header\"><div class=\"opportunity-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i></div><h3 class=\"opportunity-title\">For Organisations</h3></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-body\"><p class=\"opportunity-description\">Collaborate with us to strengthen capacity building eco-system and support our initiatives. We welcome partnerships with organizations and subject matter experts who can contribute to our mission.</p><div class=\"opportunity-features\"><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Knowledge Partnerships</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Technology Solutions</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Training Support</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Resource Sharing</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Expert Support</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Content Development</span></div></div></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-footer\"><a class=\"opportunity-btn\" href=\"/feedback\" onclick=\"openOrganizationModal(); return false;\">Submit Here <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i>&nbsp;</a></div></div></div><!-- Career Opportunities Card --><div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\"><div class=\"join-opportunity-card career-opportunity-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"opportunity-card-header\"><div class=\"opportunity-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-briefcase\"></i></div><h3 class=\"opportunity-title\">For Individuals</h3></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-body\"><p class=\"opportunity-description\">Join our team and work on meaningful projects that impact governance and public service delivery. Be part of a dynamic organization committed to transforming civil service capacity building.</p><div class=\"opportunity-features\"><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Subject Matter Expert</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Advisor Role</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Consultant Role</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Internship Program</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Karmayogi Saarthis</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Research&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-footer\"><a class=\"opportunity-btn\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"openIndividualModal(); return false;\">Submit Here <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i>&nbsp;</a></div></div></div></div><!-- Call to Action Section --><div class=\"row justify-content-center\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"join-cta-section\"><h3 class=\"cta-title\">Ready to Make a Difference?</h3><p class=\"cta-text\">Join us in building a competent civil service rooted in Indian ethos. Together, we can transform public service delivery across India.</p><div class=\"cta-buttons\"><a class=\"cta-btn-primary\" href=\"#/contact\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i> Contact Us </a><a class=\"cta-btn-secondary\" href=\"#/about/about-cbc\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\"></i> Learn More&nbsp;</a></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Organization Form Modal --><div class=\"join-form-modal\" id=\"organizationModal\"><div class=\"modal-backdrop\" onclick=\"closeOrganizationModal()\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"modal-dialog\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><h2 class=\"modal-title\">Organization Collaboration Form</h2><p><button class=\"modal-close-btn\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeOrganizationModal()\" aria-label=\"Close\">\r\n                              <i class=\"fas fa-times\"></i>\r\n                            </button></p></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"organizationForm\"><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-name\">Name of Organization <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"org-name\" name=\"org-name\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-area-collaboration\">Area of Collaboration <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"org-area-collaboration\" name=\"org-area-collaboration\" placeholder=\"e.g., Knowledge Partnerships, Technology Solutions, Training Support\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-description\">Brief Description <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"org-description\" name=\"org-description\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Please provide a brief description of your organization and how you would like to collaborate\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-contact\">Contact Details <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"org-contact\" name=\"org-contact\" placeholder=\"Phone number, Email, or other contact information\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-address\">Address <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"org-address\" name=\"org-address\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Complete address of your organization\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"org-website\">Website Link</label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"url\" id=\"org-website\" name=\"org-website\" placeholder=\"https://www.example.com\"></div><div class=\"text-center\"><button class=\"btn-submit-enhanced\" type=\"submit\">\r\n                                      <span>Submit</span>\r\n                                      <i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane\"></i>\r\n                                    </button></div></form></div></div></div></div><!-- Individual Form Modal --><div class=\"join-form-modal\" id=\"individualModal\"><div class=\"modal-backdrop\" onclick=\"closeIndividualModal()\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"modal-dialog\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><h2 class=\"modal-title\">Individual Application Form</h2><p><button class=\"modal-close-btn\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeIndividualModal()\" aria-label=\"Close\">\r\n                              <i class=\"fas fa-times\"></i>\r\n                            </button></p></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"individualForm\"><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-name\">Name <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"ind-name\" name=\"ind-name\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-area-expertise\">Area of Expertise/Interest <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"ind-area-expertise\" name=\"ind-area-expertise\" placeholder=\"e.g., Public Policy, Digital Governance, Training &amp; Development\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-description\">Brief Description <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"ind-description\" name=\"ind-description\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Please provide a brief description about yourself and your interest in joining the mission\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-cv\">CV <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"file\" id=\"ind-cv\" name=\"ind-cv\" accept=\".pdf,.doc,.docx\" required=\"\"> <small class=\"form-text text-muted\">Please upload your CV (PDF, DOC, or DOCX format, max 5MB)</small></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-contact\">Contact Details <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"text\" id=\"ind-contact\" name=\"ind-contact\" placeholder=\"Phone number, Email, or other contact information\" required=\"\"></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-address\">Address <span class=\"text-danger\">*</span></label> <textarea class=\"form-control-enhanced\" id=\"ind-address\" name=\"ind-address\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Your complete address\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"ind-linkedin\">LinkedIn URL</label> <input class=\"form-control-enhanced\" type=\"url\" id=\"ind-linkedin\" name=\"ind-linkedin\" placeholder=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/yourprofile\"></div><div class=\"text-center\"><button class=\"btn-submit-enhanced\" type=\"submit\">\r\n                                      <span>Submit</span>\r\n                                      <i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane\"></i>\r\n                                    </button></div></form></div></div></div></div><script>\r\n// Ensure modals are hidden on page load\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function() {\r\n  // Initialize modals as hidden\r\n  const orgModal = document.getElementById(\'organizationModal\');\r\n  const indModal = document.getElementById(\'individualModal\');\r\n  \r\n  if (orgModal) {\r\n    orgModal.style.display = \'none\';\r\n  }\r\n  if (indModal) {\r\n    indModal.style.display = \'none\';\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  // Form submission handlers\r\n  const orgForm = document.getElementById(\'organizationForm\');\r\n  const indForm = document.getElementById(\'individualForm\');\r\n  \r\n  if (orgForm) {\r\n    orgForm.addEventListener(\'submit\', function(e) {\r\n      e.preventDefault();\r\n      // Add your form submission logic here\r\n      alert(\'Organization form submitted successfully!\');\r\n      closeOrganizationModal();\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  if (indForm) {\r\n    indForm.addEventListener(\'submit\', function(e) {\r\n      e.preventDefault();\r\n      // Add your form submission logic here\r\n      alert(\'Individual form submitted successfully!\');\r\n      closeIndividualModal();\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n// Modal functions\r\nfunction openOrganizationModal() {\r\n  const modal = document.getElementById(\'organizationModal\');\r\n  if (modal) {\r\n    modal.style.display = \'flex\';\r\n    document.body.classList.add(\'modal-open\');\r\n  }\r\n}\r\nfunction closeOrganizationModal() {\r\n  const modal = document.getElementById(\'organizationModal\');\r\n  if (modal) {\r\n    modal.style.display = \'none\';\r\n    document.body.classList.remove(\'modal-open\');\r\n  }\r\n}\r\nfunction openIndividualModal() {\r\n  const modal = document.getElementById(\'individualModal\');\r\n  if (modal) {\r\n    modal.style.display = \'flex\';\r\n    document.body.classList.add(\'modal-open\');\r\n  }\r\n}\r\nfunction closeIndividualModal() {\r\n  const modal = document.getElementById(\'individualModal\');\r\n  if (modal) {\r\n    modal.style.display = \'none\';\r\n    document.body.classList.remove(\'modal-open\');\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n// Close modal on Escape key\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\'keydown\', function(event) {\r\n  if (event.key === \'Escape\') {\r\n    closeOrganizationModal();\r\n    closeIndividualModal();\r\n  }\r\n});\r\n</script>', '', 'full_html');
