"row\"><div class=\"col-12 text-center\"><p><span class=\"hero-category-tag page-hero-cta\">Capacity Building Services</span></p><h1 class=\"contact-hero-title page-hero-title\">Ministries, Departments and Organizations (MDOs)</h1><p class=\"contact-hero-subtitle page-hero-subtitle\">Comprehensive capacity building support for ministries, departments, and organizations to develop competencies and organizational capabilities.</p></div></div></div></div><!-- Breadcrumb Section --><div class=\"page-breadcrumb-section\"><div class=\"container\"><nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"breadcrumb mb-0\"><li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li><li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">Services</li><li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Ministries, Departments and Organizations (MDOs)</li></ol></nav></div></div><section class=\"container py-5\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><!-- Navigation Buttons Section --><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><div class=\"mdos-nav-buttons\"><div class=\"mdos-btn-icon\"><a class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-1\" href=\"pages/services/mdos-approach-paper.html\"><i class=\"bi bi-file-earmark-text\"></i></a></div><p><a class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-1\" href=\"pages/services/mdos-approach-paper.html\"><span class=\"mdos-btn-text\">APPROACH PAPER</span>&nbsp;</a></p><div class=\"mdos-btn-arrow\"><a class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-1\" href=\"pages/services/mdos-approach-paper.html\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a></div><div class=\"mdos-btn-icon\"><a class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-2\" href=\"pages/services/mdos-process-manual.html\"><i class=\"bi bi-journal-bookmark\"></i></a></div><p><a class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-2\" href=\"pages/services/mdos-process-manual.html\"><span class=\"mdos-btn-text\">PROCESS MANUAL</span>&nbsp;</a></p><div class=\"mdos-btn-arrow\"><a class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-2\" href=\"pages/services/mdos-process-manual.html\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a></div><div