('photo_gallery', 0, 163, 378, 'en', 0, '<p>14th-19th July 2025</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 164, 283, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission celebrated its 1st Anniversary on April 1st at the Indian Institute of Public Administration, with Praveen Pardeshi and R Balasubramaniam giving talks on lateral entrants.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 165, 284, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission commenced thedevelopment of 5 Annual Capacity Building Plans with Department for Promotion of Industry and Internal Trade (dpiit.gov.in), Ministry of Commerce and Industry, Government of India (commerce.gov.in), Department of Consumer Affairs (consumeraffairs.nic.in), Department of Food and Public Distribution (dfpd.gov.in) and Ministry of Textiles (texmin.nic.in).</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 165, 285, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission commenced thedevelopment of 5 Annual Capacity Building Plans with Department for Promotion of Industry and Internal Trade (dpiit.gov.in), Ministry of Commerce and Industry, Government of India (commerce.gov.in), Department of Consumer Affairs (consumeraffairs.nic.in), Department of Food and Public Distribution (dfpd.gov.in) and Ministry of Textiles (texmin.nic.in).</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 166, 287, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission\'s Chairman Shri Adil Zainulbhai and Secretary Shri Hemang Jani participated in the graduation ceremony of the foundation course for the second lateral entry batch of Civil Service Officers at Joint Secretary/Director/Deputy Secretary level. Cabinet Secretary Shri Rajiv Gauba graced the event as chief guest and shared a very warm welcome to the new batch of Civil Servants.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 167, 288, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission held a discussion session with Mr. Cyril Shroff and team of prominent lawyers from Cyril Amarchand Mangaldas on ideas, models, and collaborations on Capacity Building for Amrit Kaal.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 167, 289, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission held a discussion session with Mr. Cyril Shroff and team of prominent lawyers from Cyril Amarchand Mangaldas on ideas, models, and collaborations on Capacity Building for Amrit Kaal.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 168, 291, 'en', 0, '<p>We are delighted to announce that the Indian School of Public Policy (ISPP) (www.ispp.org.in) has entered into an MoU with the Capacity Building Commission. The Indian School of Public Policy (ISPP) will be supporting us as a knowledge and advisory partner, providing training resource, impact assessment and research support.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 169, 292, 'en', 0, '<p>We are pleased to announce that FLAME University (www.flame.edu.in) has entered into an MoU with the Capacity Building Commission. FLAME University will be supporting us as a knowledge partner on collaborations in public policy and capacity building initiatives.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 170, 293, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission visited ISRO Headquarters to discuss about the Capacity Building Initiatives within Department of Space. CBC highlighted the importance of training, promoting citizen centric programmes and preparing sectoral roadmaps for identifying new technologies. STI-CB cell of Office of the Principal Scientific Adviser to the Government of India and Capacity Building Commission will interact with ISRO officials for preparing ISRO’s Annual Capacity Building Plan (ACBP).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>ISRO - Indian Space Research Organization: https://www.isro.gov.in/update/28-apr-2022/capacity-building-commission-visit-to-isro-headquarters</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 171, 295, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission, with NACEN co-hosted a workshop on creating ‘Roadmap to Phygital learning’ for top Civil Service training institutions of the country.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 172, 297, 'en', 0, '<p>We were excited to host and have an insightful meeting with Harvard T.H. Chan School of Public Health\'s Design Laboratory (D-Lab) team! (<a href=\"http://www.hsph.harvard.edu/d-lab/\">www.hsph.harvard.edu/d-lab/</a>). Astute discussions were held on utilizing design knowledge methods and frameworks to understand competencies and build skills within the departments of our government.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 174, 300, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission gave a status update to Hon. Minister Bhupendra Yadav and held a meeting with the Ministry of Labour &amp; Employment, Government of India to discuss the Large-Scale Training Interventions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The tutelage resulting from the Training Needs Assessment exercise received unanimous positive feedback and the demand for conducting more such trainings was high.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 175, 301, 'en', 0, '<p>Villages in the CholaAdministration were known as Urs. Village administration was entrusted to the Gramsabha (village assembly) which was the lowest unit of Chola Administration. It took care of maintenance of roads, tanks, village ponds and village temples.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In Arthasastra, the Fort\'s construction talks about the administrative reforms made to protect the kingdom and its people\'s distribution of natural resources. The reforms helped in the management of water, soil, and forest resources.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Celebrating 75years of independence and tracing our roots back to 2500 BC as a civilizational state. Capacity Building Commission is collaborating with Nehru Yuva Kendra Sangathan (India), Ministry of Youth Affairs &amp; Sports, Government of India to document our rich, local administrative history and learn capacity building lessons.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To help citizens learn more about such facts from history, we are producing an interactive timeline where India’s rich administrative histories will be featured on our website (www.cbc.gov.in) in partnership with FLAME University. Today, we interacted with more than 900 Yuva volunteers to join this historic effort.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 176, 302, 'en', 0, '<p>The MSDE-ISB Capacity Building Programme concluded at the ISB Mohali campus last week.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mr. Praveen Pardeshi, Member Administration at Capacity Building Commission, GoI, addressed the cohort, as part of a series of capacity building initiatives across diverse organizations under MSDE. The cohort brought together MSDE officials, DGT officers, senior officials from various sector skill councils and representatives from NSDC.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The curriculum was designed to equip participants with leading-edge capabilities, and an agile mindset to embrace the dynamics of an increasingly complex world.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 176, 1370, 'en', 0, '<p>The MSDE-ISB Capacity Building Program concluded at the ISB Mohali campus last week.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mr. Praveen Pardeshi, Member Administration at Capacity Building Commission, GoI, addressed the cohort, as part of a series of capacity building initiatives across diverse organizations under MSDE. The cohort brought together MSDE officials, DGT officers, senior officials from various sector skill councils and representatives from NSDC.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The curriculum was designed to equip participants with leading-edge capabilities, and an agile mindset to embrace the dynamics of an increasingly complex world.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 177, 303, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission members met the Minister of Rural Development and Panchayati Raj Shri Shandilya Giriraj Singh, MoS Smt. Sadhvi Niranjan Jyoti &amp; Shri Faggan Singh Kulaste &amp; discussed the need for capacity building interventions for the ministry.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>National Institute of Rural Development and Panchayati Raj presented its update for the ministers and the Commission.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 178, 304, 'en', 0, '<p>R Balasubramaniam had a discussion with Ministry of Woman and Child Development, minister Smt. Smriti Irani on making National Institute of Public Cooperation and Child Development a world-class training and research institute in the domain of women and child development.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 179, 305, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission members met the Secretary of the Ministry of Ports, Shipping and Waterways Shri Sanjeev Ranjan to discuss the recommendations of implementing the Annual Capacity Building Plan. The Minister welcomed the report recommendations and stressed on effective and timebound implementation of the ACBP and pointed out that such Capacity Building would be critical for success of PM GATI SHAKTI.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 180, 306, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission team visited the National Academy of Direct Taxes, a designated Central Training Institute for training of India Revenue Services.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We conducted a workshop to deliberate on administration challenges faced by the CTIs. The subcommittee will work on developing policy recommendations for improving governance.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 181, 307, 'en', 0, '<p>Disom - The Leadership School Foundation visited the Capacity Building Commission.Dr. R Balasubramaniam spoke to them about Youth leadership and what they can do for the nation. I also shared about the work that CBC is undertaking and how it is working to build capacities in public administrators to deliver citizen-centric governance.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 182, 308, 'en', 0, '<p>The next wave of Green Revolution for India would ride on emerging technologies. The third-largest agricultural producer in the world, India is gearing up to build capacity in its agriculture labs to produce world-class research.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Capacity Building Commission held a meeting with the Ministry of Agriculture &amp; Farmers Welfare, Government of India for the commencement of the Annual Capacity Building Plan and the training and capacity building program \"Krishi Karmayogi\".</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 183, 309, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission had a discussion on the 7 Stages of leadership development at the Larsen &amp; Toubro Leadership Development Academy.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 184, 310, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission was invited by the State Government of Goa to conduct a workshop on Transformational Development Process through Institutional Reforms.The workshop was graced by Hon. Chief Minister Dr. Pramod Sawant, chaired by Hon. Chief Secretary and Secretaries of various departments, Directors, Collectors, and other civil servants.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 185, 311, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission interacted with the Chairman of University Grants Commission of India, Mamidala Jagadesh Kumar along with the Vice Chancellors of Public Universities (Central &amp; State) across India. Dr. R Balasubramaniam spoke about building knowledge partnerships for Capacity Building of Public Administration in India.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 186, 312, 'en', 0, '<p>As part of Mission Karmayogi, Capacity Building Commission hosted Senior Officials, including the Additional Secretaries, and Joint Secretaries from various Ministries to discuss the timelines and process for the Annual Capacity Building Plans (ACBPS) for their Ministries.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 187, 313, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission, held a kick-off meeting in collaboration with the IFC - International Finance Corporation (IFC) will be developing an integrated approach for enhancing capacity at the Urban Local Body (ULB) level.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Annual Capacity Building Plans (ACBPs) will be created in select ULBs to enhance capacity at an individual, institutional and an organizational level.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 188, 314, 'en', 0, '<p>CBC launched the online training module with the Ministry of Finance andthe Department of Public Expenditure &amp; Reform, by Hon. Minister of Finance Nirmala Sitharaman. The training module uses gaming techniques, audio visuals, quizzes to&nbsp;convert complex rules of procurement of goods, services and works and General and Supplementary rules into easy-to-understand nuggets of learning.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 189, 315, 'en', 0, '<p>Hon\'ble Minister Bhupender Yadav, Ministry of Environment, Forests &amp; Climate Change, GoI with Secretary, Ms. Leena Nandan, DG Forests and Sh. SP Yadav, Member Secretary, Tiger Conservation Authority to present on the approach to Capacity Building with the objective to address national priority of increasing forested area, conserving biodiversity, and mitigating man wildlife conflict through broad based training and non-training interventions. The Capacity Building exercise will leverage the existing network of Forest Training institutions like Indira Gandhi National Forest Academy, Wildlife Institute of India, and Bombay Natural History Society (BNHS) and experts like Bivash Pandav and Bilal Habib.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 190, 316, 'en', 0, '<p>Praveen Pardeshi (Member Admin) participated in field police training organized the Chandigarh Police. The DGP Chandigarh Praveer Ranjan, SP Chandigarh Ketan Bansal and SP Training Jaswinder and master trainers conducted training with great enthusiasm.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 190, 1257, 'en', 0, '<p>Praveen Pardeshi (Member Admin) participated in field police training organized the Chandigarh Police. The DGP Chandigarh Praveer Ranjan, SP Chandigarh Ketan Bansal and SP Training Jaswinder and master trainers conducted training with great enthusiasm.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 191, 317, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission, in collaboration with IFC - International Finance Corporation held a kickoff meeting with the Ahmedabad Municipal Corporation to develop an integrated approach for enhancing capacity at the Urban Local Body (ULB) level.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 191, 1048, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission, in collaboration with IFC - International Finance Corporation held a kickoff meeting with the Ahmedabad Municipal Corporation to develop an integrated approach for enhancing capacity at the Urban Local Body (ULB) level.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 192, 318, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission held an interaction with officer trainees of Indian Information Services at the Indian Institute of Mass Communication, Delhi.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>CBC\'s team met with future officers of Press Information Bureau - India, All India News, DDNews and other major publication divisions of the Government of India.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 193, 319, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission\'s Member (HR) R Balasubramaniam interacted with consultants working on the Annual Capacity Building Plans (ACBP) for the Social Sector Ministries and guided them on conducting the process to achieve national priorities for the various Ministries/Departments/Organizations.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 194, 320, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission, in collaboration with IFC - International Finance Corporation held a kickoff meeting with the Rajkot Municipal Corporation to develop an integrated approach for enhancing capacity at the Urban Local Body (ULB) level.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 195, 321, 'en', 0, '<p>We are delighted to open the “Documenting Indian History of Public Administration” portal; in association with Nehru Yuva Kendra Sangathan (India) and FLAME University.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inaugurated by Hon\'ble MP (RS) and President ICCR Dr. Vinay Sahasrabuddhe, in the presence of Shri Sanjay Kumar, Secretary Youth Affairs, Hemang Jani, Secretary CBC, Dr. R Balasubramaniam, Member (HR), CBC, Professor Yugank Goyal, Dr Jigar Champaklal Inamdar and more than 400 DYOs and State Directors of NYKS.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This portal will help documenting local administrative histories from Indian documented histories, oral traditions, and many un-documented sources.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It will feature in the Annual Report of Capacity Building Commission and in the Timeline of Indian Administration (which will be launched in due course).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>All citizens, civil servants (all groups), NYKS volunteers and staff are requested to join in this initiative and be part of narrating India’s centuries old administrative systems for the world.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 196, 322, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission along with Central Board of Direct Taxes in presence of Chairperson Sangeeta Singh and member Anuja Sarangi and various officials from Indian Revenue Service (IRS) planned to analyze data of income tax related public grievances related to incometax return and develop a robust training intervention which will enable the Assessment and appellate officers to proactively resolve the grievances. Guided by Hon PM Narendra Modi ji motto of citizen centric civil services.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 197, 323, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission visited the Ashoka Puram Training Center at the Mysuru Sub-Division of Railways.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>CBC\'s Member (HR) R Balasubramaniam spoke about how MissionKarmayogi enables citizen-facing Railway employees to implement Hon. PM\'s mandate of Citizen Centricity, making each and every railway employee a part of teamindia and a partner in the progress of our nation.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 198, 324, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission attended a conference of all Zonal Training Institutes of National Academy of Customs, Indirect Taxes and Narcotics (NACIN, nacin.gov.in) with their Additional Director Generals on E-learning content creation strategy for iGOT.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 198, 1049, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission attended a conference of all Zonal Training Institutes of National Academy of Customs, Indirect Taxes and Narcotics (NACIN, nacin.gov.in) with their Additional Director Generals on E-learning content creation strategy for iGOT.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 199, 325, 'en', 0, '<p>As part of capacity building work for the state of Madhya Pradesh – Sensitization Workshop on Citizen Centric Behavior for State Administrative Services and Revenue Department Officers was conducted at RCVP Noronha Academy of Administration &amp; Management, Bhopal (academy.mp.gov.in). The event was chaired by Smt. Deepti Gaur Mukherjee, IAS, Principal Secretary (Personnel) General Administration Department, Government of Madhya Pradesh.</p><p>During the workshop, Dr. R Balasubramaniam shared his thoughts on significance, relevance, and impact of citizen-centric behavior. The workshop further comprised group discussion by the participating officers of State Administrative Services and Revenue Department on ways through which a civil servant can become citizen friendly, empathetic towards peers, superiors as well as subordinates and ways of lateral integration with other departments for healthy field relations.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 200, 326, 'en', 0, '<p>Ladakh Police facilitated by Capacity Building Commission have completed behavior training of 200 or the 250 frontline police personnel: the results are increased professional handing of investigation, recording of evidence scientifically as narrated by this Inspector Jamgiang Namgyal.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 201, 327, 'en', 0, '<p>Ladakh Police in partnership with Capacity Building Commission with support of Illumine Knowledge Resources are bringing about attitudinal transformation in all the police personnel who man ten police stations and traffic post to make them professionally skilled and citizen centric building transformation police</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 202, 328, 'en', 0, '<p>R Balasubramaniam and Illumine Knowledge Resources played critical role in course design. Ladakh has no training institutions of its own he was keen to know how Ladakh could implement its capacity building plans for various departments; Capacity Building Commission could facilitate partnership with institutions like Indian Institute of Public Administration and nearby state ATI like Haryana Institute of Public Administration.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 203, 329, 'en', 0, '<p>Police inspector Fazil Abbas, station in-charge received Capacity Building Commission to facilitateKarmayogi training one month ago. PI Fazil Abbas narrated many cases which he solved with deep empathy and personally enjoys the policing with Karmayogi outlook.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 204, 330, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission co-organized a workshop on \"Enhancing Teaching Capacities of Central Training Institutes\" with Sushma Swaraj Institute of Foreign Services.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The workshop is a first step towards institutionalization of structured, need-based, and contextual Faculty Development Programs at Central Training Institutes (CTIs).</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 205, 331, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission, in collaboration with IFC - International Finance Corporation held a kickoff meeting with the Bhubaneswar Municipal Corporation to develop an integrated approach for enhancing capacity at the Urban Local Body (ULB) level.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 206, 332, 'en', 0, '<p>We were happy to host and have an insightful meeting with The World Bank\'s Governance Division, Hoon Soh.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Discussions were held on the importance of having a forum for conversations on public sector capacity enhancement, collaborations, and exchange of learnings with other countries, and building meaningful partnerships.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 207, 333, 'en', 0, '<p>Technologies are the New Humanities\" - says Capacity Building Commission\'s Secretary Hemang Jani delivering a lecture on the role of technology and the process of propelling India\'s Economy 2.0 by leveraging emerging technology adoption to the new batch of Foreign Service Officers.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 208, 334, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission\'s Secretary Hemang Jani spoke at the India Stack Knowledge Exchange (ISKE) \"Technology Stack for Skilling\" session about transforming the civil service training landscape by leveraging iGOT (Integrated Government Online Training) - the government\'s bespoke civil service training technology platform.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 209, 335, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission hosted Temasek Foundation and had enriching discussions about the importance of having regional dialogues and the significance of ownership at a local level for public sector transformations.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 210, 336, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission held a meeting with the Ministry of Jal Shakti, the National Water Academy (NWA Pune, nwapune.gov.in), North-Eastern Regional Institute of Water and Land Management (NERIWALM Tezpur, neriwalm.gov.in) and Rajiv Gandhi Ground Water Training &amp; Research Institute (RGI Raipur, ngwtri.org).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We are working with the Ministry of Jal Shakti, Department of Water Resources, RD &amp; GR, Govt. of India for creating synergies in capacity building of the three training institutes.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 211, 337, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission\'s Secretary Hemang Jani delivered the valedictory address for Executive Development Programme for Assistant Director Generals and Directors/Joint Directors operating at various institutes of ICAR-National Academy of Agricultural Research Management (NAARM). Their efforts are a step forward in fulfilling the nation’s vision of integrating the farmers in the supply chain of farm-to-plate.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 211, 1398, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission\'s Secretary Hemang Jani delivered the valedictory address for Executive Development Programme for Assistant Director Generals and Directors/Joint Directors operating at various institutes of ICAR-National Academy of Agricultural Research Management (NAARM). Their efforts are a step forward in fulfilling the nation’s vision of integrating the farmers in the supply chain of farm-to-plate.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 212, 338, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission\'s Member (HR) R Balasubramaniam held an Annual Capacity Building Plan (ACBP) Orientation Workshop for the Department of Higher Education (www.education.gov.in), in the presence of Secretary Sh. K Sanjay Murthy.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 213, 339, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission held exploratory conversations with Nanyang Technological University Singapore for capacity building of science and technology departments.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 214, 340, 'en', 0, '<p>Union Home Secretary Shri Ajay Bhalla launched Mission Karmayogi in Delhi Police Department by training over 37,000 policemen who provide security and safety to Delhi’s citizens. The behavioral and professional training is facilitated by Capacity Building Commission and is pedagogically curated by Member (HR) R Balasubramaniam. Over 350 police master trainers carefully selected by Special CP Sundari Nanda are being intensively trained as Delhi Police training school.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 215, 341, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission welcomed two Assistant Secretaries (IAS) of 2020 batch posted in Department of Personnel and Training (DoPT, dopt.gov.in).CBC team and the young officers had detailed discussions on various aspects of the capacity building ecosystem, and they spoke about their own experiences as Officer Trainees (OTs).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Assistant Secretary (AS) program was the brainchild of Hon’ble PM Narendra Modi; started in 2015, with an objective to expose young IAS offices to the working of the Union Government before they are posted in their respective cadres\' districts.CBC Chairman, Members, Secretary, and team wished them luck for their new role in contributing towards making New India a reality.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 216, 342, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission\'s Member (HR) R Balasubramaniam visited the Chandigarh Police\'s Recruit Training Centre for the \"Karmayogi Police - Custodians of Society\" Large Scale Intervention.</p><p>He spoke about Hon\'ble PM Narendra Modi\'s vision of citizen centricity, focusing on addressing the immediate concerns of citizens i.e., cooperation, efficiency, stability, and continuity in the governance systems.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 217, 343, 'en', 0, '<p>Message from CEO-KB and Secretary of Capacity Building Commission on National Learning Week.</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 217, 1190, 'en', 0, '<p>NLW 2024 Video-1</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 218, 344, 'en', 0, '<p>Dr. Balasubramaniam shares perspectives on National Learning Week and human resource development.</p>', '', 'full_html');
INSERT INTO `node_revision__field_event_description` (`bundle`, `deleted`, `entity_id`, `revision_id`, `langcode`, `delta`, `field_event_description_value`, `field_event_description_summary`, `field_event_description_format`) VALUES
('video_gallery', 0, 219, 345, 'en', 0, '<p>Dr. Alka Mittal shares insights on National Learning Week and capacity building initiatives.</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 219, 1186, 'en', 0, '<p>CEO-KB, Secretary - CBC on National Learning Week Video</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 219, 1387, 'en', 0, '<p>CEO-KB, Secretary - CBC on National Learning Week Video</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 219, 1390, 'en', 0, '<p>&nbsp;Former CEO-KB, Secretary - CBC on National Learning Week Video</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 219, 1393, 'en', 0, '<p>Former CEO-KB, Secretary - CBC on National Learning Week Video</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 220, 346, 'en', 0, '<p>Message from the Former Chairperson of Capacity Building Commission on National Learning Week.</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 220, 1184, 'en', 0, '<p>Dr. Alka Mittal (Member Admin- Capacity Building Commission) on National Learning Week</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 221, 347, 'en', 0, '<p>National Learning Week 2024 introductory video.</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('video_gallery', 0, 221, 1183, 'en', 0, '<p>Adil Zainulbhai (Former Chairperson- Capacity Building Commission) on National Learning Week</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('opinions_do_matter', 0, 222, 348, 'en', 0, '<p class=\"opinion-card-designation\">NLC India Limited, Ministry of Coal</p><p class=\"opinion-card-description\">A participant from NLC India Limited shares their commitment to ensuring positive impact on citizens through their actions.</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('opinions_do_matter', 0, 223, 349, 'en', 0, '<p>This training gave me valuable new insights and made me feel excited about my role as a lead trainer under the National Karmayogi initiative. The most important learning for me was understanding that the spirit of service already exists within everyone. It is not something that is absent, it only needs to be awakened. I also feel more connected to how my work and my customers contribute to serving the nation through what they create. This realization has been the biggest takeaway for me.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('opinions_do_matter', 0, 224, 350, 'en', 0, '<p>This program helped me with self reflection and changed the way I view my work. Earlier, I saw it as a process driven activity, but now I understand it as purpose driven work. Through our daily activities, we are contributing towards nation building.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('opinions_do_matter', 0, 225, 351, 'en', 0, '<p>The National Karmayogi training program completely changed my perspective. Earlier, I saw my work as just a responsibility, but now I see my role as an opportunity to contribute to nation building through my daily duties. This training made me feel proud to be a part of the country\'s development, and I am committed to sharing this spirit with my colleagues.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('opinions_do_matter', 0, 226, 352, 'en', 0, '<p>Earning the prestigious 5-star \"Sarvotkrisht\" rating under CBC\'s National Standards for Accreditation has been nothing short of transformational for NCA-F. CBC\'s rigorous and comprehensive parameters compelled us to critically examine every dimension of our work—recognizing gaps, strengthening processes, and institutionalizing sustainable interventions and SOPs that have significantly elevated our operational excellence.</p><p>The QIP facilitated by CBC was equally invaluable, sharpening our focus and driving measurable improvements across the board. Our greatest takeaway from this journey has been a powerful one: the process itself is as meaningful as the achievement. While we are immensely proud to have earned the highest rating, the experience has also ignited within us a renewed commitment to strive higher, improve continually, and keep raising the bar for ourselves.</p><p><!-- Quote Box -->&nbsp;\"The process itself is as meaningful as the achievement. While we are immensely proud to have earned the highest rating, the experience has also ignited within us a renewed commitment to strive higher, improve continually, and keep raising the bar for ourselves.\"</p><p>CBC\'s rigorous and comprehensive parameters compelled us to critically examine every dimension of our work—recognizing gaps, strengthening processes, and institutionalizing sustainable interventions and SOPs that have significantly elevated our operational excellence. The QIP facilitated by CBC was equally invaluable, sharpening our focus and driving measurable improvements across the board.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('opinions_do_matter', 0, 227, 353, 'en', 0, '<p>When I first encountered the idea of Mission Karmayogi, it did not strike me as a reform. It felt more like a reminder — that governance is, at its heart, an act of seva. It is not about the pursuit of recognition or reward, but about the quiet satisfaction, the santushti, that comes from doing one\'s work with sincerity.</p><p>At the heart of this Mission lies a transformative truth: that the strength of our administrative system rests not in its rules, but in its people. For me, capacity building is not treated as a box to be ticked, but as a culture to be nurtured. I wanted to build a workplace where learning is as natural as conversation, and as inclusive as a shared lunch table. It is an act of curiosity that connects every role, every reform, to a larger purpose: Jan Seva and Viksit Bharat @ 2047.<!-- Quote Box --></p><p>\"We often seek reward before effort and ask, \'Mujhe kya milega?\' Yet the truth remains unchanged — kaam karoge, tab apne aap mil jaayega. The act of doing one\'s duty with sincerity brings its own reward. Real recognition is not given; it is earned in the quiet pride of contribution and the lasting satisfaction of service.\"</p><p>In my tenure as the Secretary of the Department of Legal Affairs, I successfully concluded Phases I and II of the Rashtriya Karmayogi Jan Seva Program, through 20 batches, marking a major milestone in its capacity-building journey, and achieving 100% saturation. Every officer, contractual employee, and even our MTS colleagues came together — because no one is too junior to learn, and no one is too senior to listen.</p><p>We have learned that progress doesn\'t always need paperwork and structure alone cannot change culture. At DLA, each week I used to host Chai Pe Charcha, an informal huddle with Group Heads to take stock of ongoing initiatives. It\'s simple, human, and astonishingly effective. Concerns are voiced openly; ideas are exchanged freely. Hierarchy pauses, and insight steps forward.</p><p>Another space that has redefined our internal culture is our monthly Tiffin Baithak, inspired by our Hon\'ble Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi. What began as an informal lunch gathering with the Law Secretary became a forum for cross-learning and collective problem-solving. Around shared meals, officers discuss challenges, exchange thoughts, and often end up finding solutions that meetings never could.</p><p><!-- Quote Box -->\"In our Department, we wanted learning to feel aspirational, not obligatory. We began recognising officers across all levels for their milestones on the iGOT platform — not through ceremonies, but through personal acknowledgment and conversation. The best part? When an officer, after completing a course, says, \'Madam, ab mujhe samajh mein aaya ki hum kya kar rahe hain\' — that sense of connection between their task and the larger purpose of governance — that is where Mission Karmayogi truly begins.\"</p><p>During my tenure, I also made small but meaningful structural changes within the Department premises. The Conference Room has been renamed \"Karmayogi Sabhagar\"; administrative sections have been renamed under the four Sankalp values of the Hon\'ble PM: Ekta, Vikas, Garv and Kartavya. These are not mere signboards, but daily reminders of who we are and why we serve.</p><p>I believe capacity building is not a program that begins and ends with a calendar, it is a relay. Each of us runs our lap, carries the baton for a while, and how sincerely we run our lap determines the strength of what we pass on. The baton we hold is not just of responsibility, but of seva bhav.</p><p>As we look ahead, our goal remains simple: to make our offices not just functional, but living classrooms of innovation, empathy, and excellence — where knowledge circulates freely, curiosity is encouraged, feedback is welcomed and where santushti defines success as a public servant.</p><p><!-- Final Quote Box -->That, to me, is the true meaning of reform:<br>Not loud change, but lasting change.<br>Not compliance, but conviction.<br>Not recognition, but santushti.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('opinions_do_matter', 0, 228, 354, 'en', 0, '<p>Rafi Ahmed Kidwai National Postal Academy (RAKNPA) is humbled and delighted at the same time on being accredited as the first Central Training Institute (CTI) to receive a prestigious 5-Star rating from the Capacity Building Commission (CBC).</p><p>This was the culmination of a transformative journey which began in June 2023 when the Academy received a 2-Star rating. Recognizing the need for improvement from that start, we aligned our efforts with the vision of Mission Karmayogi, with constant and patient guidance from the CBC team to refine our systems and training methodologies.</p><p>The accreditation process was itself a transformative journey for us, illuminating the path across all eight pillars of the National Standards for Civil Service Training Institutions (NSCSTI). We focused on critical areas such as Training Needs Assessment, faculty development, and digitization, which enabled us to standardize procedures and streamline our training processes.</p><p>By delegating key administrative and financial powers, we enhanced our institutional efficiency, fostering a more effective training environment. Significant upgrades, including digitally-enabled classrooms, a comprehensive Learning Management System, the Karmayogi Digital Learning Lab, and the Virtual Immersive Learning Lab, have enriched our content creation and training delivery.</p><p>Additionally, the integration of Indian Knowledge Systems has allowed us to infuse cultural and ethical perspectives, rooted in India\'s rich civilizational heritage, into our training environment. The CBC accreditation is not a mere assessment - it has been a journey of continuous improvement. RAKNPA remains steadfast in its commitment to nurturing capable, ethical, and future-ready civil servants for our nation.</p><p><!-- Karmayogi Digital Learning Lab Section --><strong>&nbsp;Karmayogi Digital Learning Lab</strong></p><p>Established on March 06, 2024, an innovative platform dedicated to revolutionizing e-content development.</p><p>State of the Art addition towards accomplishing the National Program for Civil Services Capacity Building (Mission Karmayogi)</p><p>Capability to record live videos, thereby converting them into eLearning content Designed to empower the Academy to produce high-quality, engaging training material efficiently and effectively.</p><p>Developed more than 100 quality courses in English and Hindi like: Post Office Act, 2023, Know Your Ministry - Department of Posts, Profit Centricity in Postal Services</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 229, 355, 'en', 0, '<p>Capacity Building Commission\'s Member (HR) R Balasubramaniam and Secretary Hemang Jani spoke about capacity building, citizen centricity, overcoming challenges in the information and broadcasting sector and the future of communication technologies at the 3rd Annual Conference of Indian Information Services Officers.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('our_collaboration_matters', 0, 230, 356, 'en', 0, '<p>Valedictory of 100 Hrs to Mission Karmayogi for Lakshadweep Police</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('our_collaboration_matters', 0, 230, 1550, 'en', 0, '<p>Valedictory of 100 Hrs to Mission Karmayogi for Lakshadweep Police</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('our_collaboration_matters', 0, 230, 1550, 'hi', 0, '<p>लक्षद्वीप पुलिस के लिए 100 घंटों के मिशन कर्मयोगी अभियान का समापन विदाई समारोह</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('our_collaboration_matters', 0, 231, 357, 'en', 0, '<p>The 𝗠𝗶𝗻𝗶𝘀𝘁𝗿𝘆 𝗼𝗳 𝗔𝘆𝘂𝘀𝗵 organized its first 𝐓𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐧 𝐁𝐚𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐚𝐤 under Mission Karmayogi. This informal interactive session was held under the Secretary, Ministry of Ayush, bringing together officers from different divisions.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('event', 0, 232, 358, 'en', 0, '<p>Hon’ble Prime Minister Narendra Modi has initiated a unique program of making the newly inducted IAS officers as Assistant Secretary in the Government of India before they go to their respective States.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is a unique opportunity for a young officer to experience the working of central government where many of them will reach after at least a decade of working at the ground level.</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('our_collaboration_matters', 0, 233, 359, 'en', 0, '<p>A shared culture of learning &amp; #SevaBhav is taking root across depts-breaking silos, making service more humane, more responsive &amp; more reliable. Governance is strengthening itself from within as we move toward a #ViksitBharat2047</p>', '', 'basic_html'),
('our_collaboration_matters', 0, 233, 1230, 'en', 0, '<p>The Capacity Building Commission (CBC) is proud to share that the Rashtriya Karmayogi Jan Seva Program has trained over 10,00,000 Government officials across the country cumulatively, in Phase I and Phase II of the program.</p><p>This milestone marks a significant advancement in embedding the spirit of Seva Bhav and the ethos of a Karmayogi across India’s administrative landscape. By strengthening purpose, intent, and service orientation at scale, the program continues to contribute meaningfully to the larger vision of citizen-centric governance.</p><p>CBC acknowledges the efforts of all Ministries, Departments, Organisations, and every participating official for their active engagement and support. Your dedication has transformed this initiative into a powerful movement for behavioural transformation in Government.</p><p>Together, we move closer to building a more responsive, empathetic, and service-oriented governance ecosystem.</p>', '', 'full_html'),
('our_collaboration_matters', 0, 233, 1231, 'en', 0, '<p>The Capacity Building Commission (CBC) is proud to share that the Rashtriya Karmayogi Jan Seva Program has trained over 10,00,000 Government officials across the country cumulatively, in Phase I and Phase II of the program.</p><p>This milestone marks a significant advancement in embedding the spirit of Seva Bhav and the ethos of a Karmayogi across India’s administrative landscape. By strengthening purpose, intent, and service orientation at scale, the program continues to contribute meaningfully to the larger vision of citizen-centric governance.</p><p>CBC acknowledges the efforts of all Ministries, Departments, Organisations, and every participating official for their active engagement and support. Your dedication has transformed this initiative into a powerful movement for behavioural transformation in Government.</p><p>Together, we move closer to building a more responsive, empathetic, and service-oriented governance ecosystem.</p>', '', 'full_html'),
