('event', 0, 716, 933, 'en', 0, 1007, 'After the resounding success of its first edition, the Advanced Case Writing Workshop returns this September with a bold mission-to build a practice-driven knowledge ecosystem for the public sector.  The Second Edition will bring together 75 Government Officials across three cohorts (Delhi/Goa/Secunderabad) for an intensive 3-day workshop designed to enhance their Case Writing Skills.  Pillars of the Workshop:  Atmanirbharta in Learning – Building a self-reliant Indian case-writing ecosystem. Practice-Drive', '', 800, 1000),
