>Meghalaya</td><td><span class=\"badge bg-primary\">MoU Signed</span></td><td>Maibam Warish<br><small class=\"text-muted\">maibamwarish1995@gmail.com</small></td><td>Muddukrishna<br><small class=\"text-muted\">muddukrishnaas.kb@karmayogi.in</small></td></tr><tr><td>31</td><td>Mizoram</td><td><span class=\"badge bg-primary\">MoU Signed</span></td><td>Shrestha Bansal<br><small class=\"text-muted\">cbc.shreshtha@gmail.com</small></td><td>Anushka<br><small class=\"text-muted\">anushka.singh25@karmayogi.in</small></td></tr><tr><td>32</td><td>Puducherry</td><td><span class=\"badge bg-primary\">MoU Signed</span></td><td>Shrestha Bansal<br><small class=\"text-muted\">cbc.shreshtha@gmail.com</small></td><td>Muddukrishna<br><small class=\"text-muted\">muddukrishnaas.kb@karmayogi.in</small></td></tr><tr><td>33</td><td>Sikkim</td><td><span class=\"badge bg-secondary\">-</span></td><td>Shrestha Bansal<br><small class=\"text-muted\">cbc.shreshtha@gmail.com</small></td><td>Priyamvada<br><small class=\"text-muted\">priyamvadapallavi.kb@karmayogi.in</small></td></tr><tr><td>34</td><td>Odisha</td><td><span class=\"badge bg-primary\">MoU Signed</span></td><td>Pragyan P. Kar<br><small class=\"text-muted\">cbc.pragyanpkar@gmail.com</small></td><td>Anushka<br><small class=\"text-muted\">anushka.singh25@karmayogi.in</small></td></tr><tr><td>35</td><td>Uttar Pradesh</td><td><span class=\"badge bg-primary\">MoU Signed</span></td><td>Gaurav Pandey<br><small class=\"text-muted\">gauravpandey.0198@gmail.com</small></td><td>Pawan<br><small class=\"text-muted\">pawankpathak.kb@karmayogi.in</small></td></tr><tr><td>36</td><td>Uttarakhand</td><td><span class=\"badge bg-primary\">MoU Signed</span></td><td>Gaurav Pandey<br><small class=\"text-muted\">gauravpandey.0198@gmail.com</small></td><td>Priyamvada<br><small class=\"text-muted\">priyamvadapallavi.kb@karmayogi.in</small></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"text-end mt-3\"><p class=\"states-updated-text\">Last Updated on 23rd Jan 2026</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 75, 1704, 'en', 0, '<section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\"><div class=\"content-section\"><!-- Mission Karmyogi Header --><div class=\"mission-karmayogi-header mb-4 py-4 px-3 rounded text-center\"><h2 class=\"mb-0 fw-bold\">Mission Karmayogi</h2></div><div class=\"intro-content mb-3\"><p class=\"text-muted\"><strong>National Programme for Civil Services Capacity Building (NPCSCB) – Mission Karmayogi</strong> was launched in September 2020.</p></div><!-- Mission Karmayogi Section --><div class=\"mission-karmayogi-highlight mb-5 p-4 rounded\"><div class=\"row align-items-center\"><div class=\"col-md-12 mb-4\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>\"Mission Karmayogi\"</strong> – aims to create a competent civil service rooted in Indian ethos, with a shared understanding of India\'s priorities, working in harmonization for effective and efficient public service delivery.</p><p class=\"mb-0\">Envisioned as one of the largest capacity building initiatives in Government anywhere in the world, Mission Karmayogi aims to transform approximately 2.55<strong> crore government officials</strong> across the Centre, the States, and the local bodies.</p></div><div class=\"col-md-12 text-center mb-3 mb-md-0 mt-4\"><!-- Mission Karmayogi Institutional Framework Flowchart --><div class=\"institutional-framework-flowchart\"><div class=\"framework-header\"><h3 class=\"framework-title\">Mission Karmayogi – Institutional Framework</h3></div><div class=\"framework-content\"><div class=\"row g-3\"><!-- Capacity Building Commission Box --><div class=\"col-6\"><div class=\"framework-box high-contrast-border cbc-box\"><div class=\"framework-logo cbc-logo\"><img class=\"framework-logo-img\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/cbc_logo%20%281%29.png\" alt=\"CBC Logo\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></div><h3 class=\"framework-box-title\">Capacity Building Commission</h3></div></div><!-- Karmayogi Bharat Box --><div class=\"col-6\"><div class=\"framework-box high-contrast-border karmayogi-box position-relative h-100\"><div class=\"framework-logo karmayogi-logo\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none d-block h-100\" href=\"https://igotkarmayogi.gov.in/#/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Karmayogi Bharat Website\"><img class=\"framework-logo-img\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/igot_karmyogi_logo.png\" alt=\"iGOT Karmayogi Logo\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\"></a></div><h3 class=\"framework-box-title\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none d-block h-100\" href=\"https://igotkarmayogi.gov.in/#/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Karmayogi Bharat Website\">Karmayogi Bharat</a></h3><p class=\"framework-box-subtitle\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none d-block h-100\" href=\"https://igotkarmayogi.gov.in/#/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Karmayogi Bharat Website\">(SPV - 100% govt. owned online learning platform - iGOT Karmayogi)</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- About CBC Section --><div class=\"about-cbc-core mb-5\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 fw-bold\">About Capacity Building Commission</h2><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\"><div class=\"cbc-intro-card p-4 mb-4 rounded\"><div class=\"row align-items-center\"><div class=\"col-md-12\"><p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">Capacity Building Commission (CBC), is the custodian of the Mission Karmayogi framework, to drive civil service reforms through capacity building and competency-based learning. It works to strengthen the human resource foundations of the government by focusing on developing individual and institutional capacities, promoting citizen-centric governance, future readiness, and fostering a culture of lifelong learning across all levels of public administration. The Commission designs frameworks, sets standards, and encourages collaboration to make governance more transparent, accountable, citizen-centric, and future-ready.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- Vision & Mission Section --><div class=\"vision-mission-section\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><!-- Vision Card --><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"vision-mission-card high-contrast-border vision-card h-100 p-4 rounded d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center\"><div class=\"mb-3\"><div class=\"vision-icon-wrapper mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-eye text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-2\">Our Vision</h3></div><div class=\"vision-content flex-grow-1 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center\"><h3 class=\"fw-bold text-center mb-0\">Enable Lifelong Learning For Civil Servants</h3></div></div></div><!-- Mission Card --><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"vision-mission-card high-contrast-border mission-card h-100 p-4 rounded d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center\"><div class=\"mb-3\"><div class=\"mission-icon-wrapper mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-bullseye fa-3x text-warning\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-2\">Our Mission</h3></div><div class=\"mission-content flex-grow-1 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center\"><h3 class=\"fw-bold text-center mb-0\">Enable Creating optimal learning opportunities for each civil servant with the objective to build an agile and future ready public service learning for all</h3></div></div></div></div></div><!-- Mandate Section --><div class=\"mandate-section mb-5\"><div class=\"text-center mb-5\"><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Mandate of the Commission</h3><div class=\"title-underline mx-auto mb-4\">&nbsp;</div><p class=\"text-muted\">The key responsibilities that drive our mission</p></div><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded text-center\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-list fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Capacity Building Plans</h3><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Facilitate preparation of Capacity Building Plans of ministries, departments, organizations and states/UTs</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded text-center\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-university fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Training Institutions</h3><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Functional supervision over all training Institutions involved in capacity building of civil servants</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded text-center\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-alt fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Annual Report</h3><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Prepare and present CBC\'s Annual Report to the Prime Minister\'s HR Council</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded text-center\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Policy Recommendations</h3><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Make Policy recommendations to DoPT on personnel/ HR and Capacity Building</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded text-center\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-bar fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">HR Audit</h3><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Audit of Human Resources in Government and outcomes of the Capacity Building efforts</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><div class=\"mandate-card h-100 p-4 rounded text-center\"><div class=\"mandate-icon mb-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-users fa-2x text-primary\"></i></div><h3 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\">Knowledge Partners</h3><p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Approve Knowledge Partners and Content Validation mechanism for training of civil servants</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html');
INSERT INTO `node__body` (`bundle`, `deleted`, `entity_id`, `revision_id`, `langcode`, `delta`, `body_value`, `body_summary`, `body_format`) VALUES
('page', 0, 76, 1700, 'en', 0, '<!-- Section 1: What is Amrit Gyaan Kosh? (Orange Gradient) --><!-- ========================================\r\n     AMRIT GYAAN KOSH (AGK) SECTIONS\r\n     Refactored to use external CSS classes\r\n     ======================================== --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-vision-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-book-fill me-3\"></i> What is Amrit Gyaan Kosh?</h2><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Amrit Gyaan Kosh is a dynamic repository of knowledge resources that captures and curates best practices in governance in form of case studies. This initiative is designed to reinforce the principles of Atmanirbharta, support the objectives of Mission Karmayogi, and contribute to the Hon\'ble Prime Minister\'s vision of a citizen-centric, transparent, and accountable governance framework. Focusing on India-centric ideas, exemplary best practices, and scalable governance models, these resources serve as a guide for Group A, B, and C officials across Central and State Governments, Municipalities, and Panchayats.</p><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Each case study is designed with precise learning objectives to enhance problem-solving capabilities and encourage evidence-based decision-making. Beyond government training institutes, this repository extends its reach to global academic institutions, enabling the exchange of India\'s governance experiences with the world.</p></div></section><!-- Section 2: Strategic Objectives of Amrit Gyaan Kosh (White) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-ideation-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-bullseye me-3\"></i> Strategic Objectives of Amrit Gyaan Kosh</h2><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-blue\"><i class=\"bi bi-database-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Digital Knowledge Hub</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Establish a structured, digital knowledge hub for case studies and best practices.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-teal\"><i class=\"bi bi-mortarboard-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Case-Based Learning</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Promote adoption of case-based learning within India\'s public administration training ecosystem.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-yellow\"><i class=\"bi bi-award-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Enhanced Training Programs</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Enhance civil services training programs with engaging, real-world learning materials.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-blue\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Faculty Capability Building</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Strengthen case writing and teaching capabilities among faculty at CTIs and ATIs.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-cyan\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe-asia-australia\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Global Platform</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Facilitate the use of India-centric case studies on national and international platforms.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-blue\"><i class=\"bi bi-share-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title\">Peer Learning</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Encourage government officials to document and share innovations, fostering peer learning.</p></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Section 3: Core Principles of the Case Studies (Orange Gradient) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-intervention-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-gear-fill me-3\"></i> Core Principles of the Case Studies</h2><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large text-center mb-4\">Each case study is developed based on the following key principles:</p><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-primary\"><div class=\"text-center\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-check-fill text-primary phase-card-icon-lg\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title text-center\">Relevant</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The case should be current and contemporary, ideally not older than three years.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-success\"><div class=\"text-center\"><i class=\"bi bi-person-check-fill text-success phase-card-icon-lg\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title text-center\">Relatable</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The learnings should connect to the learner\'s daily life and experiences.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-primary\"><div class=\"text-center\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle-fill text-primary phase-card-icon-lg\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title text-center\">Applicable</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The insights gained should be practical and actionable for the learner.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-phase-card karmayogi-phase-card-success\"><div class=\"text-center\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-repeat text-success phase-card-icon-lg\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-phase-title text-center\">Scalable</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-phase-description\">The solution presented should be a replicable model.</p></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Section 4: Access to Amrit Gyaan Kosh Case Studies (White) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-learnings-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-link-45deg me-3\"></i> Access to Amrit Gyaan Kosh Case Studies</h2><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large text-center\">All published case studies under Amrit Gyaan Kosh are available on the iGOT platform in the Amrit Gyaan section. Registered and even non-registered users of IGOT can access these case studies directly from the iGOT homepage using the link below:</p><div class=\"text-center mt-4\"><a class=\"btn-karmayogi-orange\" href=\"https://www.igotkarmayogi.gov.in/#/show-all?type=case-studies\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-2\"></i> Access Case Studies on iGOT&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</a></div></div></section><!-- Section 5: Capacity Building through Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshops (Orange Gradient) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-elements-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-event-fill me-3\"></i> Capacity Building through Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshops</h2><div class=\"karmayogi-feature-block mt-4 bg-alice-blue border-left-blue\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-feature-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3 me-2\"></i> April 2023</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Organised a 3-day <strong>Case Teaching Workshop</strong> in collaboration with <strong>Harvard Business School</strong> for 30 faculty members from Central Training Institutes (CTIs) and Administrative Training Institutes (ATIs).</p></div><div class=\"karmayogi-feature-block mt-4 bg-light-green border-left-green\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-feature-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3 me-2\"></i> December 2024</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">Conducted a 5-day <strong>Advanced Case Writing and Teaching Workshop</strong> in partnership with <strong>Stanford LAD, Asian Development Bank (ADB), and Asian Development Bank Institute (ADBI)</strong> for 60 faculty members from CTIs/ATIs. Over 50 case studies were developed by participants and 7 faculty mentors from top institutions like IITs guided participants through the writing process.</p></div><div class=\"karmayogi-feature-block mt-4 bg-light-orange border-left-orange\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-feature-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar3 me-2\"></i> September 2025</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-text-large\">In September 2025, the <strong>Second Edition of the Advanced Case Writing Workshop</strong> was conducted for 75 new faculty members from CTIs and ATIs, organised across three cohorts in different cities of India. The program was led by instructors from <strong>Stanford LAD and IIT Delhi</strong> with support from ADB and ADBI, while 10 mentors from the December 2024 batch returned as Faculty Mentors to guide and support participants in their case writing journey.</p></div><div class=\"karmayogi-requirements-card mt-4\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-requirements-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-trophy-fill me-2\"></i> Building a Cadre of Master Trainers</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-requirements-text\">One of the central achievements of the program has been the development of an emerging pool of Master Trainers in the Government training ecosystem drawn from workshop alumni. 10 participants were selected from December 2024 workshop to mentor participants from September 2025 workshop. These trainers:</p><ul class=\"karmayogi-feature-list mt-3\"><li><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill\"></i> <span>Mentor new participants across India</span></li><li><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill\"></i> <span>Co-facilitated the September 2025 cohorts</span></li><li><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right-circle-fill\"></i> <span>Support institutes in embedding case-based teaching into curricula</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"karmayogi-topics-card mt-4\"><h3 class=\"karmayogi-topics-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-star-fill me-2\"></i> Participants\' Experience and Feedback</h3><div class=\"row g-3 mt-2\"><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-topic-item karmayogi-list-green\"><i class=\"bi bi-hand-thumbs-up-fill text-green\"></i> <span><strong>100%</strong> of respondents said they would recommend the workshop to colleagues</span></div></div><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"karmayogi-topic-item karmayogi-list-orange\"><i class=\"bi bi-star-fill text-orange\"></i> <span><strong>4.8/5</strong> overall rating - The program received excellent ratings from participants</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><!-- Section 6: Statistics to be Highlighted (White) --><section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-fdp-learnings-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-graph-up-arrow me-3\"></i> Key Statistics &amp; Achievements</h2><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-teal\"><i class=\"bi bi-file-earmark-check-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-green agk-stat-number\">70</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases currently live on IGOT</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-yellow\"><i class=\"bi bi-hourglass-split\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-orange agk-stat-number\">70</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases in the pipeline</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-cyan\"><i class=\"bi bi-people-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-primary agk-stat-number\">150+</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Faculty from CTIs and ATIs trained in Case Writing</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-pink\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe2\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-red agk-stat-number\">10</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases co-published with ADBI, Tokyo</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-teal\"><i class=\"bi bi-flag-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-info agk-stat-number\">17</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Features case studies aligned with all 17 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs)</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-card\"><div class=\"karmayogi-learning-icon icon-pink\"><i class=\"bi bi-map-fill\"></i></div><h3 class=\"karmayogi-learning-title text-purple agk-stat-number\">20+</h3><p class=\"karmayogi-learning-text\">Cases published cover more than 20 states and represent diverse themes</p></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-5\"><a class=\"btn-karmayogi-orange\" href=\"https://www.adb.org/adbi/publications/case-studies\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-2\"></i> View ADBI Published Cases&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</a></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 81, 1702, 'en', 0, '<section class=\"join-mission-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\"><div class=\"mission-karmayogi-header mb-2 py-4 px-3 rounded text-center\"><h2 class=\"mb-0 fw-bold\">We welcome passionate individuals and organizations to join us in this transformative journey...</h2></div></div></div><!-- Opportunity Cards Section --><div class=\"row justify-content-center g-4 mb-5 join-opportunity-cards-row\"><!-- For Organisations / SMEs Card --><div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\"><div class=\"join-opportunity-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"opportunity-card-header\"><div class=\"opportunity-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i></div><h3 class=\"opportunity-title\">For Organisations</h3></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-body\"><p class=\"opportunity-description\">Collaborate with us to strengthen capacity building eco-system and support our initiatives. We welcome partnerships with organizations and subject matter experts who can contribute to our mission.</p><div class=\"opportunity-features\"><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Knowledge Partnerships</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Technology Solutions</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Training Support</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Resource Sharing</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Expert Support</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Content Development</span></div></div></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-footer\"><a class=\"webform-dialog button\" href=\"/form/organisations-form\" data-dialog-options=\"{&quot;width&quot;:600,&quot;height&quot;:600}\">Submit Here</a></div></div></div><!-- Career Opportunities Card --><div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6\"><div class=\"join-opportunity-card career-opportunity-card high-contrast-border\"><div class=\"opportunity-card-header\"><div class=\"opportunity-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-briefcase\"></i></div><h3 class=\"opportunity-title\">For Individuals</h3></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-body\"><p class=\"opportunity-description\">Join our team and work on meaningful projects that impact governance and public service delivery. Be part of a dynamic organization committed to transforming civil service capacity building.</p><div class=\"opportunity-features\"><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Subject Matter Expert</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Advisor Role</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Consultant Role</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Internship Program</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Karmayogi Saarthis</span></div><div class=\"feature-item\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i> <span>Research&nbsp;</span></div></div></div><div class=\"opportunity-card-footer\"><a class=\"webform-dialog button\" href=\"/form/individual-application-form\" data-dialog-options=\"{&quot;width&quot;:600,&quot;height&quot;:600}\">Submit Here</a></div></div></div></div><!-- Call to Action Section --><div class=\"row justify-content-center\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><div class=\"join-cta-section\"><h3 class=\"cta-title\">Ready to Make a Difference?</h3><p class=\"cta-text\">Join us in building a competent civil service rooted in Indian ethos. Together, we can transform public service delivery across India.</p><div class=\"cta-buttons\"><a class=\"cta-btn-primary\" href=\"#/contact\"><i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i> Contact Us </a><a class=\"cta-btn-secondary\" href=\"#/about/about-cbc\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\"></i> Learn More&nbsp;</a></div></div></div></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 82, 1701, 'en', 0, '<section class=\"container py-5\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><div class=\"content-section\"><h2 class=\"section-main-heading mt-5 mb-4\">Knowledge Partnership Overview</h2><div class=\"knowledge-partnership-box mb-5\"><div class=\"knowledge-partnership-header\"><h3>Capacity Building Commission – Knowledge Partnership</h3><div class=\"knowledge-partnership-logo\"><img class=\"cbc-logo-img\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/cbc_logo.png\" alt=\"CBC Logo\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"><div class=\"logo-text\">CAPACITY BUILDING COMMISSION</div></div></div><div class=\"row g-4 mt-3\"><div class=\"col-md-4\"><div class=\"knowledge-partnership-item\"><div class=\"knowledge-icon-box knowledge-icon-what\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-alt\"></i></div><h4 class=\"knowledge-label\">WHAT</h4><p class=\"knowledge-description\">Knowledge Partnership enables institutions to become a part of the pool of expert knowledge providers for various areas of capacity building exercises.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4\"><div class=\"knowledge-partnership-item\"><div class=\"knowledge-icon-box knowledge-icon-why\"><i class=\"fas fa-bullseye\"></i></div><h4 class=\"knowledge-label\">WHY</h4><p class=\"knowledge-description\">To build, develop, &amp; enhance knowledge resource availability for the civil servants for achievement of common national goals.</p></div></div><div class=\"col-md-4\"><div class=\"knowledge-partnership-item\"><div class=\"knowledge-icon-box knowledge-icon-who\"><i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i></div><h4 class=\"knowledge-label\">WHO</h4><p class=\"knowledge-description\">Knowledge Partnerships hosts a group of eminent institutions who have demonstrated excellence in research, knowledge development and other allied areas.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 83, 1686, 'en', 0, '<!-- Contact Information Section --><div class=\"contact-info-wrapper py-5\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><div class=\"contact-intro-section text-center\"><div class=\"contact-intro-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-handshake\"></i></div><h2 class=\"contact-intro-title\">We\'re Here to Assist You</h2><p class=\"contact-intro-text\">Get in touch with the Capacity Building Commission. Our team is ready to assist you with any questions, inquiries, or support you may need regarding our initiatives, programs, and services.</p><div class=\"contact-intro-divider\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><div class=\"row g-4 mt-4 justify-content-center\"><!-- Card 1: Office Address --><div class=\"col-lg-5 col-md-6\"><div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"contact-info-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt\"></i></div><h3 class=\"contact-info-label\">Office Address</h3><p class=\"contact-info-value\">Capacity Building Commission,<br>19th, 20th &amp; 21st Floor,<br>Jawahar Vyapar Bhavan,<br>Tolstoy Road, New Delhi – 110001</p></div></div><!-- Card 2: Meet Our Team (Replacing General Queries and Email) --><div class=\"col-lg-5 col-md-6\"><div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"contact-info-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i></div><h3 class=\"contact-info-label\">Meet Our Team</h3><p class=\"contact-info-value\">Discover the dedicated professionals driving the mission of the Capacity Building Commission.</p><div class=\"contact-btn-wrapper mt-3\"><a class=\"contact-team-btn\" href=\"/team-cbc\">Meet Our Team <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right ms-2\"></i></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 84, 901, 'en', 0, '<section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-vision-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\"><i class=\"bi bi-file-earmark-text-fill me-3\" style=\"color:#0063ae;\"></i>Overview</h2><!-- Action Buttons --><div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px;\"><a class=\"btn\" style=\"align-items:center;background-color:#0099ff;border-radius:8px;border-style:none;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 30px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.3s ease;\" href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/Innovations_report_13March%20%283%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right\"></i> Open PDF in New Tab </strong></a><a class=\"btn\" style=\"align-items:center;background-color:#28a745;border-radius:8px;border-style:none;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 30px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.3s ease;\" href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/Innovations_report_13March%20%283%29.pdf\" download=\"\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-download\"></i> Download PDF&nbsp;</strong></a></div><!-- PDF Preview --><div class=\"document-viewer-wrapper\" style=\"background-color:#fff;border-radius:15px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);margin-top:20px;padding:20px;\"><p><iframe style=\"border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e9ecef;height:800px;width:100%;\" id=\"innovationsReportViewer\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/Innovations_report_13March%20%281%29.pdf\" frameborder=\"0\">\r\n                                                                      </iframe></p><div class=\"document-fallback\" style=\"background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:none;margin-top:20px;padding:40px;text-align:center;\"><p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"color:#6c757d;font-size:1.1rem;\">PDF preview is not available in your browser. Please use the buttons above to open or download the document.</p><p><a class=\"btn\" style=\"align-items:center;background-color:#0099ff;border-radius:8px;border-style:none;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 30px;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-12/Innovations_report_13March%20%281%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right\"></i> Open PDF&nbsp;</strong></a></p></div></div></div></div></section><script>\r\n// Handle PDF viewer fallback\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function() {\r\n  const viewer = document.getElementById(\'innovationsReportViewer\');\r\n  const fallback = document.querySelector(\'.document-fallback\');\r\n  \r\n  // Check if iframe loads successfully\r\n  viewer.onerror = function() {\r\n    viewer.style.display = \'none\';\r\n    if (fallback) {\r\n      fallback.style.display = \'block\';\r\n    }\r\n  };\r\n  \r\n  // Check if PDF viewer is supported\r\n  setTimeout(function() {\r\n    try {\r\n      if (viewer.contentDocument === null || viewer.contentWindow.length === 0) {\r\n        // PDF may not be viewable in iframe, show fallback\r\n        if (fallback && viewer.src) {\r\n          viewer.style.display = \'none\';\r\n          fallback.style.display = \'block\';\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    } catch (e) {\r\n      // Cross-origin or other error, show fallback\r\n      if (fallback) {\r\n        viewer.style.display = \'none\';\r\n        fallback.style.display = \'block\';\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }, 2000);\r\n});\r\n</script>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 92, 1705, 'en', 0, '<section class=\"container py-5\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><div class=\"mdos-nav-buttons\"><div class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-1\"><a class=\"mdos-link\" href=\"/approach-paper\"><span class=\"mdos-btn-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-file-earmark-text\"></i> </span><span class=\"mdos-btn-text\">CAPACITY BUILDING PLAN APPROACH PAPER</span> <span class=\"mdos-btn-arrow\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i>&nbsp;</span></a></div><div class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-2\"><a class=\"mdos-link\" href=\"/acbp-process-manual\"><span class=\"mdos-btn-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-journal-bookmark\"></i> </span><span class=\"mdos-btn-text\">PROCESS MANUAL</span> <span class=\"mdos-btn-arrow\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i>&nbsp;</span></a></div><div class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-3\"><a class=\"mdos-link\" href=\"/capacity-building-units\"><span class=\"mdos-btn-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-building\"></i> </span><span class=\"mdos-btn-text\">CBU CREATED</span> <span class=\"mdos-btn-arrow\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i>&nbsp;</span></a></div><div class=\"mdos-nav-btn mdos-btn-4\"><a class=\"mdos-link\" href=\"/completed-acbp\"><span class=\"mdos-btn-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle\"></i> </span><span class=\"mdos-btn-text\">COMPLETED CBP</span> <span class=\"mdos-btn-arrow\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i>&nbsp;</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><div class=\"cbp-description-box\"><p class=\"cbp-description-text\">The Capacity Building Plan (CBP) of a ministry/department is a comprehensive document detailing all the interventions required to develop and enhance the competencies of individual officials within that ministry/department as well as the capacity of the ministry/department as a whole.</p></div></div></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 93, 1486, 'en', 0, '<section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-vision-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title\">CBP Approach Paper</h2><!-- Action Buttons --><div class=\"mb-4\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px;\"><a class=\"btn\" style=\"align-items:center;background-color:#0099ff;border-radius:8px;border-style:none;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 30px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.3s ease;\" href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/CBP%20Approach%20Paper%20%28New%20Version%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right\"></i> Open PDF in New Tab </strong></a><a class=\"btn\" style=\"align-items:center;background-color:#28a745;border-radius:8px;border-style:none;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 30px;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.3s ease;\" href=\"/\" download=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/CBP%20Approach%20Paper%20%28New%20Version%29.pdf\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-download\"></i> Download PDF&nbsp;</strong></a></div><!-- PDF Preview --><div class=\"document-viewer-wrapper\" style=\"background-color:#fff;border-radius:15px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);margin-top:20px;padding:20px;\"><p><iframe style=\"border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e9ecef;height:800px;width:100%;\" id=\"approachPaperViewer\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/CBP%20Approach%20Paper%20%28New%20Version%29.pdf\" frameborder=\"0\">\r\n                                                  </iframe></p><div class=\"document-fallback\" style=\"background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;display:none;margin-top:20px;padding:40px;text-align:center;\"><p class=\"mb-3\" style=\"color:#6c757d;font-size:1.1rem;\">PDF preview is not available in your browser. Please use the buttons above to open or download the document.</p><p><a class=\"btn\" style=\"align-items:center;background-color:#0099ff;border-radius:8px;border-style:none;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 30px;text-decoration:none;\" href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/CBP%20Approach%20Paper%20%28New%20Version%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i class=\"bi bi-box-arrow-up-right\"></i> Open PDF&nbsp;</strong></a></p></div></div></div></div></section><p><script>\r\n// Handle PDF viewer fallback\r\ndocument.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function() {\r\n  const viewer = document.getElementById(\'approachPaperViewer\');\r\n  const fallback = document.querySelector(\'.document-fallback\');\r\n  \r\n  // Check if iframe loads successfully\r\n  viewer.onerror = function() {\r\n    viewer.style.display = \'none\';\r\n    if (fallback) {\r\n      fallback.style.display = \'block\';\r\n    }\r\n  };\r\n  \r\n  // Check if PDF viewer is supported\r\n  setTimeout(function() {\r\n    try {\r\n      if (viewer.contentDocument === null || viewer.contentWindow.length === 0) {\r\n        // PDF may not be viewable in iframe, show fallback\r\n        if (fallback && viewer.src) {\r\n          viewer.style.display = \'none\';\r\n          fallback.style.display = \'block\';\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    } catch (e) {\r\n      // Cross-origin or other error, show fallback\r\n      if (fallback) {\r\n        viewer.style.display = \'none\';\r\n        fallback.style.display = \'block\';\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }, 2000);\r\n});\r\n</script></p>', '', 'full_html'),
('page', 0, 100, 1178, 'en', 0, '<section class=\"karmayogi-section-fullwidth karmayogi-vision-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"karmayogi-content-wrapper\"><h2 class=\"karmayogi-section-title left-aligned\" style=\"margin-bottom:30px;\">How to access on iGOT</h2><div class=\"row g-4 mt-4\"><!-- English Video --><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"video-card\"><div class=\"video-card-header\"><h4>HOW-TO VIDEO</h4></div><div class=\"video-card-title\"><h3>How to access the Rashtriya Karmayogi Program via the iGOT app?</h3></div><div class=\"video-card-body\"><div class=\"video-placeholder\"><p>Video Player Placeholder</p><p>Duration: 1:38</p></div><p><a class=\"video-watch-btn\" href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/Rashtriya_Karmayogi_english.mp4\">Watch Video&nbsp;</a></p></div></div></div><!-- Hindi Video --><div class=\"col-md-6\"><div class=\"video-card\"><div class=\"video-card-header\"><h4>कैसे करें वीडियो</h4></div><div class=\"video-card-title\"><h3>आई-गॉट ऐप के माध्यम से राष्ट्रीय कर्मयोगी कार्यक्रम तक कैसे पहुंचें</h3></div><div class=\"video-card-body\"><div class=\"video-placeholder\"><p>Video Player Placeholder</p><p>Duration: 1:42</p></div><p><a class=\"video-watch-btn\" href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-01/Rashtriya_Karmayogi_hindi.mp4\">Watch Video&nbsp;</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>', '', 'full_html'),
