(195, 'en', 'node_search', ' documenting indian history of public administration portal launch documenting indian history of public administration portal launch adarsh mon 5 jan 2026 719 we are delighted to open the documenting indian history of public administration portal in association with nehru yuva kendra sangathan india and flame university inaugurated by hon ble mp rs and president iccr dr vinay sahasrabuddhe in the presence of shri sanjay kumar secretary youth affairs hemang jani secretary cbc dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc professor yugank goyal dr jigar champaklal inamdar and more than 400 dyos and state directors of nyks this portal will help documenting local administrative histories from indian documented histories oral traditions and many undocumented sources it will feature in the annual report of capacity building commission and in the timeline of indian administration which will be launched in due course all citizens civil servants all groups nyks volunteers and staff are requested to join in this initiative and be part of narrating india s centuries old administrative systems for the world fri 17 jun 2022 1200 documenting indian history of public administration portal launch  ', 0),
(196, 'en', 'node_search', ' central board of direct taxes meeting central board of direct taxes meeting adarsh mon 5 jan 2026 721 capacity building commission along with central board of direct taxes in presence of chairperson sangeeta singh and member anuja sarangi and various officials from indian revenue service irs planned to analyze data of income tax related public grievances related to incometax return and develop a robust training intervention which will enable the assessment and appellate officers to proactively resolve the grievances guided by hon pm narendra modi ji motto of citizen centric civil services sat 18 jun 2022 1200 central board of direct taxes meeting  ', 0),
