(199, 'en', 'node_search', ' madhya pradesh annual capacity building plan madhya pradesh annual capacity building plan adarsh mon 5 jan 2026 1009 as part of capacity building work for the state of madhya pradesh sensitization workshop on citizen centric behavior for state administrative services and revenue department officers was conducted at rcvp noronha academy of administration management bhopal academympgovin the event was chaired by smt deepti gaur mukherjee ias principal secretary personnel general administration department government of madhya pradesh during the workshop dr r balasubramaniam shared his thoughts on significance relevance and impact of citizencentric behavior the workshop further comprised group discussion by the participating officers of state administrative services and revenue department on ways through which a civil servant can become citizen friendly empathetic towards peers superiors as well as subordinates and ways of lateral integration with other departments for healthy field relations thu 23 jun 2022 1200 madhya pradesh annual capacity building plan  ', 0),
