(231, 'en', 'node_search', ' 𝐓𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐧 𝐁𝐚𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐚𝐤 𝐓𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐧 𝐁𝐚𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐚𝐤 admin tue 6 jan 2026 1218 the 𝗠𝗶𝗻𝗶𝘀𝘁𝗿𝘆 𝗼𝗳 𝗔𝘆𝘂𝘀𝗵 organized its first 𝐓𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐧 𝐁𝐚𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐚𝐤 under mission karmayogi this informal interactive session was held under the secretary ministry of ayush bringing together officers from different divisions  ', 0),
