(233, 'en', 'node_search', ' rashtriya karmayogi jan seva program 1000000 government officials trained rashtriya karmayogi jan seva program 1000000 government officials trained admin tue 6 jan 2026 1649 the capacity building commission cbc is proud to share that the rashtriya karmayogi jan seva program has trained over 1000000 government officials across the country cumulatively in phase i and phase ii of the program this milestone marks a significant advancement in embedding the spirit of seva bhav and the ethos of a karmayogi across india s administrative landscape by strengthening purpose intent and service orientation at scale the program continues to contribute meaningfully to the larger vision of citizencentric governance cbc acknowledges the efforts of all ministries departments organisations and every participating official for their active engagement and support your dedication has transformed this initiative into a powerful movement for behavioural transformation in government together we move closer to building a more responsive empathetic and serviceoriented governance ecosystem  ', 0),
