(244, 'en', 'node_search', ' one day training workshop for accreditation portal for ctis and atis at nicf one day training workshop for accreditation portal for ctis and atis at nicf adarsh wed 7 jan 2026 706 capacity building commission hosted nodal officers from 25 central training institutions ctis and 20 administrative training institutions atis at the national institute of communication finance nicf nicfgovin for a oneday workshop and training session of the national standards for civil service training institutions portal nscsti cbcgovin this workshop was inaugurated at the hands of shri devusinh chauhan minister of state for communications this portal will help the government of india to set common standards of excellence promote organizational improvement through continuous selfassessment enhance civil service capacity building with templates institutionalize a forum to highlight bestpractices and collaborative learning and give direction for longterm strategic planning wed 27 jul 2022 1200 one day training workshop for accreditation portal for ctis and atis at nicf ', 0),
(245, 'en', 'node_search', ' iit mumbai infrastructure capacity building meeting iit mumbai infrastructure capacity building meeting adarsh wed 7 jan 2026 708 iit bombay is delighted to complete capacitybuilding program entitled highways for 21st century india modern technologies for highways for morth india in partnership with indian academy of highway engineering and nhai india iit bombay feels humbled that the hon ble minister gadkari nitin took time from his busy schedule to interact with the participants and encouraged them to adopt innovative technologies to enhance quality improve sustainability reduce cost and increase speed of execution the program was conducted in partnership with capacity building commission under mission karmayogi among topics were bridges for 21st century accelerated bridge construction ultra highperformance concrete fiber reinforced bars perpetual pavement and structural health monitoring secretary giridhar aramane extolled the participants to implement the lessons from the program fri 29 jul 2022 1200 iit mumbai infrastructure capacity building meeting ', 0),
(246, 'en', 'node_search', ' celebrating 8 years of mygov celebrating 8 years of mygov adarsh wed 7 jan 2026 710 the secretary cbc participated in a panel discussion on future of mygov alongside shri parameswaran iyer ceo niti aayog shri amitabh kant g20 sherpa and shri abhishek singh ceo mygov mygov india has created a strong layer of trust between the citizen and government besides a strong technology layer for engagement said secretary cbc hemang jani mygov is one of the most successful citizen engagementplatforms globally the vision of hon ble pm to take every citizen service and information to the doorstep of people has been made possible by mygov since last eight year sat 30 jul 2022 1200 celebrating 8 years of mygov ', 0),
