(391, 'en', 'node_search', ' the capacity building commission cbc organises national consultative workshop on karmyogi quality framework the capacity building commission cbc organises national consultative workshop on karmyogi quality framework adarsh thu 8 jan 2026 1526 the capacity building commission cbc organises national consultative workshop on karmyogi quality framework aims to strengthen quality of digital learning for civil servants strong quality framework critical for building futureready civil servants for viksit bharat ms s radha chauhan https wwwpibgovin pressreleasepageaspx prid 2206695 reg 3 lang 1 fri 19 dec 2025 1200 workshops delhi new delhi the capacity building commission cbc organises national consultative workshop on karmyogi quality framework ', 0),
(392, 'en', 'node_search', ' decoding labour codes understanding the new era of labour reforms in india decoding labour codes understanding the new era of labour reforms in india adarsh thu 8 jan 2026 1533 dr alka mittal member capacity building commission addressed at the workshop on decoding labour codes understanding the new era of labour reforms in india at mangaluru on december 20 the workshop was organised by indian institute of skill development and research iisdr in collaboration with confederation of indian industry cii mangaluru mangalore management association mma and kanara industries association kia the workshop brought together policymakers industry leaders labour administrators hr professionals academicians and students to deliberate on india s evolving labour regulatory framework dr mittal spoke on the importance of ethical leadership and strong governance in building peoplecentric organisations she emphasised that effective governance frameworks guide employees through clear rules fairness and transparency enabling organisations to function smoothly and sustainably highlighting the role of labour laws she noted that they support organizational stability by preventing exploitation reducing disputes and ensuring legal clarity through standardized labour practices stressing zero tolerance for discrimination in recruitment wages promotions or training she underlined the importance of protecting workers rights and promoting collective bargaining she highlighted the role of digital tools in enabling online registration inspections and compliance she further stressed the importance of continuous reskilling and upskilling across technical and nontechnical fields to prepare the workforce for technological change advocating a holistic approach that balances worker welfare employer flexibility and digital transformation sat 20 dec 2025 1200 workshops karnataka indian institute of skill development and research iisdr mangaluru decoding labour codes understanding the new era of labour reforms in india ', 0),
(393, 'en', 'node_search', ' ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc called on shri vishnu deo sai chief minister chhattisgarh in raipur ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc called on shri vishnu deo sai chief minister chhattisgarh in raipur adarsh thu 8 jan 2026 1550 ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc called on shri vishnu deo sai chief minister chhattisgarh in raipur mon 22 dec 2025 1200 chhattisgarh raipur chhattisgarh ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc called on shri vishnu deo sai chief minister chhattisgarh in raipur  ', 0),
(394, 'en', 'node_search', ' capacity building commission organized a thoughtprovoking talk by dr onkar sharma former chief labour commissioner government of india capacity building commission organized a thoughtprovoking talk by dr onkar sharma former chief labour commissioner government of india adarsh thu 8 jan 2026 1603 as a part of the good governance week the capacity building commission organized a thoughtprovoking talk by dr onkar sharma former chief labour commissioner government of india on labour codes towards governance reforms reaffirming its commitment to strengthening good governance dr alka mittal member admin cbc highlighted the importance of the topic of the samuhik charcha shri sp roy secretary cbc welcomed the speaker dr sharma shared strategic perspectives on india s labour reforms and the transition towards a more facilitative and responsive governance model drawing from his rich experience he traced the origins of labour laws in the indian traditional roots he highlighted how the labour codes address contemporary labour challenges through simplification transparency and administrative coherence the discussion underscored the role of stakeholder consultations institutional preparedness and sustained capacitybuilding in effective implementation such knowledgesharing engagements remain central to cbc s mandate of building futureready institutions and enabling transformative governance reforms tue 23 dec 2025 1200 capacity building commission capacity building commission organized a thoughtprovoking talk by dr onkar sharma former chief labour commissioner government of india ', 0);
