(395, 'en', 'node_search', ' a oneday workshop on the development of capacity building plans cbps was conducted jointly by the capacity building commission cbc and the chhattisgarh academy of administration caa  a oneday workshop on the development of capacity building plans cbps was conducted jointly by the capacity building commission cbc and the chhattisgarh academy of administration caa adarsh thu 8 jan 2026 1613 a oneday workshop on the development of capacity building plans cbps was conducted jointly by the capacity building commission cbc and the chhattisgarh academy of administration caa at iiit naya raipur the workshop was inaugurated by ms s radha chauhan chairperson cbc along with shri vikas sheel chief secretary government of chhattisgarh in the presence of additional chief secretary and other senior officers from various state departments speaking on the occasion ms s radha chauhan chairperson cbc said that training institutes are critical to the success of mission karmayogi she emphasised that training institutes need to stand out to meet the bigger challenges adding that they need to reimagine revamp and redefine their roles in the ever evolving training ecosystem where artificial intelligence is playing an important role chairperson cbc also added that in order to achieve the target of viksit bharat 2047 the public servants needs to be future ready and for readying for the future we need to be present ready and thus the igot karmayogi plays an important part in making us ready for the future and thus in a way helps our country to achieve the growth and milestones the chief secretary of chhattisgarh shri vikas sheel highlighted how the state government s vision for viksit chhattisgarh 2047 is reshaping the whole governance with the use of information technology shri vikas sheel added that all the officers at the district level offices will start eoffice from january 2026 and also aadhar based biometric attendance he emphasized on midcareer level training and use of the aienabled capacity building plan cbp tool to cater to the needs of the officers as per their duties and responsibilities ms chandralekha mukherjee principal advisor cbc acknowledged the strong foundational work already undertaken by chhattisgarh and highlighted the immense potential of the state to emerge as a leading example in the development and implementation of capacity building plans while guiding participants on strengthening cbps through structured frameworks and strategic alignment the sessions also included inputs from shri abhishek dubey nodal officer mission karmayogi who outlined the implementation roadmap and priorities for mission karmayogi in chhattisgarh the workshop witnessed active participation from 60 officials across 8 departments culminating in the development of departmentwise capacity building plans aligned with state and institutional priorities this workshop marks an important step towards building a futureready civil services ecosystem and strengthening capacity building reforms in chhattisgarh tue 23 dec 2025 1200 chhattisgarh chhattisgarh academy of administration caa at iiit naya raipur a oneday workshop on the development of capacity building plans cbps was conducted jointly by the capacity building commission cbc and the chhattisgarh academy of administration caa  ', 0),
(396, 'en', 'node_search', ' dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission cbc delivered the keynote address at the good governance day celebrations held in jaipur dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission cbc delivered the keynote address at the good governance day celebrations held in jaipur adarsh thu 8 jan 2026 1616 dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission cbc delivered the keynote address at the good governance day celebrations held in jaipur thu 25 dec 2025 1200 jaipur rajasthan dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission cbc delivered the keynote address at the good governance day celebrations held in jaipur ', 0),
