(402, 'en', 'node_search', ' year end review 2025 capacity building commission year end review 2025 capacity building commission adarsh thu 8 jan 2026 1627 the capacity building commission cbc has continued to play central role in strengthening india s civil services architecture by driving the implementation of mission karmayogi during the year 2025 the commission focused on reaching out to the states with a more structured approach aiming at creating capacities through capacity building plans cbps for state departments by using aitool in addition the commission updated its accreditation framework for training institutes incorporating new dimensions the behavioural training in seva bhav through rashtriya karmayogi jan sewa program was one of the important highlights of the year in addition the focus aimed at creating new courses in domain areas targeting domain competencies during 2025 the commission took several key initiatives and achieved significant milestones read more  thu 1 jan 2026 1200 year end review 2025 capacity building commission ', 0),
