(523, 'en', 'node_search', ' mission karmyogi reimagining the civil servant mission karmyogi reimagining the civil servant adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1248 india is moving towards a less government more governance approach this requires a paradigmatic shift in the capacities mindset and actions of the civil servant dr r balasubramaniam writes in the indian express where he talks about the evolution in governance and the role of capacity building commission in building capacity and supporting the aspirations of a modern and futureready civil service thu 6 oct 2022 1200 mission karmyogi reimagining the civil servant ', 0),
(524, 'en', 'node_search', ' psa workshop on science technology and innovation for sustainable development goals psa workshop on science technology and innovation for sustainable development goals adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1304 science is the energy in development of india in 21st century it has the power to accelerate the development of every region and state of the nation pm narendra modi the research and information systems for developing countries ris and office of the principal scientific adviser to the government of india hosted the workshop on science technology and innovation for sustainable development goals speaking at the inauguration program of the workshop shri hemang jani secretary capacity building commission added that technologies are the new humanities and india is and will continue to play a key role in supporting development of science technology and innovations he added that india is emerging as one of the most innovative countries in the world and serves as test bed for innovations applicable for global south india is steadfast to develop its own capacity to ensure its sti outputs are taking local to global the program is part of the global pilot programme on sti for sdgs roadmap hosted by united nations and endorsed by g20 the global sti for sdgs program is aimed towards enhancing global cooperation for global technology facilitation mechanism tfm the program is being piloted in five countries viz ethiopia ghana kenya serbia and india tue 11 oct 2022 1200 psa workshop on science technology and innovation for sustainable development goals ', 0),
