(534, 'en', 'node_search', ' national ip conference 2022 national ip conference 2022 adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1309 we are committed to protecting ipr which is essential to fostering creativity hon ble pm narendra modi hemang jani secretary capacity building commission participated in the national ip conference 2022 chaired by hon ble cim shri piyush goyal the conference was jointly organized by capacity building commission and office of the controller general of patents designs and trademarks the conference bought together policy makers ip officers creators and practitioners on one platform to discuss futuristic ip challenges related to developmental issues speaking during the conference hon ble cim piyush goyal said innovation is that one defining characteristic that has always pushed mankind forward and the key factor that would determine the fate of the country he urged patent office to setup interactions of patent offices with applicants and stakeholders through video conferencing to take inputs from ip practitioners and public speaking at the conference secretary cbc stressed on the need to streamline the ipr granting mechanism through capacity building of key functionaries which would be a key to meet the needs of growing intellectual capital in the nation wed 19 oct 2022 1200 national ip conference 2022 ', 0),
