(555, 'en', 'node_search', ' meeting with confederation of indian industry meeting with confederation of indian industry adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1321 i believe india s new national education policy is one of the major factors in the mahayagna of nation building therefore the country has made this education policy modern and future ready pm narendra modi hemang jani secretary capacity building commission addressed the gathering inaugural session of the ongoing 12th education summit by confederation of indian industry cii on improving industryacademia engagements in india the session was chaired by dr rajkumar ranjan singh minister of state ministry of education ministry of external affairs india the summit brings together subject matters experts and policy to highlight the key points in the education sector and discuss the way forward addressing the gathering during the inaugural address secretary cbc spoke about the salient approach of national education policy nep to enable practical learning and innovation in education he highlighted on key areas where academiaindustry can collaborate to improve curricula pedagogy and support translation of research of research into innovations fri 4 nov 2022 1200 meeting with confederation of indian industry ', 0),
