(559, 'en', 'node_search', ' acbp workshop with external stakeholders acbp workshop with external stakeholders adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1413 capacity building commission held a workshop with all external partners working with ministries departments and organizations within the government of india on annual capacity building plans an annual capacity building plan acbp of an mdo identifies capacity needs through three lenses of national priorities emerging technologies and citizen centricity further it details all training and nontraining interventions required to develop the competencies of individuals and the organization as a whole all our partners joined us at vigyan bhavan deloitte grant thornton bharat llp kpmg india pwc india ey sattva consulting national institute for smart government asian development bank adb centre for effective governance of indian states cegis invest india primus partners india foundation for advancing science and technology india and centre for good governance cgggovin wed 16 nov 2022 1200 acbp workshop with external stakeholders ', 0),
