(637, 'en', 'node_search', ' oneday fintech workshop at vanijya bhawan oneday fintech workshop at vanijya bhawan adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1633 capacity building commission and department of finance dfs ministry of finance collaborated to host a oneday fintech workshop held on october 4 2023 at vanijya bhawan new delhi the workshop addressed digital technology s role in improving financial access and inclusion to address national priorities for involving ministries such as ministry of micro small and medium enterprises ministry of commerce and industry government of india ministry of external affairs india ministry of corporate affairs prime ministers office niti aayog department for promotion of industry and internal trade ministry of agriculture farmers welfare government of india and more chaired by dfs secretary it brought together administrative regulatory and industry stakeholders the morning sessions covered the fintech sector s sectoral scenario in india in a global evolutionary context industry experts and thought leaders led discussions on digital public infrastructure regulatory issues and india s fintech future afternoon sessions showcased impactful fintech stories demos and group activities wed 4 oct 2023 1200 vanijya bhawan new delhi oneday fintech workshop at vanijya bhawan ', 0),
(638, 'en', 'node_search', ' immersion program for officials from defence psus immersion program for officials from defence psus adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1649 as part of acbp for the department of defence production capacity building commission facilitated an a 2day immersion program for officials from defence psus such as hindustan aeronautics limited hal bharat earth movers limited india beml and bharat dynamics limited bdl at walchandnagar industries limited wil the immersion program was held on the topic quality control and quality assurance processes in aerospace and missile manufacturing during the program wil made an elaborate presentation on how it imparts quality assurance quality control and quality ethics in its processes this was followed by a shop floor round where the visiting team had a handson experience with facilities and infrastructure and also an understanding of mass and size intricacies of product and manufacturing process qualification and trials the feedback from the visiting officials was unanimously positive as they intend to use the learnings gained at wil in their own organizations sun 8 oct 2023 1200 walchandnagar industries limited immersion program for officials from defence psus ', 0),
(639, 'en', 'node_search', ' industry immersion program at siemens for officials of defence psus industry immersion program at siemens for officials of defence psus adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1711 capacity building commission cbc facilitated an industry immersion program at siemens on the topic industry 40 with a defence lens for officials of defence psus including shipyards such as mazagon docks limited mdl goa shipyard limited gsl and bharat electronics limited bel bharat dynamics limited bdl hindustan aeronautics limited hal advanced weapons and equipment india limited aweil siemens demonstrated cuttingedge digital transformation interventions it has implemented in its brownfield factory to turn it around from a bleeding plant to a benchmark in factory of the future dpsu officials experienced the global data monitoring remote analysis center gavatar which tracks energy and carbon data coming from all site locations through kpis participants also learned about leveraging digital twin technologies in processes shop floor management and industrial additive manufacturing technologies along with robot integration we thank siemens for organizing the visit and showcasing their stateoftheart manufacturing facilities fri 27 oct 2023 1200 siemens industry immersion program at siemens for officials of defence psus ', 0),
(640, 'en', 'node_search', ' one day workshop at sardar patel institute of public administration spipa gujarat one day workshop at sardar patel institute of public administration spipa gujarat adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1741 as part of state level capacity building initiatives cbc was invited by sardar patel institute of public administration spipa gujarat to participate in a one day workshop of departments and training institutes of gujarat cbc team provided an overview of the learnings insights from annual capacity building planning process the workshop also intended to guide the institutes through the process of national standards for civil services training institutes nscsti wwwnscstiorg over 50 participants from various departments training institutions like gujarat police academy public policy and finance institute of gujarat gujarat jal sewa training institute etc engaged in this knowledge sharing workshop the commission remains steadfast in its commitment to empowering the karmayogi s and enhancing state capacity thu 30 nov 2023 1200 sardar patel institute of public administration spipa gujarat one day workshop at sardar patel institute of public administration spipa gujarat ', 0),
(641, 'en', 'node_search', ' cbc ministry of skill development and entrepreneurship microsoft india have teamed up again and entered into an mou cbc ministry of skill development and entrepreneurship microsoft india have teamed up again and entered into an mou adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1746 capacity building commission cbc ministry of skill development and entrepreneurship india microsoft india have teamed up again and entered into an mou to develop and deploy digital learning resources for civil servants this strategic partnership is a step towards empowering our civil servants with the knowledge and skills needed for navigating the dynamic landscape of emerging technologies the microsoft modules onboarded on karmayogi bharat igot platform help enhance the knowledge on topics such as cyber security project management ai fluency skilling power bi as well as functional computer literacy skills like ms word excell powerpoint etc the first year of this collaboration resulted in over 31 lakh course enrollments and 214 lakh course completions by civil servants across india together we are poised to create a future where technological advancements are seamlessly integrated into the governance framework by our future ready civil servants tue 5 dec 2023 1200 capacity building commission cbc new delhi cbc ministry of skill development and entrepreneurship microsoft india have teamed up again and entered into an mou ', 0),
