(643, 'en', 'node_search', ' webinar on enhancing survey quality by dr brady west for mospi webinar on enhancing survey quality by dr brady west for mospi adarsh fri 9 jan 2026 1755 cbc in collaboration with the ministry of statistics and programme implementation mospi organized a workshop focused on enhancing survey quality by dr brady west the sessions were wellreceived and attended by officers of the indian statistical services including the chief statistician of india and by field officers from several regional offices of mospi we extend our gratitude to dr brady west from the university of michigan special thanks to prof sonalde desai and dr sharan sharma for moderating the discussions and for their invaluable support in conceptualizing the workshop thu 11 jan 2024 1200 webinar on enhancing survey quality by dr brady west for mospi ', 0),
