(646, 'en', 'node_search', ' l t defence iu organized a daylong immersion visit for defence psus l t defence iu organized a daylong immersion visit for defence psus adarsh mon 12 jan 2026 1023 cbc in collaboration with l t defence iu organized a daylong immersion visit for defence psus such as hindustan aeronautics limited bharat dynamics limited and bharat electronics limited at larsen toubro s hazira complex in surat on the topic supply chain and procurement process management the visiting dpsu team deliberated learned and exchanged best practices on vendor development material management and mitigating supply chain risks they also visited l t s stateoftheart heavy manufacturing shops and armored systems complex wed 28 feb 2024 1200 l t defence iu organized a daylong immersion visit for defence psus ', 0),
