(688, 'en', 'node_search', ' lbsnaa achieves 5star rating under nscsti 20 framework lbsnaa achieves 5star rating under nscsti 20 framework admin tue 13 jan 2026 958 the capacity building commission extends its heartfelt congratulations to the lal bahadur shastri national academy of administration lbsnaa for achieving 5star rating under the nscsti 20 framework of mission karmayogi this milestone reflects lbsnaa s commitment to strengthening public sector capacity and setting high standards in training innovation and governance excellence cbc remains steadfast in supporting and collaborating with institutions that are driving transformation across india s civil services fri 28 nov 2025 1200 lbsnaa achieves 5star rating under nscsti 20 framework  ', 0),
(689, 'en', 'node_search', ' cbc organises focused workshop on delivering quality at scale  cbc organises focused workshop on delivering quality at scale admin tue 13 jan 2026 1000 the capacity building commission cbc conducted a focused workshop on delivering quality at scale facilitated by dr r balasubramaniam to strengthen quality standards in digital learning products and programmes across the public sector the workshop saw the participation of ms s radha chauhan chairperson cbc dr alka mittal member administration cbc shri s p roy secretary cbc along with the mission karmayogi team the workshop encouraged participants to reflect deeply on what quality truly signifies in a learning environment and how it shapes the overall user experience through practical illustrations interactive exercises and group discussions the sessions helped participants examine how users perceive quality and how consistency can be intentionally designed across the learning lifecycle aligned with the vision of mission karmayogi cbc continues to foster an ecosystem where digital learning is not only accessible but also effective reliable futureready and designed to strengthen the competencies of india s civil servants thu 27 nov 2025 1200 cbc organises focused workshop on delivering quality at scale  ', 0),
(690, 'en', 'node_search', ' institute of secretariat training management reaccredited with 5 star rating postqip implementation by cbc institute of secretariat training management reaccredited with 5 star rating postqip implementation by cbc admin tue 13 jan 2026 1004 congratulations to the institute of secretariat training management istm on being reaccredited with a 5star rating following the successful postqip implementation facilitated by the capacity building commission cbc the capacity building commission is proud to support institutions in consistently raising the bar for excellence in civil service capacity building capacitybuilding missionkarmayogi istm governance publicservice goodgovernance viksitbharat2047 institutionalexcellence wed 26 nov 2025 1200 institute of secretariat training management reaccredited with 5 star rating postqip implementation by cbc  ', 0),
(691, 'en', 'node_search', ' capacity building commission cbc observes the 76th constitution day samvidhan diwas  capacity building commission cbc observes the 76th constitution day samvidhan diwas admin tue 13 jan 2026 1005 today the capacity building commission cbc observed the 76th constitution day samvidhan diwas reflecting on the values and vision that continue to guide india s governance framework to mark the occasion cbc organised a series of engaging and reflective activities for its officials and staff reading of the preamble reaffirming our collective commitment to the constitution s foundational principles samuhik charcha facilitating thoughtful dialogue on constitutional duties and their significance in public service digital live quiz an interactive realtime quiz designed to strengthen understanding of key constitutional concepts blog writing competition encouraging participants to articulate their perspectives on constitutional values good governance and public service ethics fostering deeper reflection through creative expression these engagements provided a meaningful opportunity to revisit the core values that underpin effective governance and to reflect on how they translate into our daytoday responsibilities as public servants as we work toward building a futureready civil service under mission karmayogi constitution day serves as a timely reminder to uphold a governance ecosystem grounded in integrity accountability and public service excellence wed 26 nov 2025 1200 capacity building commission cbc capacity building commission cbc observes the 76th constitution day samvidhan diwas  ', 0),
(692, 'en', 'node_search', ' faculty development program by capacity building commission faculty development program by capacity building commission admin tue 13 jan 2026 1007 cbc in its commitment to strengthen the capacity building ecosystem by enhancing the capacity of civil service training institutions of the centre the states launched its first advanced faculty development program at isbedu with 34 carefully selected participants mon 24 nov 2025 1200 indian school of business isb faculty development program by capacity building commission  ', 0),
(693, 'en', 'node_search', ' ms s radha chauhan chairperson cbc visits yashwantrao chavan academy of development administration yashada pune maharashtra ms s radha chauhan chairperson cbc visits yashwantrao chavan academy of development administration yashada pune maharashtra admin tue 13 jan 2026 1010 ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc visited the yashwantrao chavan academy of development administration yashada pune maharashtra to discuss the implementation of mission karmayogi initiatives undertaken by the academy during the visit she met shri n k sudhanshu director general yashada along with senior officials and faculty members the meeting focused on the ongoing efforts to establish state and departmental capacity building units cbus as well as the development of capacity building plans cbps she emphasised the importance of sustained interdepartmental collaboration and the creation of statespecific training content in partnership with various training institutions the chairperson reaffirmed cbc s commitment to supporting yashada in further strengthening the implementation of mission karmayogi across maharashtra mon 24 nov 2025 1200 capacity building initiatives maharashtra yashwantrao chavan academy of development administration yashada pune maharashtra ms s radha chauhan chairperson cbc visits yashwantrao chavan academy of development administration yashada pune maharashtra  ', 0),
(694, 'en', 'node_search', ' ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc interacted with the karmyogi sarthis outlining the key priorities and expectations for the forthcoming statelevel capacitybuilding engagements under mission karmyogi ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc interacted with the karmyogi sarthis outlining the key priorities and expectations for the forthcoming statelevel capacitybuilding engagements under mission karmyogi admin tue 13 jan 2026 1013 ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc interacted with the karmyogi sarthis outlining the key priorities and expectations for the forthcoming statelevel capacitybuilding engagements under mission karmyogi mission karmyogi is equipping state departments to systematically develop structured cbps aligned with assessed competency gaps desired service delivery outcomes and organisational priorities this initiative marks a significant step towards establishing a more efficient robust and futureready civil service across the nation thu 20 nov 2025 1200 capacity building commission cbc ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc interacted with the karmyogi sarthis outlining the key priorities and expectations for the forthcoming statelevel capacitybuilding engagements under mission karmyogi  ', 0),
(695, 'en', 'node_search', ' mission karmyogi in states mission karmyogi in states admin tue 13 jan 2026 1015 as a part of our collaborative effort towards development a 3day state capacity building workshop on creating state capacity building plan was conducted at the rcvp noronha administrative academy bhopal from 1921 november 2025 with participation from 30 departments and their suborganisations the workshop opened with an address by shri sachin sinha ias director general who outlined the objectives and expected institutional outcomes of the workshop followed by a detailed presentation by shri mujeebur rehman khan ias directorati setting the operational and strategic context for departmental engagement mission karmyogi team facilitated the departments towards adopting statewide standardisation of cbps ensuring datadriven capacity building and seamless integration with the igot karmyogi platform the workshop marks a significant milestone in enabling the shift from creating rulebased to rolebased capacity building plans wed 19 nov 2025 1200 workshops madhya pradesh rcvp noronha administrative academy bhopal mission karmyogi in states  ', 0),
