(698, 'en', 'node_search', ' ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission addressed the senior civil servants of republic of mauritius ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission addressed the senior civil servants of republic of mauritius admin tue 13 jan 2026 1021 ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission addressed the senior civil servants of the republic of mauritius during the 2nd capacity building program for senior civil servants from mauritius at the national centre for good governance ncgg new delhi she shared insights on mission karmayogi and the igot karmayogi platform highlighting its transformative role in fostering continuous learning and capacity building among civil servants thu 13 nov 2025 1200 capacity building initiatives delhi national centre for good governance ncgg new delhi ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission addressed the senior civil servants of republic of mauritius  ', 0),
(699, 'en', 'node_search', ' rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva programme training for cbc officials and employees rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva programme training for cbc officials and employees admin tue 13 jan 2026 1023 today the newly joined cbc officials and employees participated in the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva programme training marking a major milestone 7 lakh government officials trained with seva bhav from across india in phase ii chairperson ms s radha chauhan joined the team to mark this occasion she talked about the values that shaped this journey citizenfirst governance and the belief that real change shows up in how we serve the citizens every day dr r balasubramaniam member hr reminded participants that the karmyogi spirit must continue the seva bhav nurtured through this programme should stay alive in their daily work we believe that the milestones mark progress but it s the intent we carry forward that transforms systems thu 13 nov 2025 1200 capacity building initiatives delhi csoi kg marg new delhi rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program training for cbc officials and employees  ', 0),
(700, 'en', 'node_search', ' ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission addresses isb s advanced management program graduation ceremony ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission addresses isb s advanced management program graduation ceremony admin tue 13 jan 2026 1025 ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission graced the graduation ceremony of the advanced management programs amps class of 2025 at the indian school of business isb mohali in her address she highlighted that the world of management is evolving at an unprecedented pace urging the graduating cohort to anticipate change harness innovation and build organisations and institutions that are resilient ethical and futureready she encouraged them to situate their professional journeys within the larger national vision of viksit bharat 2047 a vision of a developed prosperous inclusive and globally influential india wed 12 nov 2025 1200 punjab indian school of business isb mohali punjab ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission addresses isb s advanced management program graduation ceremony  ', 0),
(701, 'en', 'node_search', ' the capacity building commission organised the mass singing of vande mataram joining the nationwide commemoration marking 150 years of india s national song the capacity building commission organised the mass singing of vande mataram joining the nationwide commemoration marking 150 years of india s national song admin tue 13 jan 2026 1059 the capacity building commission organised the mass singing of vande mataram joining the nationwide commemoration marking 150 years of india s national song fri 7 nov 2025 1200 the capacity building commission organised the mass singing of vande mataram joining the nationwide commemoration marking 150 years of india s national song  ', 0),
(702, 'en', 'node_search', ' samuchik charcha on vigilance awareness week at cbc samuchik charcha on vigilance awareness week at cbc admin tue 13 jan 2026 1103 as part of the vigilance awareness week 2025 being observed from 27th october to 2nd november the capacity building commission cbc organized a samuhikcharcha on the theme vigilance our shared responsibility the discussion centered on the significance of collective responsibility in promoting integrity transparency and ethical governance participants reflected on the role of vigilance as a continuous process that strengthens institutional credibility and fosters public trust the session reaffirmed cbc s commitment to upholding the highest standards of accountability and public service in all its endeavors fri 31 oct 2025 1200 capacity building initiatives capacity building commission cbc samuchik charcha on vigilance awareness week at cbc  ', 0),
(703, 'en', 'node_search', ' integrity pledge on rashtriya ekta diwas 2025 integrity pledge on rashtriya ekta diwas 2025 admin tue 13 jan 2026 1112 on the occasion of rashtriyaektadiwas 2025 officers and staff of the capacity building commission took the integrity pledge reaffirming their commitment to uphold unity integrity and security of the nation fri 31 oct 2025 1200 integrity pledge on rashtriya ekta diwas 2025  ', 0),
(704, 'en', 'node_search', ' capacity building commission cbc in collaboration with lbsnaa and karmyogi bharat organized a workshop capacity building commission cbc in collaboration with lbsnaa and karmyogi bharat organized a workshop admin tue 13 jan 2026 1116 capacity building commission cbc in collaboration with lal bahadur shastri national academy of administration lbsnaa and karmyogi bharat organized a workshop to strengthen the mission karmyogi team preparing them to effectively facilitate the capacity building initiatives being implemented across states and union territories the workshop was graced by shri sriram taranikanti director lbsnaa smt chandralekha mukherjee former director general haryana institute of public administration hipa shri s p roy secretary cbc ms shanmuga priya mishra deputy director lbsnaa and others their participation and insights underscored the importance of collaboration and innovation in advancing the objectives of mission karmyogi this initiative marks another step towards realizing the shared vision of a viksitbharat enabled by futureready and citizencentric civil service thu 16 oct 2025 1200 workshops haryana haryana institute of public administration hipa capacity building commission cbc in collaboration with lbsnaa and karmayogi bharat organized a workshop  ', 0),
(705, 'en', 'node_search', ' signing of a tripartite mou between the capacity building commission the school of ultimate leadership and the government of gujarat signing of a tripartite mou between the capacity building commission the school of ultimate leadership and the government of gujarat admin tue 13 jan 2026 1119 it is our privilege to announce the signing of a tripartite mou between the capacity building commission the school of ultimate leadership and the government of gujarat to roll out the 𝐃𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐭 𝐊𝐚𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐲𝐨𝐠𝐢 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐦 an initiative to strengthen citizencentric governance soul shall serve as the lead knowledge and leadership program implementation partner the mou was signed by 𝐒 𝐏 𝐑𝐨𝐲 secretary cbc 𝐒𝐚𝐮𝐫𝐚𝐛𝐡 𝐉𝐨𝐡𝐫𝐢 ceo soul and 𝐇𝐚𝐫𝐞𝐞𝐭 𝐒𝐡𝐮𝐤𝐥𝐚 ias principal secretary artd gog in the presence of 𝐃𝐫 𝐇𝐚𝐬𝐦𝐮𝐤𝐡 𝐀𝐝𝐡𝐢𝐚 principal advisor to the h ble chief minister of gujarat 𝐌𝐬 𝐒 𝐑𝐚𝐝𝐡𝐚 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐮𝐡𝐚𝐧 chairperson cbc and 𝐑 𝐁𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐮𝐛𝐫𝐚𝐦𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐚𝐦 member hr cbc soul shall design and implement behavioural transformation functional excellence and technological enablement programs for grade 1 and grade 2 officers starting with the narmada district as a pilot to create a scalable and replicable model for the state and the nation wed 1 oct 2025 1200 gujarat signing of a tripartite mou between the capacity building commission the school of ultimate leadership and the government of gujarat  ', 0),
(706, 'en', 'node_search', ' dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission and the team visited aiims delhi dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission and the team visited aiims delhi admin tue 13 jan 2026 1122 dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission and the team visited aiims delhi the capacity building commission cbc is conducting an extensive research study across public sector hospitals to comprehend citizencentric practices in healthcare delivery and propose templates for scaling those practices in other healthcare institutions therefore this visit aimed to gain firsthand insights into how processes governance and patient experience are interconnected the director shri srinivas presented details about the initiatives in aiims delhi that have improved patient experiences the heads of departments faculty members discussed their experiences and how they contribute to these initiatives dr balasubramaniam interacted with healthcare service providers front desk officers and some patients about these services this exercise is part of a larger effort to identify and document citizencentric best practices it also seeks to facilitate the exchange of ideas across public sector hospitals and develop models that can guide hospitals across india and globally the exceptional zeal and leadership capabilities of specific department staff such as the nicu department were insightful the crosspollination of such practices will significantly enhance the citizencentricity of healthcare services the insights gained from this visit will contribute to the development of healthcare systems that are accessible transparent and compassionate with citizens firmly at the centre tue 30 sep 2025 1200 capacity building initiatives delhi aiims delhi dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission and the team visited aiims delhi  ', 0),
(707, 'en', 'node_search', ' workshop on developing statelevel capacity building plans workshop on developing statelevel capacity building plans admin tue 13 jan 2026 1144 atis to function as catalysts in statelevel capacity building the 2day workshop on developing statelevel capacity building plans brought atis as key stakeholders of capacity building in states through handson group exercises ati teams designed draft cbps for key sectors to begin with six such key sectors were chosen education women child development agriculture rural development health and urban development these culminated in presentations that showcased their approach key learnings and next steps in the closing session smt s radha chauhan chairperson cbc called atis a pivotal pillar in creating cbps she underlined that atis must act as mentors and catalysts helping state governments own their cbps and embed a wholeofgovernment approach importantly she emphasized the shift from rulebased structures to rolebased learning focusing not just on designations but on the competencies required for roles that officials actually perform shri sriram taranikanti director lbsnaa reflected on the workshop presentations stressing the importance of carrying forward the exercises into concrete statelevel cbps and highlighting the broader role atis must play in shaping this reform journey smt chhavi bhardwaj ceo karmayogi bharat joint secretary dopt underlined key priorities from integrating training calendars to creating domain courses in regional languages to make the ecosystem more relevant and impactful member administration cbc dr alka mittal officers and team members from capacity building commission karmayogi bharat and lbsnaa were also present during the conclusion of the workshop the workshop brought together heads and senior faculty members from 17 state atis participants were introduced to the core principles of mission karmayogi the karmayogi competency model and tools and templates for designing capacity building plans cbps this workshop marked a significant step in deepening capacity building initiatives at the state level with atis positioned as knowledge hubs and mentors they will anchor cbps across departments ensuring that capacity building directly empowers every official to serve citizens better thu 25 sep 2025 1200 workshops delhi dr ambedkar international centre janpath new delhi workshop on developing statelevel capacity building plans  ', 0),
(708, 'en', 'node_search', ' catalysing capacity building in states workshop on developing statelevel capacity building plans catalysing capacity building in states workshop on developing statelevel capacity building plans admin tue 13 jan 2026 1148 the workshop on developing statelevel capacity building plans was inaugurated by hon ble mos pp dr jitendra singh at csoi vinay marg today who called for a futureready citizencentric civil service built on continuous learning smt s radha chauhan chairperson cbc reflected on the journey of mission karmayogimoving from rulebased to rolebased competenciesand stressed that atis must become the fulcrum for driving state capacity building plans smt rachna shah secretary dopt highlighted that atis must become the nerve centres of reform by guiding states to embed capacity building into their departmental workflows shri sriram taranikanti director lbsnaa highlighted the pivotal role of atis and assured sustained mentorship from lbsnaa to institutionalise mission karmayogi across states dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc stressed that citizencentricity and continuous learning must remain the guiding values of every cbp dr alka mittal member admin cbc spoke about strengthening institutional ecosystems to enable atis to lead this reform at the grassroots shri s p roy secretary cbc emphasised the commitment and teamwork required to make capacity building a lived practice in governance smt chhavi bhardwaj ceo karmayogi bharat joint secretary dopt along with coo karmayogi bharat shri rakesh verma oriented atis on designing effective capacity building plans cbps with the use of technology to anchor this transformation as the momentum amongst atis grows the day ahead will focus on group activities and handson exercises with the twoday workshop charting the way forward to build statelevel capacity building plans cbps  press release link wed 24 sep 2025 1200 capacity building initiatives delhi csoi vinay marg new delhi catalysing capacity building in states workshop on developing statelevel capacity building plans  ', 0),
(709, 'en', 'node_search', ' a tripartite memorandum of understanding mou was signed between the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of manipur a tripartite memorandum of understanding mou was signed between the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of manipur admin tue 13 jan 2026 1201 in a significant step for strengthening public service in manipur a tripartite memorandum of understanding mou was signed today 23 september 2025 between the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of manipur signed in the presence of dr puneet kumar goel chief secretary government of manipur and dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc the partnership will deepen the state s engagement with hashtag missionkarmyogi the mou marks the beginning of an institutional partnership to implement mission karmyogi s vision of a competencybased technologydriven and continuous learning ecosystem for government officials in manipurenabling civil servants to serve citizens better faster and with empathy tue 23 sep 2025 1200 capacity building initiatives manipur a tripartite memorandum of understanding mou was signed between the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of manipur  ', 0),
(710, 'en', 'node_search', ' swachhta hi seva shs 2025 swachhta hi seva shs 2025 admin tue 13 jan 2026 1209 to mark the launch of swachhta hi seva shs 2025 swachhta pledge was administered by ms s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission and shri sp roy joint secretary to all officers and staff of capacity building commission wed 17 sep 2025 1200 capacity building commission swachhta hi seva shs 2025  ', 0),
(711, 'en', 'node_search', ' team cbc bid farewell to ms v lalithalakshmi secretary capacity building commission and ceo karmyogi bharat team cbc bid farewell to ms v lalithalakshmi secretary capacity building commission and ceo karmyogi bharat admin tue 13 jan 2026 1212 team cbc bid farewell to ms v lalithalakshmi secretary capacity building commission and ceo karmyogi bharat we wish her the very best in all her future endeavors tue 16 sep 2025 1200 team cbc bid farewell to ms v lalithalakshmi secretary capacity building commission and ceo karmyogi bharat  ', 0),
(712, 'en', 'node_search', ' learning in action at the second edition of the advanced case writing workshop  learning in action at the second edition of the advanced case writing workshop admin tue 13 jan 2026 1229 learning in action at the second edition of the advanced case writing workshop today rajarshi dey s case study on ordnance factory balangir was used for a live teaching demonstration rajarshi an officer from national academy of defence production nagpur nadp and participant of last year s workshop developed this case to highlight how procurement practices can be strengthened with participants stepping into role plays guided by the teaching note the session came aliveshowing how case teaching can turn policy dilemmas into realtime learning experiences 📚 this case along with its teaching note faculty access only is now part of the amrit gyaan kosh on hashtag igot tue 16 sep 2025 1200 workshops learning in action at the second edition of the advanced case writing workshop  ', 0),
(713, 'en', 'node_search', ' second edition of advanced case writing workshop second edition of advanced case writing workshop admin tue 13 jan 2026 1233 advanced case writing workshop at irifm secunderabad indian railways institute of financial management irifm is proud to host the second edition of the advanced case writing workshop in collaboration with the capacity building commission cbc supported by the asian development bank adb and asian development bank institute adbi and featuring program instructors like blair cameron the world bank and prof sanjay dhir indian institute of technology delhi in person and ke seetha ram dr eng asian development bank institute virtually dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc in his opening address emphasized that policies are not born in textbooks they emerge from the experiences and partnership between government and citizens he further highlighted the hon ble prime minister s vision to adopt the case studies in indian context for training purposes in her address aparna garg director general irifm shared her perspective on the transformative role of case studies in officer training as the learning outcome is proven to be most optimal equipped with right learning the gap between government and governance gets minimized irifm is committed to contributing to this ecosystem of knowledge and to be a partner with cbc in this transformative mission mon 15 sep 2025 1200 telangana indian railways institute of financial management irifm secunderabad second edition of advanced case writing workshop  ', 0),
(714, 'en', 'node_search', ' the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program has commenced at one of india s premier healthcare institutions aiims new delhi the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program has commenced at one of india s premier healthcare institutions aiims new delhi admin tue 13 jan 2026 1239 the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program has commenced at one of india s premier healthcare institutions aiims new delhi which serves over 10000 patients every day addressing the second batch of master trainers dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission applauded their commitment and highlighted the program s vision of nurturing seva bhav spirit of service and svadharma sense of duty among civil servants officials were encouraged to step away from their desks and recognize that every action big or small shapes the lives of citizens this marks a fundamental shift from being processdriven to becoming purposedriven and moving from rule based to role based governance a true karmyogi moment was witnessed when six inspiring posters on who is a karmyogi and karmyogi moments were prepared by organisation and inaugurated by member hr with director aiims new delhi this symbolic gesture underscored the spirit of agility dedication and collective ownership the session marked a shared sankalp to strengthen india s healthcare system with aiims new delhi emerging as a model institution that will inspire and set benchmarks for others across the nation thu 11 sep 2025 1200 lsi delhi aiims new delhi the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program has commenced at one of india s premier healthcare institutions aiims new delhi  ', 0),
(715, 'en', 'node_search', ' capacity building commission cbc renews statement of intent with idinsight capacity building commission cbc renews statement of intent with idinsight admin tue 13 jan 2026 1243 the capacity building commission cbc is pleased to announce the renewal of its statement of intent with idinsight this partnership reflects our shared vision of strengthening datadriven governance and fostering a culture of continuous improvement across the civil services through this renewed collaboration cbc and idinsight will continue to work together to enhance the impact of capacitybuilding initiatives by leveraging rigorous research evidencebased strategies and actionable insights we look forward to deepening this partnership to drive more informed effective and citizencentric policies for a viksitbharat mon 8 sep 2025 1200 capacity building initiatives capacity building commission cbc capacity building commission cbc renews statement of intent with idinsight  ', 0),
(716, 'en', 'node_search', ' second edition of the advanced case writing workshop second edition of the advanced case writing workshop admin tue 13 jan 2026 1245 after the resounding success of its first edition the advanced case writing workshop returns this september with a bold missionto build a practicedriven knowledge ecosystem for the public sector the second edition will bring together 75 government officials across three cohorts delhi goa secunderabad for an intensive 3day workshop designed to enhance their case writing skills pillars of the workshop atmanirbharta in learning building a selfreliant indian casewriting ecosystem practicedriven knowledge converting governance experiences into learning resources skill building in case crafting developing impactful cases and teaching notes anchored in public sector challenges policy reflection teaching excellence advancing case pedagogy and policy insights global local collaboration featuring program instructors like blair cameron world bank and prof sanjay dhir iit delhi supported by the asian development bank adb and asian development bank institute adbi this workshop is shaping an indiacentric case writing ecosystem with global reach under mission karmayogi mon 1 sep 2025 1200 workshops second edition of the advanced case writing workshop  ', 0),
(717, 'en', 'node_search', ' dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission cbc visited the bel academy for excellence bengaluru dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission cbc visited the bel academy for excellence bengaluru admin tue 13 jan 2026 1247 dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission cbc visited the bel academy for excellence bengaluru a training institution that exemplifies sustainable design and capacity building the academy is envisaged to serve not only bel employees but also its customers vendors and partners especially msmes smes its programs are structured around three core areas quality technology and leadership designed in collaboration with experts from premier institutes such as iits iims iisc iete isi asq and others it was inspiring to discuss the academy s vision and its immediate priority of launching the quality improvement program qip together we look forward to elevating training standards and fostering continuous excellence in public sector learning wed 27 aug 2025 1200 karnataka bel academy for excellence bengaluru dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission cbc visited the bel academy for excellence bengaluru  ', 0),
(718, 'en', 'node_search', ' rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program rklsjsp phase ii rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program rklsjsp phase ii admin tue 13 jan 2026 1300 india s single largest behavioural training program is entering its most powerful phase scale with purpose today marks the final lead trainer batch at csoi new delhi under phase ii of the rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program rklsjsp a transformative initiative reimagining how civil servants are trained to serve with seva bhav phase ii trained 740 lead trainers 7500 master trainers who have already trained 157806 civil servants across bharat on igot as this pyramid of learning cascades further 700000 government officials will be empowered through 1day training sessions ensuring that every citizen experiences responsive empathetic and effective governance rklsjsp is a quiet revolution to realise viksit bharat one that touches lives villages and cities through every act of improved public service wed 27 aug 2025 1200 lsi delhi csoi kg marg new delhi rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program rklsjsp phase ii  ', 0),
(719, 'en', 'node_search', ' rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program has now trained over 100000 central government officials across bharat rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program has now trained over 100000 central government officials across bharat admin tue 13 jan 2026 1306 the largest behavioural change program in india s governance is shaping a new era of public service transformation a futureready civil service begins with capacity building at scale under hashtag missionkarmyogi the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program has now crossed its first major milestone 100000 central government officials across bharat trained to deliver governance with hashtag sevabhav at the core but this is only the beginning the journey ahead envisions training 700000 officials across the nation building a civil service that is citizenfocused technologyenabled and rooted in continuous learning where capacity building becomes second nature and public service keeps evolving to meet the aspirations of a viksit bharat this achievement stands as a testament to the collective effort of ministries states training institutions who have worked in unison shaping a system where knowledge spreads its wings and governance rises to serve better every single day cbc remains committed to accelerating this journey creating a culture where learning never stops and service to the people stays at the heart of governance for in the service of people the truest growth lies as knowledge spreads its wings a brighter bharat shall rise fri 22 aug 2025 1200 lsi rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program has now trained over 100000 central government officials across bharat  ', 0),
(720, 'en', 'node_search', ' mrs s radha chauhan assumes charge as chairperson capacity building commission mrs s radha chauhan assumes charge as chairperson capacity building commission admin tue 13 jan 2026 1309 mrs s radha chauhan assumed charge as the chairperson of capacity building commission in new delhi today she is a retired ias officer of up cadre 1988 batch she has served in various capacities in the state and centre government she is also the former secretary of department of personnel and training dopt she took charge from shri adil zainulbhai who served as chairman of the capacity building commission since april 2021 constituted on 1st april 2021 by the government of india the capacity building commission has been mandated to drive standardisation and harmonisation across the indian civil services landscape as the custodian of civil services capacity building reforms the commission s role is central to the overall institutional framework of mission karmayogi wed 6 aug 2025 1200 delhi capacity building commission new delhi mrs s radha chauhan assumes charge as chairperson capacity building commission  ', 0),
(721, 'en', 'node_search', ' government of j k capacity building commission and karmyogi bharat sign mou for capacity building of civil servants government of j k capacity building commission and karmyogi bharat sign mou for capacity building of civil servants admin tue 13 jan 2026 1311 in a major stride towards strengthening the capacitybuilding framework for civil servants in jammu kashmir the government of jammu kashmir the capacity building commission cbc and karmyogi bharat signed a tripartite memorandum of understanding mou on august 5 2025 in srinagar the mou aims to institutionalize mission karmyogi across j k by facilitating structured rolebased and continuous learning for government officials through the igot karmyogi platform the initiative will help build futureready and citizencentric civil service ecosystem in the region shri atal dulloo chief secretary government of jammu kashmir reiterated the government s commitment to enhancing governance through capacity building he emphasized the vital role of the general administration department gad and the institute of management public administration and rural development impard in leading the implementation efforts and expediting the onboarding of officials across departments onto the igot karmyogi platform the mou signing was attended by senior dignitaries including dr alka mittal member administration cbc shri m raju secretary general administration department j k smt rehana batul director general impard smt v lalithalakshmi ceo karmyogi bharat shri s p roy joint secretary cbc shri rakesh verma chief executive officer karmyogi bharat as part of the engagement an orientation session was attended by additional secretaries and deputy secretaries of various departments at impard the session was conducted by smt navneet kaur director cbc and shri rakesh verma coo karmyogi bharat who outlined the core objectives of mission karmyogi with a focus on digital learning needbased skilling and the transition to a competencydriven public administration system shri rakesh verma coo of karmyogi bharat delivered a live demonstration of the igot karmyogi platform highlighting its modular and selfpaced learning design he noted that over 126 crore learners across india have already benefited from the platform s flexible and contextual learning modules a key outcome of the event was the government of j k s affirmation to begin onboarding officials from different departments and launch their curated learning journeys on igot karmyogi the administration also expressed interest in implementing customized blended learning programs tailored to their unique developmental priorities this mou marks the beginning of a collaborative institutional effort to build a dynamic digitally empowered and continuously evolving public workforce aligned with the vision of mission karmyogi tue 5 aug 2025 1200 capacity building initiatives jammu and kashmir srinagar government of j k capacity building commission and karmayogi bharat sign mou for capacity building of civil servants  ', 0),
(722, 'en', 'node_search', ' on 4th august 2025 the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program was officially launched in itanagar on 4th august 2025 the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program was officially launched in itanagar admin tue 13 jan 2026 1315 arunachal pradesh takes a step towards citizenfirst governance on 4th august 2025 the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program was officially launched in itanagar by hon ble chief minister shri pema khandu marking a key milestone in the state s journey towards strengthening public service delivery under the vision of mission karmyogi the launch event was attended by several senior dignitaries including shri manish gupta chief secretary government of arunachal pradesh dr r balasubramaniam member human resources capacity building commission shri s p roy joint secretary capacity building commission and shri vivek hp secretary health family welfare government of arunachal pradesh along with secretaries and heads of departments from across the state administration speaking at the event dr r balasubramaniam shared the program s vision to build a more empathetic citizencentric civil service by training over 700000 government officials across the country he also highlighted the relevance of key mission karmyogi initiatives such as gyaan kosh and indian knowledge systems for the governance ecosystem of arunachal pradesh in his keynote address the hon ble chief minister reaffirmed the state s commitment to capacity building and formally launched the jan seva program underscoring its importance in empowering civil servants to deliver better outcomes for citizens this marks a significant step forward in advancing a responsive accountable and peoplefirst civil service mon 4 aug 2025 1200 lsi arunachal pradesh itanagar arunachal pradesh on 4th august 2025 the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program was officially launched in itanagar  ', 0),
(723, 'en', 'node_search', ' capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of chhattisgarh signed a memorandum of understanding mou  capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of chhattisgarh signed a memorandum of understanding mou admin tue 13 jan 2026 1321 in a significant step towards transforming the capacitybuilding landscape of civil servants in chhattisgarh the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of chhattisgarh signed a memorandum of understanding mou on 28th july 2025 in raipur the signing ceremony took place in the august presence of the hon ble chief minister of chhattisgarh shri vishnu deo sai in his address the hon ble chief minister affirmed that the initiative will be pivotal in nurturing a culture of excellence in governance and public administration across chhattisgarh the event was attended by senior dignitaries including shri amitabh jain chief secretary government of chhattisgarh dr alka mittal member administration capacity building commission shri subrat sahoo director general chhattisgarh academy of administration smt v lalithalakshmi secretary capacity building commission and chief executive officer karmyogi bharat and shri s p roy joint secretary capacity building commission as part of the engagement an orientation session was conducted for secretaries heads of departments and departmental nodal officers the session highlighted missionkarmyogi s vision of creating a futureready and citizencentric civil service through digital learning rolebased training and continuous professional development shri rakesh verma chief operating officer of karmyogi bharat provided a live demonstration of the igot karmyogi platform showcasing its key features that enable modular selfpaced and rolealigned learning he also emphasized the platform s growing impact with over 126 crore learners across the country benefiting from flexible needbased capacitybuilding opportunities a key outcome of the discussions was the government of chhattisgarh s commitment to onboard officials from various departments onto the igot platform and initiate their structured learning journeys the state also expressed interest in cocreating learning content tailored to its unique governance needs the mou marks the beginning of an institutional partnership to implement mission karmyogi s vision of a competencybased technologydriven and continuous learning ecosystem for government officials in chhattisgarh the capacity building commission extends its gratitude to the government of chhattisgarh for its steadfast commitment to advancing mission karmyogi in the state this collaboration underscores our shared resolve to empower public servants and foster a more agile accountable and citizencentric governance ecosystem mon 28 jul 2025 1200 chhattisgarh capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of chhattisgarh signed a memorandum of understanding mou  ', 0),
(724, 'en', 'node_search', ' s p roy joint secretary capacity building commission conducted an enlightening session on mission karmyogi s p roy joint secretary capacity building commission conducted an enlightening session on mission karmyogi admin tue 13 jan 2026 1328 s p roy joint secretary capacity building commission conducted an enlightening session on mission karmyogi for all faculties of mahatma gandhi state institute of public administration mgsipa on 25th july 25 he talked about the process of creating capacity building plans jan seva trainings amrit gyaan kosh faculty development program and the nscsti framework mgsipa is making strides in progress of mission karmyogi and also working towards creating culture and courses fostering indian knowledge systems fri 25 jul 2025 1200 chandigarh mahatma gandhi state institute of public administration mgsipa chandigarh s p roy joint secretary capacity building commission conducted an enlightening session on mission karmyogi  ', 0),
(725, 'en', 'node_search', ' mou was signed between the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the union territory of chandigarh mou was signed between the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the union territory of chandigarh admin tue 13 jan 2026 1334 on 25th july 2025 a landmark mou was signed between the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the union territory of chandigarh in the presence of the chief secretary ut chandigarh an mou between mgsipa and chandigarh administration was also formalized to further the goals of mission karmyogi in the region ms v lalithalakshmi ias secretary cbc and ceo karmyogi bharat emphasized the importance of mandatory annual course completions on the igot karmyogi platform and informed about its linkage with apars as directed by dopt she also highlighted the new scoring framework that assesses ministries departments on their capacity building progress sh shyama prasad roy joint secretary cbc introduced the rashtriya karmyogi jan seva program a behavioural training initiative and urged for early identification of master trainers in chandigarh to enable its rollout before 15th august 2025 ms alka mittal member admin cbc joined the event virtually and lauded chandigarh administration for onboarding over 25000 officials enrolling in 100000 courses and completing 90000 learning modules on the igot karmyogi platform shri rajeev verma chief secretary chandigarh directed all departments to expedite onboarding and course completion and proposed a review meeting under his chairmanship to track progress this collaboration marks a significant step toward transforming governance through continuous learning and upskilling under mission karmyogi fri 25 jul 2025 1200 chandigarh chandigarh administration mou was signed between the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the union territory of chandigarh  ', 0),
(726, 'en', 'node_search', ' dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc visited the dmrc academy to engage with the institution and gain insights into its training approach dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc visited the dmrc academy to engage with the institution and gain insights into its training approach admin tue 13 jan 2026 1337 dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission visited the delhi metro rail corporation dmrc academy today to engage with the institution and gain insights into its training approach and organizational development model the academy has demonstrated consistent improvements in training quality currently holding a threestar rating under the nscsti framework dr balu reviewed their ongoing practices and experienced the simulationbased training technology used in preparing metro pilots he encouraged the academy to 1 share selected training modules on the igot platform 2 contribute case studies to the amrit gyaan kosh and 3 pursue reaccreditation under nscsti for continued quality enhancement member hr also urged the academy to strive for higher benchmarks of excellence and actively share its practices and learnings across the broader capacity building ecosystem cbc and dmrc academy discussed potential avenues for future collaboration in training design and knowledge exchange the commission expresses its sincere appreciation to mr ghansham bansal dean dmrc academy and his team for their hospitality and commitment to strengthening public service training thu 24 jul 2025 1200 chandigarh delhi metro rail corporation dmrc delhi dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc visited the dmrc academy to engage with the institution and gain insights into its training approach  ', 0),
(727, 'en', 'node_search', ' cbc in collaboration with the housing urban development department government of odisha conducted a capacitybuilding workshop cbc in collaboration with the housing urban development department government of odisha conducted a capacitybuilding workshop admin tue 13 jan 2026 1413 in alignment with our mission to empower urban local body ulb officials to be citizencentric futureready and outcomesdriven the capacity building commission cbc in collaboration with the housing urban development department government of odisha conducted a capacitybuilding workshop on 23rd july 2025 at the odisha urban academy oua bhubaneswar the workshop convened 100 ulb officials from across the state and featured domain and functional sessions on key areas such as the principles of missionkarmayogi public procurement and budget planning for ulbs among others equipping officials with the tools to drive more effective and accountable urban governance a major highlight was the demonstration of the igotkarmayogi platform emphasizing its rolebased digital learning capabilities with over 3 lakh officials from odisha already onboarded the state stands at the forefront of india s digital capacitybuilding transformation the workshop was graced by senior dignitaries from both the centre and the state including dr alka mittal member administration cbc smt usha padhee ias principal secretary h ud department government of odisha shri s p roy joint secretary cbc shri satrughna kar additional secretary h ud department government of odisha and dr santanu rath director odisha urban academy their presence and insights reaffirmed the shared commitment to strengthening institutional and individual capacities this initiative marks a significant step toward scalable inclusive and sustained capacity building across odisha s ulb ecosystem wed 23 jul 2025 1200 workshops odisha odisha urban academy oua bhubaneswar cbc in collaboration with the housing urban development department government of odisha conducted a capacitybuilding workshop cbc in collaboration with the housing urban development department government of odisha conducted a capacitybuilding workshop ', 0),
(728, 'en', 'node_search', ' nscsti 20 was officially launched by the hon ble minister of state for personnel public grievances and pensions dr jitendra singh nscsti 20 was officially launched by the hon ble minister of state for personnel public grievances and pensions dr jitendra singh admin tue 13 jan 2026 1416 the national standards for civil services training institutions nscsti 20 was officially launched by the hon ble minister of state for personnel public grievances and pensions dr jitendra singh at csoi vinay marg new delhi developed by the capacity building commission cbc under mission karmayogi nscsti 20 marks a significant upgrade to the world s first accreditation framework designed exclusively for civil services training institutions cstis the framework offers enhanced flexibility addresses emerging tech needs and promotes a holistic futureready and communitydriven ecosystem for civil services training institutions in the keynote address by hon ble minister dr jitendra singh emphasized the importance of creating futureready civil servants through globally benchmarked outcomeoriented training systems he noted that nscsti 20 reflects india s commitment to building a citizencentric and performancedriven bureaucracy setting the context for the new framework adil zainulbhai chairman cbc highlighted the need for cstis to evolve in step with a rapidly changing governance landscape and underlined the importance of continuous institutional learning and improvement dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc outlined the new and unique features of the framework including the karmayogi competency model kcm the amrit gyaan kosh digital knowledge repository and the indian knowledge system iks dr alka mittal member admin cbc spoke about the importance of quality in public training and urged cstis to pursue reaccreditation under the upgraded framework she highlighted that nscsti 20 is not just about compliance but about driving a culture of excellence innovation and accountability in training the event featured dignitaries from dopt cbc and karmayogi bharat who spoke about the importance of strengthening the training ecosystem of civil services and furthering the vision of viksit bharat 2047 as part of the launch a ceremonial distribution of certificates was also held for institutes which were accredited under nscsti 10 recognizing the efforts of the civil service training institutions that have met national standards of excellence nscsti 20 sets a new benchmark in public sector training globally and reflects india s leadership in governance reform and digital transformation in capacity building fri 18 jul 2025 1200 ministry of company affairs delhi csoi vinay marg new delhi nscsti 20 was officially launched by the hon ble minister of state for personnel public grievances and pensions dr jitendra singh nscsti 20 was officially launched by the hon ble minister of state for personnel public grievances and pensions dr jitendra singh  ', 0),
(729, 'en', 'node_search', ' lead trainer training under the rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program of cbc was held from 14th to 18th july at hipa gurgaon lead trainer training under the rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program of cbc was held from 14th to 18th july at hipa gurgaon admin tue 13 jan 2026 1422 lead trainer training under the rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program of cbc was held from 14th to 18th july at hipa gurgaon mon 14 jul 2025 1200 haryana hipa gurgaon lead trainer training under the rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program of cbc was held from 14th to 18th july at hipa gurgaon lead trainer training under the rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program of cbc was held from 14th to 18th july at hipa gurgaon ', 0),
(730, 'en', 'node_search', ' meeting with hon ble cm smt rekha gupta and chief secretary to discuss the way forward for implementing mission karmyogi in the government of nct of delhi meeting with hon ble cm smt rekha gupta and chief secretary to discuss the way forward for implementing mission karmyogi in the government of nct of delhi admin tue 13 jan 2026 1421 capacity building commission along with karmyogi bharat met the hon ble chief minister of delhi smt rekha gupta and chief secretary to discuss the way forward for implementing missionkarmyogi in the government of nct of delhi under the hon ble cm s leadership delhi is set to onboard 80000 officials onto the igotkarmyogi platformmarking a significant step in building a futureready civil service the discussion led to 3 key outcomes 100 onboarding all group a b and c officials of the delhi government will be onboarded on igot portal to enable continuous structured learning departmental participation a directive will be issued mandating participation of all departments with a nodal officer designated to drive the effort jan seva rollout a largescale citizenfirst governance initiative will be launched across departments mission karmyogi continues to expand across states and uts empowering every civil servant with the competencies and tools to deliver better governance and public service wed 30 apr 2025 1200 delhi delhi meeting with hon ble cm smt rekha gupta and chief secretary to discuss the way forward for implementing mission karmyogi in the government of nct of delhi ', 0);
