(731, 'en', 'node_search', ' bihar learning week 1117 july 2025  bihar learning week 1117 july 2025 admin tue 13 jan 2026 1423 under missionkarmayogi states are stepping forward to build a culture of continuous learning and bihar joins the growing list embracing it as envisioned by the hon ble prime minister shri narendra modi ji every state is being encouraged to onboard onto igotkarmayogi to make learning a core part of governance after successful learning weeks in andaman nicobar maharashtra and rajasthan it s encouraging to see bihar take this forward through the launch of biharlearningweek 1117 july 2025 a powerful step toward building a selfdriven and futureready government workforce as part of mission karmayogi every official is encouraged to complete at least 4 hours of learning on igot platform or curated webinars this growing momentum reflects a shared national commitment to make learning continuous relevant and rooted inservice delivery congratulations to the government of bihar capacity building commission and karmayogi bharat team for taking this forward fri 11 jul 2025 1200 bihar bihar bihar learning week 1117 july 2025  bihar learning week 1117 july 2025  ', 0),
(732, 'en', 'node_search', ' memberhr dr r balasubramaniam cbc led a workshop on 10th july 2025 for capacity building units of mdos memberhr dr r balasubramaniam cbc led a workshop on 10th july 2025 for capacity building units of mdos admin tue 13 jan 2026 1428 memberhr dr r balasubramaniam capacity building commission led a workshop on 10th july 2025 for capacity building units of mdos attended by cbu heads and officials from 30 ministries and departments it focused on 🔹 clarifying the roles of cbus 🔹understanding what competencies are needed for different roles 🔹 improving implementation and monitoring of capacity building plans cbps 🔹 planning for domain course development and the rashtriya karmayogi large scale jan seva program rollout 🔹facilitating crosslearning through the exchange of good practices across ministries dr anju rathi rana ils secretary department of legal affairs shared impactful best practices for implementing mission karmayogi undertaken under her leadership setting a strong example for peer ministries the workshop enabled cbus to recalibrate their strategies for structured demanddriven capacity building aligned with the karmayogi competency model thu 10 jul 2025 1200 delhi delhi memberhr dr r balasubramaniam cbc led a workshop on 10th july 2025 for capacity building units of mdos  ', 0),
(733, 'en', 'node_search', ' signing of mou between capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of tripura signing of mou between capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of tripura admin tue 13 jan 2026 1426 through deep partnerships with states the capacity building commission is building the foundation for a futureready civil service one that is skilled responsive and aligned to the aspirations of a changing india today a tripartite mou was signed between the capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of tripura marking a key milestone in strengthening governance capabilities in the state the signing was followed by an orientation session led by dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc introducing the framework and vision of missionkarmyogi ms shobhana rana advisor on content development and partnerships karmyogi bharat familiarised officials with the functionalities and usage of igotkarmyogi platform shri jk sinha chief secretary tripura reaffirmed the state s resolve to promote mindset change and strengthen a governance model that is both citizencentric and digitally driven s p roy joint secretary cbc outlined specific areas where tripura can collaborate with cbc and karmyogibharat reinforcing the state s intent to embed structured capacitybuilding in its governance approach the orientation witnessed active participation from secretaries special secretaries directors and heads of 51 departments of the government of tripura with this partnership tripura joins the national movement to build responsive capable and futureready civil service contributing to the vision of viksitbharat the state is also experimenting with several transformational initiatives offering valuable learnings for cbc and other states we collaborate with thu 24 apr 2025 1200 pragna bhavan agartala tripura signing of mou between capacity building commission cbc karmyogi bharat and the government of tripura ', 0),
(734, 'en', 'node_search', ' capacity building commission and karmayogi bharat jointly hosted digimanthan at vigyan bhawan event date 16 april 2024 capacity building commission and karmayogi bharat jointly hosted digimanthan at vigyan bhawan event date 16 april 2024 adarsh tue 13 jan 2026 1426 capacity building commission and karmayogi bharat jointly hosted digimanthan at vigyan bhawan on 160424 to help civil services training institutions create more elearning courses in a significant step towards embracing technology central training institutes are stepping up their game yesterday 24 ctis committed to launching a total of 78 digital courses by june 30th this initiative will revolutionize the delivery of digital training for all central civil servants tue 16 apr 2024 1200 vigyan bhawan new delhi capacity building commission and karmayogi bharat jointly hosted digimanthan at vigyan bhawan event date 16 april 2024 ', 0),
(735, 'en', 'node_search', ' dr r balasubramaniam memberhr capacity building commission participated as a panelist in the session on iks and institutional building  dr r balasubramaniam memberhr capacity building commission participated as a panelist in the session on iks and institutional building admin tue 13 jan 2026 1431 dr r balasubramaniam memberhr capacity building commission participated as a panelist in the session on iks and institutional building at the first annual academic conference on indian knowledge systems held at jawaharlal nehru university the session focused on the relevance of indian knowledge systems iks in shaping institutional frameworks and building public leadership dr balasubramaniam spoke about how iks and capacity building are closely linked particularly in the context of lifelong learning as a continuous process for both individuals and institutions he also highlighted the need to integrate citizencentric governance as a core outcome of capacity building efforts drawing on indigenous knowledge and contextual understanding to make public systems more responsive and inclusive the conference brought together academics practitioners and policymakers to explore how iks can inform contemporary governance and institutional development in india thu 10 jul 2025 1200 delhi jawaharlal nehru university new delhi dr r balasubramaniam memberhr capacity building commission participated as a panelist in the session on iks and institutional building  ', 0),
(736, 'en', 'node_search', ' daksh leadership program for senior executives of public sector enterprises pses  daksh leadership program for senior executives of public sector enterprises pses admin tue 13 jan 2026 1432 on 21st april 2025 the capacity building commission in partnership with scope standing conference of public enterprises launched daksh development of aspiration knowledge succession and harmony a firstofitskind leadership program designed exclusively for senior executives of india s central public sector enterprises cpses with mckinsey company and indian institute of management ahmedabad as knowledge partners daksh is a transformative initiative that aims to build a futureready valuedriven leadership pipeline for the public sector the program was launched by shri arunish chawla secretary dipam in the presence of shri adil zainulbhai chairman cbc smt soma mondal member public enterprises selection board pesb shri kp mahadevaswamy chairman scope shri atul sobti dg scope and dr alka mittal member administration cbc their powerful insights set the tone for a futureready purposedriven leadership agenda the cmds and director hr s of cpses also attended the launch program as cpses play a central role in india s economic and social development it is critical to develop competent innovative and agile leaders daksh is about preparing leaders to navigate complexity scale impact and steer india s most strategic institutions towards inclusive sustainable growth it is a unique program built on worldclass design principles tailored to the indian context as the daksh leadership journey began for the first cohort of over 70 senior officers of cpses it is set to become a global benchmark in public leadership development mon 21 apr 2025 1200 scope new delhi daksh leadership program for senior executives of public sector enterprises pses  ', 0),
(737, 'en', 'node_search', ' capacity building commission cbc has signed a contract with the kaivalya education foundation kef  capacity building commission cbc has signed a contract with the kaivalya education foundation kef admin tue 13 jan 2026 1436 capacity building commission cbc has signed a contract with the kaivalya education foundation kef to lead a transformative initiative focused on strengthening panchayati raj institutions pris as part of this partnership 60 gram panchayats across andhra pradesh assam gujarat and odisha will see implementation of a demonstrable measurable and scalable model of capacity building at the grassroots level anchored in the vision of mission karmayogi the initiative aims to enhance the capabilities of both elected representatives and government functionaries fostering more effective responsive and citizencentric governance key highlights 🔹 techenabled ecosystem for continuous capacity building 🔹 custombuilt elearning platform mobile app and aipowered chatbot 🔹 personalized learning and ondemand support for pri members 🔹 onground implementation anchored by kef under the guidance of cbc this partnership marks a major milestone as mission karmayogi expands to the last mile empowering local institutions to become futureready agents of change together we re moving closer to a viksit bharat through stronger more accountable panchayats wed 9 jul 2025 1200 delhi capacity building commission cbc new delhi capacity building commission cbc has signed a contract with the kaivalya education foundation kef  ', 0),
(738, 'en', 'node_search', ' state level capacity building workshop on mission karmyogi and review of urban development department schemes state level capacity building workshop on mission karmyogi and review of urban development department schemes admin tue 13 jan 2026 1439 tue 24 jun 2025 1200 vishakha auditorium uttar pradesh state level capacity building workshop on mission karmyogi and review of urban development department schemes  ', 0),
(739, 'en', 'node_search', ' rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva programme rklsjsp for secretaries and additional secretaries rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva programme rklsjsp for secretaries and additional secretaries admin tue 13 jan 2026 1439 top leadership is in the room today because true transformation requires alignment at every level bottomup change only succeeds when it is met with committed valuedriven leadership from the top that is why secretaries and additional secretaries from over 40 ministries and departments are undergoing an immersive orientation to lead phase ii of the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva programme rklsjsp india s largest cognitive and behavioural transformation in governance this program is not about policy tweaks or procedural shiftsit s about reimagining public service itself designed to reach over 700000 government officials across bharat rashtriya karmyogi aims to instill hashtag sevabhaav strengthen purpose and embed citizenfirst thinking across the system as the architects of india s governance machinery secretaries and additional secretaries are not just participantsthey are the catalysts of this mission anchoring the change within their ministries and setting the tone for cascading leadership across the country mon 7 apr 2025 1200 sushma swaraj bhawan new delhi rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva programme rklsjsp for secretaries and additional secretaries ', 0),
(740, 'en', 'node_search', ' learning development workshop at national academy of agricultural sciences naas learning development workshop at national academy of agricultural sciences naas admin tue 13 jan 2026 1444 at the heart of today s learning development workshop at national academy of agricultural sciences naas india teams stepped into innovation labscrafting the future of grassroots governance as part of the capacity building program for viksitpanchayat each breakout room became a hub of collaboration where realworld challenges were met with purposedriven design the modules being shaped go beyond theory they are anchored in field realities focused on equipping panchayat leaders with the skills mindsets and tools needed to lead transformation on the ground with citizencentricity at their core these learning journeys aim to make local governance the driving force behind a truly viksitbharat mon 7 apr 2025 1200 nass pusa delhi learning development workshop at national academy of agricultural sciences naas ', 0),
