(743, 'en', 'node_search', ' rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program phase 1 rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program phase 1 admin tue 13 jan 2026 1444 with 6000 officials trained across 49 mdos so far the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program phase 1 is helping government officials connect their work with service to citizens today department of administrative reforms and public grievances government of india and department of pension pensioners welfare doppw hosted an event to share feedback and thank the capacity building commission cbc for facilitating phase 1 of the program for their departments the training had a noticeable impact on officershelping them reflect on their work with greater clarity build stronger connections with citizens and understand how their roles contribute to the broader goals of governance seeing this shift among their teams the departments came together to acknowledge the value of the program and express their appreciation for the structured approach taken by cbc master trainers and participants spoke about how the training helped them reflect on their role and connect daily tasks with a deeper purpose of public service shri srinivas voruganti secretary darpg and doppw appreciated the training effort and its relevance for improving public service delivery dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc and adil zainulbhai chairman cbc shared their remarks and thanked officials for their honest reflections and participation we now look forward to phase 2 which will train 700000 officials across bharat further strengthening citizenfirst governance thu 27 mar 2025 1200 nass pusa delhi rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program phase 1 ', 0),
(744, 'en', 'node_search', ' oneday capacity building workshop for urban local bodies ulbs of the state at the haryana institute of public administration hipa gurugram oneday capacity building workshop for urban local bodies ulbs of the state at the haryana institute of public administration hipa gurugram admin tue 13 jan 2026 1446 under missionkarmayogi the capacity building commission cbc in collaboration with the directorate of urban local bodies dulb government of haryana organized a oneday capacity building workshop for urban local bodies ulbs of the state at the haryana institute of public administration hipa gurugram the workshop witnessed the participation of over 100 senior officials including municipal council presidents commissioners district municipal commissioners executive officers and representatives from dulb and hipa participants were introduced to the igotkarmayogi platform aimed at fostering a culture of anytime anywhere continuouslearning for government officials deliberations throughout the day centered on embedding the principles of citizencentric governance and enhancing service delivery key principles of mission karmayogi the event was graced by the presence of smt rajrani malhotra hon ble mayor gurugram municipal corporation dr alka mittal member administration cbc shri pankaj director general dulb haryana shri s p roy joint secretary cbc and shri pradeep dahiya commissioner municipal corporation gurugram this workshop marks a pivotal step in equipping haryana s urban governance ecosystem with the skills and capacities needed to realize the vision of viksitbharat2047 wed 18 jun 2025 1200 haryana haryana institute of public administration hipa gurugram oneday capacity building workshop for urban local bodies ulbs of the state at the haryana institute of public administration hipa gurugram  ', 0),
(745, 'en', 'node_search', ' signing of mou for daksh a common leadership program for senior leaders of cpses signing of mou for daksh a common leadership program for senior leaders of cpses admin tue 13 jan 2026 1449 as part of missionkarmayogi capacity building commission cbc is committed to enhancing the competencies of all civil servants including those in central public sector enterprises cpses in today s dynamic and rapidly evolving landscape cpses need agile and futureready leaders capable of driving transformative growth to support this vision cbc in collaboration with the standing conference of public enterprises scope signed an mou on 17th june 2025 to launch the second edition of the daksh program this program under this initiative will be delivered with egon zehnder as the knowledge partner and the indian institute of management indore as the academic partner egon zehnder and iim indore will codesign and implement a cuttingedge leadership program focused on building strategic functional and behavioral capabilities among senior cpse executives the program is tailored for highpotential leadersgms cgms and edswho are poised to take on boardlevel roles in the near future through this initiative we aim to create a robust talent pipeline of visionary and competent public sector leaders we express our sincere gratitude to our esteemed committee members mr ayush gupta director hr gail india limited mr k k singh director personnel steel authority of india limited dr vinay ranjan phd director hr coal india limited for their continued support and guidance thanks to dr alka mittal member admin cbc and mr atul sobti director general scope for their drive and leadership in making this happen this is a step forward in shaping a new generation of visionary public sector leadersleaders who will help deliver a capable competent and confident viksitbharat tue 17 jun 2025 1200 delhi scope delhi signing of mou for daksh a common leadership program for senior leaders of cpses