(765, 'en', 'node_search', ' nscsti workshop was conducted as part of the consultative process to update the accreditation framework nscsti workshop was conducted as part of the consultative process to update the accreditation framework admin tue 13 jan 2026 1515 on feb 10 2025 the national standards for civil service training institutes nscsti workshop was conducted as part of the consultative process to update the nscsti accreditation framework the workshop aimed to gather comprehensive feedback from all stakeholders including training institutes onsite assessors desktop assessors to refine the framework s 8 pillars a total of 40 training institutes participated including 6 administrative training institutes atis 15 central civil service training institutes ctis the event was chaired by adil zainulbhai chairman cbc who emphasized importance of this reiterative process in developing a framework that is both accessible for training institutes aspirational in driving continuous improvement dr r balasubramaniam member hr capacity building commission spoke to the institutes about the various initiatives under the commission aimed strengthening facilitating the capacity building of civil service training institutes across the country to facilitate indepth discussions institutes were divided into 3 breakout groups each focusing on specific pillars of framework group 1 was led by sh adil zainulbhai group 2 by smt v lalithalakshmi ceo karmayogi bharat group 3 by dr alka mittal member admin cbc participants deliberated on which aspects of the framework should be retained proposed modifications to enhance its effectivenesseach group then presented their insights to larger gathering exchanging notes identifying key problem areas the valuable feedback gathered from workshop will be incorporated into revised framework which is set to be rolled out in may 2025 ensuring it remains both relevant progressive for training institutes across the country mon 10 feb 2025 1200 nscsti workshop was conducted as part of the consultative process to update the accreditation framework ', 0),
(766, 'en', 'node_search', ' office of the controller general of patents designs and trade marks cgpdtm organized sessions for newly appointed officials focusing on mission karmayogi office of the controller general of patents designs and trade marks cgpdtm organized sessions for newly appointed officials focusing on mission karmayogi admin tue 13 jan 2026 1517 on january 31 and february 1 2025 the office of the controller general of patents designs and trade marks cgpdtm organized simultaneous sessions in nagpur and hyderabad for newly appointed officials focusing on missionkarmayogi s p roy joint secretary capacity building commission delivered an insightful lecture on the mission s significance and its pivotal role in transforming civil services mission karmayogi officially known as the national programme for civil services capacity building npcscb was approved by the government of india on september 2 2020 it aims to transition civil services from a rulebased to a rolebased system emphasizing competency development and fostering a culture of continuouslearning among government officials the sessions underscored the mission s objective to equip civil servants with the necessary skills and knowledge to meet the evolving challenges of governance by leveraging digitallearning platforms and structured training modules mission karmayogi aspires to create a futureready civil service dedicated to serving the nation effectively the participation of the newly appointed cgpdtm officials in these sessions marks a significant step towards enhancing their capabilities and aligning them with the mission s vision such initiatives are crucial in building a proficient and responsive civil service committed to the nation s progress fri 31 jan 2025 1200 office of the controller general of patents designs and trade marks cgpdtm organized sessions for newly appointed officials focusing on mission karmayogi ', 0),
(767, 'en', 'node_search', ' from rule to role mission karmayogi redefining governance dr jitendra singh at ai for capacity building event by cbc from rule to role mission karmayogi redefining governance dr jitendra singh at ai for capacity building event by cbc admin tue 13 jan 2026 1521 capacity building commission cbc and karmayogi bharat in collaboration with the india ai mission organised an event on ai for capacity building transforming governance in new delhi at the inaugural session mos dr jitendra singh said that mission karmayogi and igot platform are built on prime minister narendra modi s vision to shift governance from rulebased to rolebased functioning the minister said that a hybrid model combining artificial intelligence with human intelligence will be critical to building a futureready responsive and effective public administration he further mentioned that the igot platform has adopted aidriven tools such as ai saarthi ai tutor and aibased capacity building plans these tools he said are enabling personalised learning pathways faster planning and improved delivery across ministries and departments the event was attended by senior dignitaries including smt rachna shah secretary department of personnel training smt s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission and shri subramanian ramadorai chairperson karmayogi bharat along with senior officers from the centre and states representatives from academia industry training institutions and capacity building units across ministries smt rachna shah secretary dopt emphasised that ai can significantly strengthen transparent responsive and citizencentric governance by improving relevance timeliness and personalisation in capacity building while underscoring the importance of ethical safeguards and inclusive access smt chhavi bhardwaj ceo kb highlighted that igot has emerged as the foundational digital infrastructure for public sector capacity building with over 15 crore learners and more than 67 crore course completions a key highlight of the event was the launch of karmayogi classroom a new aienabled feature on the igot karmayogi platform designed to enhance contextual interactive and personalised learning for civil servants the program also featured live demonstrations and thought leadership sessions by leading ai ecosystem partners showcasing ai tutors aidriven capacity building plans competency mapping tools and indigenous ai solutions tailored for public administration press release thu 8 jan 2026 1200 capacity building initiatives delhi vigyan bhawan new delhi from rule to role mission karmayogi redefining governance dr jitendra singh at ai for capacity building event by cbc  ', 0),
(768, 'en', 'node_search', ' mos dr jitendra singh inaugurated the advanced case writing and teaching workshop and launched the amrit gyaan kosh portal mos dr jitendra singh inaugurated the advanced case writing and teaching workshop and launched the amrit gyaan kosh portal admin tue 13 jan 2026 1521 honored to have dr jitendra singh union minister of state for personnel public grievances and pensions inaugurate the advanced case writing and teaching workshop and officially launch the amrit gyaan kosh portal at the sushma swaraj institute of foreign service ssifs new delhi today this initiative by the capacity building commission in collaboration with asian development bank institute adbi and the stanford leadership academy for development lad marks the beginning of a transformative journey to institutionalize casebased learning in governance the amrit gyaan kosh portal is now live offering complete access to atmanirbhar case studies and supporting materials on igot it is more than a repositoryit s a national knowledge treasure designed to empower faculty and practitioners to create contextual impactful governance models facilitate experiential learning by capturing realworld challenges and solutions foster collaboration and innovation across academies and sectors this initiative is aligned with the vision of making learning just a click away ensuring accessible highquality indigenous resources for governance professionals and academies together let s embark on this transformative journey to empower public service delivery and inspire future generations mon 9 dec 2024 1200 sushma swaraj institute of foreign service ssifs new delhi mos dr jitendra singh inaugurated the advanced case writing and teaching workshop and launched the amrit gyaan kosh portal ', 0),
(769, 'en', 'node_search', ' chairman nhai and member admin capacity building commission held a pivotal meeting to strengthen nhai s workforce chairman nhai and member admin capacity building commission held a pivotal meeting to strengthen nhai s workforce admin tue 13 jan 2026 1524 chairman nhai and member admin capacity building commission held a pivotal meeting to strengthen nhai s workforce for dealing with the complexities of modern infrastructure development key note address was given by member cbc emphasizing the need for technical leadership and problemsolving skills and stressing on the importance of continuous learning and creating a culture of excellence the chairman stressed on the nhai team to focus on behavioral domain and functional competencies s p roy joint secretary cbc laid down the steps involved in the creation of the capacity building plan and assured full support of cbc and pwc in developing the capacity building program for nhai the kick off meeting ended with member admin cbc highlighting the scope for continuous improvement hoping that nhai as an apex institution will set a benchmark for others in the infrastructure sector fri 29 nov 2024 1200 nhai chairman nhai and member admin capacity building commission held a pivotal meeting to strengthen nhai s workforce ', 0),
(770, 'en', 'node_search', ' taking the pledge by reading the preamble of the constitution of india taking the pledge by reading the preamble of the constitution of india admin tue 13 jan 2026 1527 constitution day is celebrated in our country on 26th november every year to commemorate the adoption of the constitution of india on 26th november 1949 the constituent assembly of india adopted the constitution of india which came into effect from 26th january 1950 tue 26 nov 2024 1200 capacity building commission taking the pledge by reading the preamble of the constitution of india ', 0),
(771, 'en', 'node_search', ' mission karmayogi team led by dr alka mittal member capacity building commission called on the hon ble governor of himachal pradesh shri shiv pratap shukla mission karmayogi team led by dr alka mittal member capacity building commission called on the hon ble governor of himachal pradesh shri shiv pratap shukla admin tue 13 jan 2026 1530 mission karmayogi team led by dr alka mittal member capacity building commission called on the hon ble governor of himachal pradesh shri shiv pratap shukla on 21st november 2024 in raj bhawan shimla team consisting of officials from cbc and karmayogi bharat discussed various initiatives and interventions related to capacity building of the officials of himachal pradesh the team had brief interaction with the chief secretary shri prabodh saxena and secretary urban development shri devesh kumar to discuss the way forward for capacity building in the state of himachal pradesh thu 21 nov 2024 1200 raj bhawan shimla mission karmayogi team led by dr alka mittal member capacity building commission called on the hon ble governor of himachal pradesh shri shiv pratap shukla ', 0),
(772, 'en', 'node_search', ' mou signing and workshop on mission karmayogi with the state of assam mou signing and workshop on mission karmayogi with the state of assam admin tue 13 jan 2026 1533 a tripartite mou was signed between the capacity building commission cbc karmayogi bharat and the government of assam india marking an important step in the mission to strengthen governance capabilities the signing ceremony was attended by the chief secretary of assam dr ravi kota ias dr r balasubramaniam member hr cbc dr alka mittal member admin cbc smt v lalithalakshmi secretary cbc ceo of karmayogi bharat and shri s p roy secretary cbc following the signing a workshop outlined key achievements of missionkarmayogi over the past three years including cbc and karmayogi bharat s work with central and state governments discussions covered promising areas of collaboration such as cbc s viksit panchayat initiative interventions with urban local bodies development of a centre of excellence for urban planning and development for assam districtlevel leadership program principal secretaries and department heads from assam s secretariat participated in the workshop chief secretary dr ravi kota ji expressed the state s commitment to effective governance through capacitybuilding and ongoing collaboration with cbc and karmayogibharat together cbc karmayogi bharat and the government of assam are excited to enhance the capacity in public administration paving the way for a brighter and more empowered future and contributing to viksitbharat mon 11 nov 2024 1200 assam mou signing and workshop on mission karmayogi with the state of assam ', 0),
(773, 'en', 'node_search', ' national learning week launched by our hon ble prime minister shri narendra modi national learning week launched by our hon ble prime minister shri narendra modi admin tue 13 jan 2026 1536 we are delighted to announce the karmayogisaptah national learning week nlw will be launched by our hon ble prime minister shri narendra modi at 10 am the nlw from 19th25th october is aimed to inspire civil servants to embrace a culture of continuous learning crucial for driving india towards viksitbharat we invite you to join us https lnkdin gzngf28 also as part of your commitment to professional excellence we encourage all civil servants to dedicate at least 4 hours to completing igot courses this week igot certificates and karma points will be awarded to recognize your efforts let s come together to make the karmayogi saptah a grand success sat 19 oct 2024 1200 dr ambedkar international centre new delhi national learning week launched by our hon ble prime minister shri narendra modi ', 0),
(774, 'en', 'node_search', ' workshop on mission karmayogi for capacity building units of ministries departments workshop on mission karmayogi for capacity building units of ministries departments admin tue 13 jan 2026 1538 the department of personnel training hosted the workshop on mission karmayogi for capacity building units of ministries departments on october 3 2024 in new delhi the workshop underscored the evolving role of ministries and departments in capacity building reinforcing cbc s efforts to equip civil servants with the competencies needed to achieve viksit bharat the capacity building commission cbc presented key highlights of the upcoming national learning week aimed at fostering sevabhaav and aligning civil servants with the vision of viksitbharat through continuous learning cbc also shared updates on the karmayogi seva bhaav program a largescale behavioral intervention set to engage 700000 central government employees this initiative designed to develop 20000 karmayogi coaches seeks to instill a spirit of public service enhancing the delivery of citizencentric governance mission karmayogi is in full momentum as national learning week approaches thu 3 oct 2024 1200 csoi vinay marg new delhi workshop on mission karmayogi for capacity building units of ministries departments ', 0),
(775, 'en', 'node_search', ' cbc meet with secretary for public service mauritius  cbc meet with secretary for public service mauritius admin tue 13 jan 2026 1540 capacity building commission met mr koosiram conhye secretary for public service mauritius to discuss proposed capacitybuilding programs by cbc and igot the 3 member delegation showed keen interest in the largescale interventions undertaken by the capacity building commission cbc along with the igot online platform which provides competencybased courses for civil servants they were excited to try out some courses themselves the collaboration aims to strengthen international partnerships and enhance global best practices in civil service governance they were very complimentary of the speed and scale of the efforts in india on capacity building wed 25 sep 2024 1200 capacity building commission new delhi cbc meet with secretary for public service mauritius  ', 0),
(776, 'en', 'node_search', ' pledge taking ceremony on swachh bharat campaign at cbc pledge taking ceremony on swachh bharat campaign at cbc admin tue 13 jan 2026 1543 pledge taking ceremony on swachh bharat campaign at cbc tue 24 sep 2024 1200 cbc new delhi pledge taking ceremony on swachh bharat campaign at cbc ', 0),
(777, 'en', 'node_search', ' visit of cbc team at istm visit of cbc team at istm admin tue 13 jan 2026 1546 the capacity building commission team led by dr alka mittal member administration along with ms v lalithalakshmi secretary ms anuradha mukharjee retd irs official and qip mentor and ms navneet kaur director conducted onsite meetings at the institute of secretariat training and management istm delhi focusing on the quality improvement plan qip based on the nscsti framework this initiative is driving significant progress in enhancing training quality the institute remains committed to contributing to the nation s capacitybuilding efforts fri 20 sep 2024 1200 istm new delhi visit of cbc team at istm  ', 0),
(778, 'en', 'node_search', ' signing of mou with piramal foundation for education leadership signing of mou with piramal foundation for education leadership admin tue 13 jan 2026 1547 signing of mou with piramal foundation for education leadership thu 25 apr 2024 1200 delhi capacity building commission new delhi signing of mou with piramal foundation for education leadership  ', 0),
(779, 'en', 'node_search', ' brainstorming session with the team of national informatics centre meity nic lead by dg nic ceo unique identification authority of india uidai sh amit agrawal brainstorming session with the team of national informatics centre meity nic lead by dg nic ceo unique identification authority of india uidai sh amit agrawal admin tue 13 jan 2026 1549 cbc was delighted to welcome the team of national informatics centre meity nic lead by dg nic ceo unique identification authority of india uidai sh amit agrawal the brainstorming session focused around capacity building hr transformation knowledge management change management technology integration nic is the key enabler of technology driven solutions for central and state governments cbc is glad to support nic in this journey mon 13 may 2024 1200 capacity building commission new delhi brainstorming session with the team of national informatics centre meity nic lead by dg nic ceo unique identification authority of india uidai sh amit agrawal  ', 0),
(780, 'en', 'node_search', ' cbc launched national karmayogi seva bhaav program with participation from multiple ministries departments cbc launched national karmayogi seva bhaav program with participation from multiple ministries departments admin tue 13 jan 2026 1550 capacity building commission today launched the national karmayogi seva bhaav program with participation from more than 15 ministries departments of the government of india phase 1 of this program will build the capacity of officers of the entire secretariat of the government of india in the next 3 months covering all 93 ministries and departments the impact of governance should be felt by the citizens of the last mile with the focus on changing mindsets this program will ensure that all officers go through 1 day of training on building karmayogi competencies and mindsets and operating like a karmayogi supported by the knowledge partner the trainers will be created from the nominated dss directors of the mdo who will bring the right context and experience to the training cbc aims to ensure that the national karmayogi seva bhaav program will catalyse and rekindle the spirit of janbhagidari to help india achieve the goal of viksit bharat as envisioned by the hon ble prime minister shri narendra modi thu 12 sep 2024 1200 karmayogi bharat new delhi cbc launched national karmayogi seva bhaav program with participation from multiple ministries departments ', 0),
(781, 'en', 'node_search', ' workshop on enhancing leadership communication skills of cpse executives workshop on enhancing leadership communication skills of cpse executives admin tue 13 jan 2026 1551 we just ended the communication workshop for cpse finance executives which was attended by 30 executives from 15 cpses 15 analysts and investors dipam officers each executive got a chance to get one on one coaching on their analyst presentation and had to do the presentation 3 times in front of a panel of communications coaches analysts investors dipam officers the 2 days were intense but the workshop went off very well kudos to the cbc team e y initium and dipam for making this happen every participant thought it was a very good training workshop thu 6 jun 2024 1200 vigyan bhawan new delhi workshop on enhancing leadership communication skills of cpse executives  ', 0),
(782, 'en', 'node_search', ' secretary cbc addressed the group of civil servants from gamibia at national centre for good governance secretary cbc addressed the group of civil servants from gamibia at national centre for good governance admin tue 13 jan 2026 1552 secretary cbc addressed the group of civil servants from gamibia at national centre for good governance who are in india as part of their mid career training program the group was informed about the achievements under mission karmayogi focussing on building competencies to enable the shift from rule to role based performance citizen centric and groomed to be tech enabled and future ready fri 7 jun 2024 1200 delhi national centre for good governance old jnu campus new delhi secretary cbc addressed the group of civil servants from gamibia at national centre for good governance  ', 0),
(783, 'en', 'node_search', ' celeberating teachers day celeberating teachers day admin tue 13 jan 2026 1554 गुरु ब्रह्मा गुरु विष्णु गुरु देवो महेश्वरा गुरु साक्षात परब्रह्म तस्मै श्री गुरुवे नमः at the core of mission karmayogi is continuous learning and competencydriven capacity building it envisions a futureready civil service rooted in indian ethos with a global perspective key teachers in the civil service capacity building ecosystem in india are our civil service training institutions cstis and the igot karmayogi platform shouldering the responsibility of teaching and training 31 lakh karmayogis on this teachers day the commission extends its heartfelt thanks and celebrates the dedicated faculty of all 800 cstis who play a pivotal role in shaping the future of our nation s governance your commitment to excellence and passion for imparting knowledge and empowering our civil servants with the skills and insights necessary for effective public service is commendable as we reflect on these invaluable contributions we also acknowledge the pivotal role of the igot karmayogi platform in facilitating anytimeanywhere learning ensuring that every civil servant has access to essential resources and guidance for their professional development the platform boasts over 43 million registered civil servants 1100 digital courses and 11 million courses completed the teachings on igot not only impart knowledge but also instill the values that make a true public servant together these efforts cultivate a culture of lifelong learning and excellence in public administration the contributions of cstis and the igot platform have been instrumental in advancing the competencydriven capacitybuilding goals of mission karmayogi taking inspiration from dr radhakrishnan s teachings the end of all education should be the betterment of the individual and society this spirit embodies the mission of shaping future leaders who will work towards citizencentric effective and efficient public service delivery thu 5 sep 2024 1200 celeberating teachers day ', 0),
(784, 'en', 'node_search', ' cbc had discussions with officials from state govt of orissa to spearhead mission karmayogi cbc had discussions with officials from state govt of orissa to spearhead mission karmayogi admin tue 13 jan 2026 1555 as part of working with states the capacity building commission team had discussions with officials from the state of odisha to spearhead mission karmayogi in the state and onboard officials for the capacity building process at the state and local levels the meeting was attended by the chief secretary of odisha shri manoj ahuja ias shri surendra kumar ias additional chief secretary smt anu garg ias development commissioner g mathi vathanan ias dg gopabandhu academy of administration shri manish agarwal ias additional dg and other senior officials very fruitful discussions took place leading to concrete action plans thu 29 aug 2024 1200 orissa cbc had discussions with officials from state govt of orissa to spearhead mission karmayogi ', 0),
(785, 'en', 'node_search', ' cbc had discussion with govt of andhra pradesh to spearhead mission karmayogi cbc had discussion with govt of andhra pradesh to spearhead mission karmayogi admin tue 13 jan 2026 1559 capacity building commission along with karmayogi bharat has been enhancing capacity building for central civil servants for the last two years recently cbc met with andhra pradesh cm nara chandrababu naidu and his team in amravati to extend the benefits of capacity building to all 45 lakh civil servants across all levels the cm s vision for andhra pradesh necessitates every civil servant s contribution to the state s gdp and citizens ease of living r balasubramaniam rakesh verma and s p roy led the discussions with andhra pradesh cm chandrababu naidu and his team in amravati aiming to establish a model for capacity building that could benefit all states capacity building commission and karmayogi bharat are committed to supporting andhra in this mission and pioneering the measurement of the impact of these efforts alongside capacity building tue 13 aug 2024 1200 amravati andhra pradesh cbc had discussion with govt of andhra pradesh to spearhead mission karmayogi ', 0),
(786, 'en', 'node_search', ' csti convention 2024 at vigyan bhawan on 12th august 2024 csti convention 2024 at vigyan bhawan on 12th august 2024 admin tue 13 jan 2026 1603 the capacity building commission successfully organized the csti convention 2024 at vigyan bhawan on 12th august 2024 bringing together all civil service training institutions cstis accredited under the national standards for civil service training institutions nscsti at this convention 144 accredited cstis were awarded certificates in the presence of the chief guest hon ble mos dr jitendra singh recognizing their collective commitment to excellence in civil service capacity building addressing the gathering hon ble mos remarked we have accredited over 140 training institutes and each accreditation represents a step towards a more competent efficient and responsive civil service the commission extends its heartfelt congratulations to all accredited cstis and our esteemed partners during the convention hon mos also launched three significant initiatives the faculty development program amrit gyaan kosh and quality improvement program all dedicated to fostering continuous learning and competencydriven capacity building among cstis digimanthan 20 resulted in institutions committing to digitalising 300 courses for the igot karmayogi platform the commission expresses its deep gratitude to hon mos pp dr jitendra singh all participants and our distinguished speakers for making this event a resounding success mon 12 aug 2024 1200 vigyan bhawan new delhi csti convention 2024 at vigyan bhawan on 12th august 2024 ', 0),
(787, 'en', 'node_search', ' signed an mou for collaboration on various capacitybuilding initiatives signed an mou for collaboration on various capacitybuilding initiatives admin tue 13 jan 2026 1607 capacity building commission cbc and centre for effective governance of indian states signed an mou for collaboration on various capacitybuilding initiatives for the various departments of the government of india fri 28 jun 2024 1200 capacity building commission cbc new delhi signed an mou for collaboration on various capacitybuilding initiatives ', 0),
(788, 'en', 'node_search', ' yoga day celebration at cbc yoga day celebration at cbc admin tue 13 jan 2026 1609 the international day of yoga has been celebrated across the world annually on june 21 since 2015 this year the theme for international day of yoga is yoga for self and society yoga a transformative practice represents the harmony of mind and body the balance between thought and action and the unity of restraint and fulfillment it integrates the body mind spirit and soul offering a holistic approach to health and wellbeing that brings peace to our hectic lives its power to transform is what we celebrate on this special day fri 21 jun 2024 1200 cbc new delhi yoga day celebration at cbc ', 0),
(789, 'en', 'node_search', ' presenting a draft copy of the karmayogi competency model kcm  presenting a draft copy of the karmayogi competency model kcm admin tue 13 jan 2026 1611 today cbc leadership called on shri jitendra singh union mos ind charge science technology earth sciences mos pmo pp dopt atomic energy space they also presented a draft copy of the karmayogicompetencymodel kcm which is the first indigenous public hr management model developed in the country and will be of global standards at par with other competency models across the world it s always a pleasure to get inspiration for missionkarmayogi from him thu 20 jun 2024 1200 presenting a draft copy of the karmayogi competency model kcm  ', 0),
(790, 'en', 'node_search', ' induction session for 11 program coordinators karmayogi sarthis  induction session for 11 program coordinators karmayogi sarthis admin tue 13 jan 2026 1613 in another milestone cbc hosted the induction session for 11 program coordinators karmayogi sarthis in new delhi on june 11 2024 piramal foundation members especially ceo aditya natraj and director saurabh johri along with representatives from various ministries departments and organizations mdos graced the occasion cbc leadership including chairman mr adil zainulbhai members dr alka mittal dr r balasubramaniam and secretary mr s p roy were delighted to interact with the karmayogi sarthis along with the mdo s to bring them up to speed on various activities of cbc and expectation of the mdo s these young dynamic and dedicated program coordinators will play a pivotal role in enhancing capacitybuilding and fostering collaboration within various mdos as part of missionkarmayogi they will assist the capacity building unit cbu team in implementing the annual capacity plan enforcing karmayogi guidelines and supporting the central civil service training institutions in onboarding the accreditation framework tue 11 jun 2024 1200 new delhi induction session for 11 program coordinators karmayogi sarthis  ', 0),
