(862, 'en', 'node_search', ' rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program rashtriya karmyogi largescale jan seva program vision this program aims to instill a deeper sense of seva bhaav  spirit of service and svadharma  duty aligned with personal purpose among civil servants drawing from the karmyogi competency framework the program seeks to realign officers inner purpose with their publicfacing roles fostering values that enhance responsiveness accountability and service excellence important information registration guidelines for igot important documents how to access on igot video objective the primary objective of this initiative is to awaken seva bhav  sense of service in central government employees which is critical to serve the citizens this will lead to  improved citizen services enhanced quality and responsiveness in public service delivery better collaboration improved responsiveness and collaboration across government departments work satisfaction enhancing one s work satisfaction and sense of fulfilment at work program content program overview in this program participants will rediscover their inner power as rashtriya karmyogis it is a 1day program  where participants will go through 4 modules  these modules are not lecturebased but are highly interactive they are designed to enable reflective discussions experience sharing teamwork to build answers together and building shared vision together 1 module 1 we explore the qualities and behaviours of a karmyogi 2 module 2 we explore the motivations and inner purpose of a karmyogi 3 module 3 we learn how to integrate sevabhav into every aspect of our work life 4 module 4 we understand our role in terms of national goals and serving all stakeholders better endofprogram assessment module duration each module is approximately 15 hours 24 reinforcement units collective learning units  samuhik charchas group discussions in teams sections departments the program will be followed by 30 collective learning units that participants will receive one at a time on a learning app pedgog over the weeks that follow these units will enable samuhik charchas to be held in the respective teams sections department over time  chronology of events pilot phases    november 2024 january 2025 phase 1 training of master trainers director deputy secretary level from secretariats of all central ministries in delhi 10 batches conducted training 278 master trainers from 85 ministries and departments  january 2025 may 2025 phase i  master trainers trained over 17000 officials from their respective ministries departments through the trainthetrainer t3 cascade model  april 2025 onwards phase 2 immersive workshop for senior officers secretaries addl secretaries and joint secretaries at sushma swaraj bhavan new delhi selection and training of lead trainers begins may 2025 january 2026 lead trainers cascade the 3day training to develop 1500020000 master trainers these trainers further train over 950000 central government employees across india  till 22012026 over 16000 karmyogi coaches have been trained in phase 2 these trainers have further cascaded the training to over 95 lakh civil servants implementation strategy trainthetrainer t3 approach rashtriya karmyogi jan seva adopts a trainthetrainer t3  approach by equipping selected instructors with essential skills the program empowers them to train others within their respective organizations cascade model benefits this cascade model not only provides trainers with valuable opportunities for professional development but also ensures that the training remains contextually relevant while maintaining consistency across the curriculum the implementation of the rashtriya karmyogi intervention will involve two phases  phase i delhi secretariat for around 17000 central government employees in secretariats of all central ministries in delhi target 15000 personnel 86 mdos jan may 2025 phase ii countrywide for around 700000 central government employees across the country target 700000 personnel across india may 2025 onwards phase 1 the first phase of this intervention is proposed to cover officers and officials of the rank of director deputy secretary under secretary section officers assistant section officers government multi tasking staff from secretariats of ministries departments of the central government in delhi 10 batches conducted 278 master trainers 86 ministries departments 17000  officials trained implementation of phase 1 the capacity building commission cbc successfully conducted 10 batches of the rashtriya karmyogi large scale jan seva program training for master trainers in january march 2025  under this largescale behavioural training program  278 officers were trained as master trainers from 86 ministries and departments of central government these trainers have trained over 17000 officials from their respective ministries department phase 2 the second phase of the program takes this training to each office in the government of india spread across the country it aims to impart behavioural training to officers and officials of the rank of director deputy secretary under secretary section officers assistant section officers government multi tasking staff across government offices of india 822 days lead trainers trained 16000  karmyogi coaches trained 95 lakh officials trained immersive workshop it began with an immersive workshop for senior officers secretaries addl secretaries of the government of india at sushma swaraj bhavan new delhi  it aimed to provide an overview to senior officials of the rashtriya karmyogi program its core vision structure modules and seek leadership inputs on how to effectively implement phase ii of the program lead trainers karmyogi coaches lead trainers were nominated from each ministry department and organisations under their administrative control to undergo an intensive 5day trainthetrainer program these lead trainers were then responsible for training karmyogi coaches  master trainers through 3day training sessions  within their respective mdos more than 16500 karmyogi coaches have been trained in phase ii till 22022026  5 days lead trainer training 3 days karmyogi coach training 1 day end participant training ground delivery the groundlevel delivery of the programme is managed by the karmyogi coaches master trainers   they conducted the 1day training program for officials officers within their respective mdos in batches of 3035 participants this comprehensive cascade framework enabled the program to reach over 950000 central government employees across india ensuring consistent delivery and widespread behavioural transformation  phase 2 implementation flow   95 lakh officials  over 95 lakh participants were trained under the phase ii oneday training program by 22nd january 2026  admin fri 23 jan 2026 1458  ', 0),
