(895, 'en', 'node_search', ' punjab statelevel momentum under mission karmayogi punjab statelevel momentum under mission karmayogi adarsh thu 29 jan 2026 1738 aienabled capacity building plans capacity building commission in coordination with mahatma gandhi state institute of public administration mgsipa conducted the aienabled capacity building plan cbp workshop 1516 january 2026 under mission karmayogi over two days departments moved from planning to implementation 48 departments participated 10 departments developed cbps 5 departments successfully made their cbps live on the igot karmayogi platform 33 departments were oriented to complete their cbps at the earliest the sessions were guided by senior leadership whose insights set both direction and momentum smt chandralekha mukherjee highlighted the transformative potential of mission karmayogi in shifting civil services from a rulebased to a rolebased approach she emphasized that clearly defined roles supported by targeted competency development would enable officials to become more effective productive and responsive in addressing citizens needs mr gulshan executive director mgsipa shared the simplicity and usability of the aienabled cbp tool noting that it not only supports structured training planning but also helps departments strategically utilize their existing resources for competency development col dalbir singh training director mgsipa provided sustained operational leadership reinforcing the importance of systematic and executable training plans the workshop was facilitated by ms zainab naaz and ms akanksha mahapatro programme coordinators who led handson demonstrations and ensured seamless support for departments transitioning their cbps to the igot platform this milestone marks a significant step in institutionalising technologyenabled rolespecific and futureready capacity building at the state level strengthening the foundations of mission karmayogi through action ownership and implementation fri 16 jan 2026 1200 punjab statelevel momentum under mission karmayogi ', 0),
(896, 'en', 'node_search', ' convocation ceremony at administrative staff college of india asci hyderabad convocation ceremony at administrative staff college of india asci hyderabad adarsh thu 29 jan 2026 1746 smt s radha chauhan chairperson  capacity building commission urged graduates to align their professional efforts with the national vision of viksit bharat and highlighted the disruptive yet transformative power of artificial intelligence she emphasized that ai must be managed with a focus on ethics equity and inclusion to prevent widening the digital divide she was addressing the convocation ceremony at administrative staff college of india asci   hyderabad sat 17 jan 2026 1200 convocation ceremony at administrative staff college of india asci hyderabad ', 0),
(897, 'en', 'node_search', ' capacity building of state meeting at hyderabad capacity building of state meeting at hyderabad adarsh thu 29 jan 2026 1750 smt s radha chauhan chairperson capacity building commission cbc and smt santhi kumari vice chairperson director general dr marri channa reddy human resource development institute of telangana mcrhrdit held an interaction focusing on capacity building of state at hyderabad today during the deliberations the ati highlighted multiple areas reflecting innovative progress wherein domain expertise has been identified for curating digital content and converting the same into structured digital courses chairperson cbc underscored the critical importance of formulation and implementation of capacity building plans cbps by all state departments reiterating the emphasis laid during the meeting of chief secretaries that every state department must have a cbp in place the chairperson cbc further highlighted the need for integration of training data with hrms systems enabling effective personalisation of learning pathways for officials she urged the ati to supplement the competency gaps identified through cbps by aligning and delivering appropriate training programmes including blended learning thereby facilitating a transition from a supplydriven to a demanddriven training ecosystem smt s radha chauhan also assured continued guidance and support to the ati in strengthening its capabilities in emerging technology domains as part of ongoing capacitybuilding efforts the interaction concluded with a campus tour during which the chairperson cbc was apprised of the institute s infrastructure including training halls labs sports facilities and the women shgrun canteen operating within the campus fri 16 jan 2026 1200 capacity building of state meeting at hyderabad ', 0),
