(950, 'en', 'node_search', ' sadhana saptah sadhana saptah function find the base url of the cbc theme by looking at any alreadyloaded theme stylesheet eg homecss loaded by drupal globally function getthemebase var links documentqueryselectorall link rel stylesheet for var i  i 📋 registration link 🏛️ igot karmayogi  about saptah india s governance landscape is being reshaped by rapid technological change renewed attention to indian knowledge systems and an increasing focus on citizen centricity saptah is conceived as a themefocused sectoranchored exercise sector classification as per sgos to strengthen governance capability across ministries departments organisations mdo and states the structure of the week shall be focused on three themes or sutras  technology tradition tangible outcomes  the week coincides with the foundation day of cbc and completion of five years of mission karmayogi providing an opportunity to review progress while strengthening the national capacitybuilding ecosystem through a blended delivery model comprising karmayogi talks by domain experts samuhik charchas within institutions digital learning through the igot platform interministerial workshops and training programmes conducted by civil services training institutions the initiative will engage civil servants across the government ecosystem participation will extend across 93 central ministries and departments 30 states and uts implementing mission karmayogi and more than 200 civil services training institutions  supported through coordinated institutional mechanisms led by cbc beyond a week of learning engagements saptah aims to reinforce a culture of continuous learning in government accelerate engagement with the digital learning ecosystem strengthen knowledge exchange across institutions and generate insights for strengthening the broader capacitybuilding architecture under mission karmayogi 🤖 technology ai and emerging technologies transforming the sector sectorspecific ai use cases re